uced from 3 to 2.',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(293,3648,'WooCommerce','woocommerce@boardgames.com','','','2016-09-29 14:06:11','2016-09-29 21:06:11','Item 3446 stock reduced from 6 to 5.',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(294,1597,'fidMaB','Pangilinan@msn.com','http://0PoloAS0Ux3M2RXeSy.to','88.150.131.195','2016-10-03 05:40:39','2016-10-03 12:40:39','568237 488163This really is a excellent weblog. Maintain up all of the function. I too enjoy to weblog. This really is excellent everybody sharing opinions 211343',0,'trash','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows; U; Win 9x 4.90; de; rv:1.8.1.20) Gecko/20081217 Firefox/2.0.0.20','',0,0),(295,3648,'WooCommerce','woocommerce@boardgames.com','','','2016-10-04 13:09:04','2016-10-04 20:09:04','Items shipped via USPS on October 4, 2016 with tracking number 9534615636836274015804.',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(296,3648,'WooCommerce','woocommerce@boardgames.com','','','2016-10-04 13:09:05','2016-10-04 20:09:05','Order status changed from Processing to Completed.',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(297,3654,'WooCommerce','woocommerce@boardgames.com','','','2016-10-04 15:44:55','2016-10-04 22:44:55','PDT payment completed',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(298,3654,'WooCommerce','woocommerce@boardgames.com','','','2016-10-04 15:44:55','2016-10-04 22:44:55','Order status changed from Pending Payment to Processing.',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(299,3654,'WooCommerce','woocommerce@boardgames.com','','','2016-10-04 15:44:56','2016-10-04 22:44:56','Item 3323 stock reduced from 8 to 7.',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(300,3654,'WooCommerce','woocommerce@boardgames.com','','','2016-10-04 15:44:58','2016-10-04 22:44:58','IPN payment completed',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(301,3654,'WooCommerce','woocommerce@boardgames.com','','','2016-10-06 11:24:49','2016-10-06 18:24:49','Refunded 12.92 - Refund ID: 0DA591644G289023J',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(302,3654,'WooCommerce','woocommerce@boardgames.com','','','2016-10-06 11:24:49','2016-10-06 18:24:49','Order status changed from Processing to Refunded.',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(303,3689,'WooCommerce','woocommerce@boardgames.com','','','2016-10-07 12:05:42','2016-10-07 19:05:42','Unpaid order cancelled - time limit reached. Order status changed from Pending Payment to Cancelled.',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(304,3690,'WooCommerce','woocommerce@boardgames.com','','','2016-10-07 14:18:27','2016-10-07 21:18:27','Unpaid order cancelled - time limit reached. Order status changed from Pending Payment to Cancelled.',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(305,3691,'WooCommerce','woocommerce@boardgames.com','','','2016-10-07 14:23:36','2016-10-07 21:23:36','Unpaid order cancelled - time limit reached. Order status changed from Pending Payment to Cancelled.',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(306,3343,'ActionScheduler','','','','2016-10-10 16:50:33','2016-10-10 21:50:33','action started',0,'1','ActionScheduler','action_log',0,0),(307,3343,'ActionScheduler','','','','2016-10-10 16:50:33','2016-10-10 21:50:33','action complete',0,'1','ActionScheduler','action_log',0,0),(308,3712,'ActionScheduler','','','','2016-10-11 00:09:13','2016-10-11 05:09:13','action created',0,'1','ActionScheduler','action_log',0,0),(309,3713,'WooCommerce','woocommerce@boardgames.com','','','2016-10-11 10:43:56','2016-10-11 17:43:56','Unpaid order cancelled - time limit reached. Order status changed from Pending Payment to Cancelled.',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(310,3325,'Derek','derek@allovertheboard.com','','70.179.47.214','2016-10-12 07:42:03','2016-10-12 14:42:03','Star Realms is easily one of my favorite deck building games because of its quick turns, balanced gameplay and simplcity.  The games go relatively quickly, and the game is pretty cheap.  Additionally, you can buy a second starting deck like this one (or the base set) and go up to 4 players.  Its really cool to see how they figured out how to include all the things you need (instructions, health counters) into the same deck of cards.  Easy to transport!\r\n\r\nThough the fundamentals are simple, the choices you make each turn are pretty fun without having to overthink anything on a deep strategic level.  Needless to say, I could go for more Star Realms - in fact, quite excited about White Wizards latest fantasy-themed release Hero Realms.\r\n\r\nThis expansion is stand-alone and adds a ton of great new cards with great artwork.  Fully approve.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 6.1; WOW64; rv:49.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/49.0','',0,123),(311,3323,'Derek','derek@allovertheboard.com','','70.179.47.214','2016-10-12 07:44:20','2016-10-12 14:44:20','I\'m a huge Star Realms fan and I highly suggest you pick up the core set or the follow-up core set Colony Wars.  Great deckbuilding game with fast and fun gameplay.\r\n\r\nI only gave this expansion 4 stars because I feel like the gambits themselves didn\'t alter the gameplay very much, but it did make the same game a little more interesting.  If you like Star Realms, get this.  Its worth the buy because its so cheap and adds a new mechanic of sorts to an already great game.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 6.1; WOW64; rv:49.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/49.0','',0,123),(312,2928,'Derek','derek@allovertheboard.com','','70.179.47.214','2016-10-12 08:21:42','2016-10-12 15:21:42','I just had a chance for the first time last night to play Mystic Vale.  I had heart a lot about this new \"card-building\" mechanic, so I was excited to give it a try.\r\n\r\nIt was great!  The production on these cards was very high in quality, and the new mechanic of being able to craft cards for your deck as you play the game (each \'whole\' card can be comprised of 3 different card \'pieces\' that slide in together into a clear sleeve).was really fun.\r\n\r\nOverall I\'d have to say that this game is a solid, relatively simple to learn and play deck builder with gorgeous artwork..  Gameplay was pretty quick and thoroughly enjoyable with just the right blend of basic strategy, pretty things to look at, and a few decisions to make every turn about which cards you want to upgrade next.\r\n\r\nI\'ve heard there\'s an expansion that came out and would love to see some new mechanics added to this game without overdoing it.  Definitely recommended.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 6.1; WOW64; rv:49.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/49.0','',0,123),(313,2701,'Derek','derek@allovertheboard.com','','70.179.47.214','2016-10-12 08:26:09','2016-10-12 15:26:09','I\'ve only played one other version of Love Letter, but I have to say that this one is my favorite by far.  I\'m an extreme nerd for Adventure Time, and grabbing its take on Love Letter was a no brainer.\r\n\r\nLove Letter is an extremely simple game in which you and other players are competing against one-another to get your Love Letters to the princess first.  The game rules itself could probably have been themed a million ways, but it works well enough.  If you want a simple game that anybody could pick up and enjoy that is easy to take with you, Love Letter is a great choice.  Many people consider Love Letter a 5 star game, which it certainly deserves.  However I\'m into heavier games so I have to toss it a 4.  Great game to play with my friends who aren\'t into boards gaming that much, or if the group can\'t pay too much attention around a table of beer etc.\r\n\r\nThe Adventure Time version has amazing artwork and components - really well done production.  Would buy again.\r\n\r\nGunther\'s art is priceless.',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 6.1; WOW64; rv:49.0) Gecko/20100101 Firefox/49.0','',0,123),(314,3719,'WooCommerce','woocommerce@boardgames.com','','','2016-10-12 13:25:23','2016-10-12 20:25:23','Order status changed from Pending Payment to Processing.',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(315,3719,'WooCommerce','woocommerce@boardgames.com','','','2016-10-12 13:25:23','2016-10-12 20:25:23','Item BGM0003 stock reduced from 10 to 9.',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(316,3719,'boardgamesdev','derek@boardgames.com','','','2016-10-12 13:26:00','2016-10-12 20:26:00','Order status changed from Processing to Completed.',0,'1','WooCommerce','order_note',0,0),(317,1586,'lyndsey','lyndsey@boardgames.com','','38.140.110.34','2016-10-12 15:43:39','2016-10-12 22:43:39','Hi Cathy,   sounds like your due for a family game night!  \r\nTry Telestrations: https://boardgames.com/buy/telestrations/\r\n\r\nCamel Cup\r\nhttps://boardgames.com/buy/camel-up/\r\n\r\nOr \r\n\r\nFluxx \r\nhttps://boardgames.com/buy/fluxx/',0,'1','Mozilla/5.0 (Macintosh; Intel Mac OS X 10_11_1) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/53.0.2785.143 Safari/537.36','',260,5);
