ll wp-image-1685\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/integrityicon.png\" alt=\"integrityicon\" width=\"41\" height=\"41\" /></h3>\r\nIf for any reason you’re not happy, we’ll do everything in our power to make it right. You have our word.\r\n\r\n[/cm]\r\n[cm cl=\"one-fourth last\"]\r\n<h3>SERVICE <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1682\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/serviceicon.png\" alt=\"serviceicon\" width=\"37\" height=\"37\" /></h3>\r\nWe strive everyday to deliver “Service Beyond Expectation” by going above and beyond for our customers.\r\n<h3>COMMUNITY <img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1684\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/communityicon.png\" alt=\"communityicon\" width=\"37\" height=\"37\" /></h3>\r\nBoardGames.com offers discount games for schools and our team regularly volunteers in our community.\r\n[/cm]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n[cm cl=\"section section-1\"]\r\n<h3 class=\"bord\"><span class=\"a\">About Board Games:</span></h3>\r\n<div class=\"one-fifth\">\r\n<div><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-466\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/money-icon.jpg\" alt=\"money-icon\" width=\"46\" height=\"54\" /></div>\r\n<h4>Board Game Bucks</h4>\r\nEarn Free board Game\r\nBucks with every order\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"one-fifth\">\r\n<div><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-468\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/selection-icon.jpg\" alt=\"selection-icon\" width=\"46\" height=\"54\" /></div>\r\n<h4>Great Selection</h4>\r\nThe hottest new games,\r\nplus more added daily\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"one-fifth\">\r\n<div><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-470\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/box-icon.jpg\" alt=\"box-icon\" width=\"46\" height=\"54\" /></div>\r\n<h4>Shipping Specials</h4>\r\nFree shipping on over\r\n$75 &amp; weekly specials.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"one-fifth\">\r\n<div><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-469\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/tag-icon.jpg\" alt=\"tag-icon\" width=\"46\" height=\"54\" /></div>\r\n<h4>Low Prices</h4>\r\nAll our games are always\r\n15% off MSRP prices!\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"one-fifth last\">\r\n<div><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-467\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/04/playersclub-icon.jpg\" alt=\"playersclub-icon\" width=\"46\" height=\"54\" /></div>\r\n<h4>Players Club</h4>\r\nJoin our Players Club for\r\nspecial deals &amp; games.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n[/cm]\r\n\r\n[cm cl=\"section section-2\"]\r\n<h3 class=\"bord\"><span class=\"a\">For Gamers by Gamers:</span></h3>\r\n<div class=\"one-fifth\" align=\"center\">\r\n<div><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1690\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/matticon.png\" alt=\"matticon\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></div>\r\n<b>Matt Leitz</b>\r\nCEO\r\nFavorite Game\r\n<a href=\"/buy/catan/\">Settlers of Catan</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"one-fifth\" align=\"center\">\r\n<div><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1693\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/dzimicon.png\" alt=\"dzimicon\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></div>\r\n<b>Derek Zimmermann</b>\r\nCTO\r\nFavorite Game\r\n<a href=\"#\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Dominion</span></a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"one-fifth\" align=\"center\">\r\n<div><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1692\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/dannyicon.png\" alt=\"dannyicon\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></div>\r\n<b>Danny Nareau</b>\r\nCOO\r\nFavorite Game\r\n<a href=\"#\">Betrayal at House on the Hill</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"one-fifth\" align=\"center\">\r\n<div><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1689\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/lyndseyicon.png\" alt=\"lyndseyicon\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></div>\r\n<b>Lyndsey Merryman</b>\r\nCreative Director\r\nFavorite Game\r\n<a href=\"#\">Cash N Guns</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"one-fifth last\" align=\"center\">\r\n<div><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1691\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/andrewicon.png\" alt=\"andrewicon\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" /></div>\r\n<b>Andrew Mayfield</b>\r\nContent Manager\r\nFavorite Game\r\n<a href=\"#\">Discworld: Ankh-Morpork</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n[/cm]\r\n[cm is=\"background:#03BCF4; color: #fff;padding: 2%;line-height: 1.3;text-align:center;font-size:18px\"]\r\n“You can discover more about a person in an hour of play than in a year of conversation.”\r\n<b>- Plato </b>\r\n[/cm]\r\n\r\n[cm cl=\"section section-4\"]\r\n<div class=\"sec-half\" style=\"background: #F9F9F9; padding-top: 8%;\" align=\"center\">\r\n<h4 class=\"sayhe\">SAY HELLO: <img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-1709\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/messageicon.png\" alt=\"messageicon\" width=\"82\" height=\"63\" /></h4>\r\n<b>Our team of board game experts are here to help, we know all about board games!</b>\r\n\r\n<b style=\"color: #fa3c1c;\">BOARD GAME HOTLINE: 1-800-313-PLAY</b>\r\nor\r\n<a href=\"/contact/\">Go here to drop us an email</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"sec-half\" style=\"background: #D8F9FF;\">\r\n\r\n<img class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-1708\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/06/jointhebgcommunity.png\" alt=\"jointhebgcommunity\" width=\"327\" height=\"86\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1703\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/blue-pawn.png\" alt=\"blue-pawn\" width=\"18\" height=\"24\" /><b>Earn Board Game Bucks on every purchase</b>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1706\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/yellowpawn.png\" alt=\"yellowpawn\" width=\"18\" height=\"24\" /><b>Receive the Board Games Weekly Newsletter</b>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1704\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/purpleicon.png\" alt=\"purpleicon\" width=\"18\" height=\"24\" /><b>Share the games you Love, Own and Want</b>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1705\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/redpawn.png\" alt=\"redpawn\" width=\"18\" height=\"24\" /><b>Free copy of the 2015 Board Gamer\'s Guide</b>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1703\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/blue-pawn.png\" alt=\"blue-pawn\" width=\"18\" height=\"24\" /><b>Earn BG Points for writing reviews and more</b>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1706\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/yellowpawn.png\" alt=\"yellowpawn\" width=\"18\" height=\"24\" /><b>Get HUGE discounts on the Deal of the week</b>\r\n<p align=\"center\"><b style=\"font-size: 24px;\">It\'s Free!</b>\r\n<a class=\"btn orange\" href=\"#\">Click to Join BoardGames.com!</a></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n[/cm]\r\n<h3 class=\"bord\"><span class=\"a\">Our Favorite Games:</span></h3>\r\n[brgm_slider]\r\n\r\n</div>','About BoardGames.com','','publish','closed','closed','','about','','','2016-08-11 01:02:41','2016-08-11 01:02:41','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=1668',0,'page','',0),(1679,1,'2016-05-31 21:37:04','2016-05-31 21:37:04','<p>[text* your-name placeholder \"Name:\"] </p>\r\n\r\n<p>[email* your-email placeholder \"Email:\"] </p>\r\n\r\n<p>[tel phone-num placeholder \"Phone Number:\"] </p>\r\n\r\n<p>[textarea your-message placeholder \"Enter your message here:\"] </p>\r\n<p>\r\n[submit class:btn class:orange \"SEND\"]\r\n[recaptcha]\r\n</p>\nContact Form Submission From [your-name]\n[your-name] <noreply@boardgames.com>\nMessage received from the Contact Us page:\r\nName: [your-name]\r\nEmail: [your-email]\r\nTel: [phone-num]\r\n[your-message]\nplay@boardgames.com\nSender: noreply@boardgames.com\nReply-To: [your-name] <[your-email]>\n\n1\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThank you for your message. It has been sent.\nThere was an error trying to send your message. Please try again later.\nOne or more fields have an error. Please check and try again.\nThere was an error trying to send your message. Please try again later.\nYou must accept the terms and conditions before sending your message.\nThe field is required.\nThe field is too long.\nThe field is too short.\nThe date format is incorrect.\nThe date is before the earliest one allowed.\nThe date is after the latest one allowed.\nThere was an unknown error uploading the file.\nYou are not allowed to upload files of this type.\nThe file is too big.\nThere was an error uploading the file.\nThe number format is invalid.\nThe number is smaller than the minimum allowed.\nThe number is larger than the maximum allowed.\nThe answer to the quiz is incorrect.\nYour entered code is incorrect.\nThe e-mail address entered is invalid.\nThe URL is invalid.\nThe telephone number is invalid.','Contact Form','','publish','closed','closed','','contact-form-1','','','2016-08-29 13:49:21','2016-08-29 20:49:21','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?post_type=wpcf7_contact_form&#038;p=1679',0,'wpcf7_contact_form','',0),(1721,2,'2016-05-28 18:28:50','2016-05-28 18:28:50','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\r\n\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[brgm-weekly]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"three-fourths last\">\r\n<h2>BG Stamps of Approval:</h2>\r\nWe’ve curated 25 unique lists of board game to give you the best of what you want.  Discover board games with amazing artwork, unique themes or even games that are geek approved!\r\n\r\n[brmg_tax parent=\"76\" column=\"4\" type=\"data\"]\r\n<h3 class=\"bord\"><span class=\"a\">Featured Games:</span></h3>\r\n[brgm_slider featured=\"yes\"]\r\n\r\n</div>','BG Approved Board Game Lists','','publish','closed','closed','','approved','','','2016-08-05 05:14:07','2016-08-05 05:14:07','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=1721',0,'page','',0),(1731,2,'2016-05-28 19:40:22','2016-05-28 19:40:22','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\r\n\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[brgm-weekly]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"three-fourths last\">\r\n<h2>Frequently Ask Questions</h2>\r\n<b>What do I do if my game arrived damaged or missing components?</b>\r\n\r\nOpen a support ticket <a href=\"/contact\"><b>here</b></a> and we’ll get you sorted.\r\n\r\n<b>Can I apply multiple coupon codes to a single order?</b>\r\n\r\nSorry, nope! Limited to one coupon / gift certificate per order.\r\n\r\n<b>I am an international customer, do you ship international and how do I get a shipping quote?</b>\r\n\r\nWe do! You have find specifics <strong><a href=\"/international-orders/\">here</a></strong>.\r\n\r\n<b>I haven’t received my order confirmation email, what should I do?</b>\r\n\r\nClick <strong><a href=\"/contact\">here</a></strong> and we’ll send you another.\r\n\r\n<b>How do I use my Board Game Bucks?</b>\r\n\r\nAdd the items(s) to your shopping cart and at check out apply the Board Game Bucks in the Coupon section.\r\n\r\n<b>Will you hold my order for “Out of Stock” items?</b>\r\n\r\nNo but you can add it to your wishlist and we’ll notify you when it’s back in stock!\r\n\r\n<b>Do you accept phone, fax or mail orders?</b>\r\n\r\nAt this time we only accept online orders.\r\n\r\n<b>I was charged multiple times for a single order, what do I do?</b>\r\n\r\nOpen a support ticket *here* and we’ll sort it out.\r\n\r\n<b>I don’t like the game I ordered, can I return it and get a refund?</b>\r\n\r\nYes. Learn more on our “Returns” page.\r\n\r\n<b>Do you have a Brick and Mortar store?</b>\r\n\r\nWe do not. We like the idea though! Maybe sometime in the future.\r\n\r\nDo you have additional board game questions?  Visit our <a href=\"/contact/\">contact page</a> and we\'ll get you squared away!\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n</div>','BoardGames.com FAQ\'s','','publish','closed','closed','','faq','','','2016-08-10 23:14:01','2016-08-10 23:14:01','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=1731',0,'page','',0),(1736,2,'2016-05-28 19:45:33','2016-05-28 19:45:33','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\r\n\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[brgm-weekly]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"three-fourths last\">\r\n<h2>Media and Press Requests:</h2>\r\nIf you’re interested in writing about us, talking to us, featuring us, asking us questions, challenging us to game night contact us at the email address below!  We love board games and can\'t wait to share with your audience!\r\n<h3><a href=\"/contact/\"><b>CONTACT FORM</b></a></h3>\r\n</div>','Press & Media','','publish','closed','closed','','press-media','','','2016-08-05 06:46:36','2016-08-05 06:46:36','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=1736',0,'page','',0),(1738,2,'2016-05-28 19:47:03','2016-05-28 19:47:03','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\r\n\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[brgm-weekly]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"three-fourths last\">\r\n<h2>Board Game Volunteers</h2>\r\nShare our passion for Board Games &amp; want to get involved? Volunteering with us is the perfect way to get your foot in the game so to speak! If you’re interested in volunteering for BoardGames.com shoot us an email!  We are always looking for Bloggers, Game Reviewers and new board game fanatic friends!\r\n\r\nFair warning, we get quite a few requests so, as much as we’d love to, we can’t respond to everyone. If we’re able to work with you, you’ll hear from us in no time at all.\r\n<h3><a href=\"/contact/\"><b>CONTACT FORM</b></a></h3>\r\n</div>','Volunteer with BG','','publish','closed','closed','','volunteer','','','2016-08-05 08:54:22','2016-08-05 08:54:22','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=1738',0,'page','',0),(1743,2,'2016-05-28 19:48:51','2016-05-28 19:48:51','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\r\n\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[brgm-weekly]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"three-fourths last\">\r\n<h2>Board Game Careers</h2>\r\nDo you share our colossal passion for gaming?  Are you looking for a career thats playful, fun and strategic at the same time?  Then we have the perfect gig for you! We are always looking for interesting, creative &amp; hardworking people to join our our growing BG team. Don’t be shy, if you’ve got the skills and want to work hard and have fun with a bunch of board game geeks in sunny San Diego , we want to hear from you!\r\n\r\nSend us your resume &amp; an introduction letter, don’t forget to include where you would fit in best &amp; of course your favorite game!\r\n<h3><a href=\"/contact/\"><b>CONTACT FORM</b></a></h3>\r\n</div>','Board Game Jobs','','publish','closed','closed','','careers','','','2016-08-05 05:24:16','2016-08-05 05:24:16','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=1743',0,'page','',0),(1745,2,'2016-05-28 19:50:31','2016-05-28 19:50:31','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\r\n\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[brgm-weekly]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"three-fourths last\">\r\n<h2>Shipping Info</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>We ship orders Monday-Friday except holidays.</li>\r\n 	<li>Most orders will ship out same day if placed before noon PST.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><b>WHEN WILL I GET MY STUFF?</b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>In-stock orders normally ship within 1 business days and arrive within 3-5 days.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><strong>HOW MUCH DOES SHIPPING COST? </strong></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Shipping costs vary by location &amp; weight of the package but during checkout you will be able to view all available options and choose the best method for you.</li>\r\n 	<li>Free shipping is also available on all orders over $75 &amp; for all Player\'s Club Members.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><b>FREE US STANDARD SHIPPING ON ORDERS $75+</b></h4>\r\nBoardGames.com provides customers free standard shipping for orders over $75 to an address in the contiguous U.S. (no PO boxes). This discount will happen automatically, applied at the checkout. This offer cannot be combined with other offers.\r\n<h4><b></b><b>RATES</b></h4>\r\nAs a general policy, BoardGames.com will charge shipping rates as calculated by our shipping providers (USPS, Fedex, UPS, etc).\r\n\r\nYou can determine the cost of shipping your order by adding the items you want to the shopping cart and entering your postal code or country in the Shipping Estimator on the cart page. You can also get the shipping cost during checkout – you will need to fill out your shipping address in order to view the shipping options and cost.\r\n<h4><b>TRACKING YOUR SHIPMENT</b></h4>\r\nAn email with tracking information will be sent once an order has been shipped (with most carriers). You can also track your package from your My Account page. Tracking is not available on International Economy.\r\n<h4><b>SHIPPING TO MULTIPLE LOCATIONS</b></h4>\r\nUnfortunately, we cannot split up an order and ship to multiple locations. If you wish to send items to different locations, you will need to place a separate order for each shipping address.\r\n<h4><b>ADDRESS CHANGES</b></h4>\r\nUnfortunately, we do not have the ability to change the shipping address once an order goes into processing.\r\n<h3><b>DOMESTIC (U.S.) SHIPPING</b></h3>\r\n<h4><b>CONTIGUOUS U.S.</b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>For orders to the contiguous U.S. (lower 48 states), we offer Standard Shipping, Expedited Shipping, and Express Shipping.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><b>AK, HI, AND PR</b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>UPS 2 Day and UPS Next Day are available. Unfortunately, we cannot ship to PO Boxes in any of these locations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><b>PO BOXES</b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Orders weighing less than 70 pounds can be sent through the United States Postal Service. We cannot ship to PO Boxes outside of the contiguous U.S.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><b>INTERNATIONAL SHIPPING</b></h3>\r\n<h4><b>COUNTRIES WE SHIP TO</b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>United States</li>\r\n 	<li>Canada</li>\r\n 	<li>Ireland</li>\r\n 	<li>United Kingdom</li>\r\n 	<li>American Samoa</li>\r\n 	<li>Australia</li>\r\n 	<li>Austria</li>\r\n 	<li>Bahamas</li>\r\n 	<li>Belgium</li>\r\n 	<li>Bermuda</li>\r\n 	<li>Bolivia, Plurinational State Of</li>\r\n 	<li>Brazil</li>\r\n 	<li>Burkina Faso</li>\r\n 	<li>Cambodia</li>\r\n 	<li>Canary Islands</li>\r\n 	<li>Chile</li>\r\n 	<li>China</li>\r\n 	<li>Costa Rica</li>\r\n 	<li>Croatia</li>\r\n 	<li>Cyprus</li>\r\n 	<li>Czech Republic</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Denmark</li>\r\n 	<li>Ecuador</li>\r\n 	<li>Egypt</li>\r\n 	<li>El Salvador</li>\r\n 	<li>Estonia</li>\r\n 	<li>Finland</li>\r\n 	<li>France</li>\r\n 	<li>Germany</li>\r\n 	<li>Gibraltar</li>\r\n 	<li>Greenland</li>\r\n 	<li>Guam</li>\r\n 	<li>Guatemala</li>\r\n 	<li>Hong Kong</li>\r\n 	<li>Hungary</li>\r\n 	<li>Iceland</li>\r\n 	<li>India</li>\r\n 	<li>Israel</li>\r\n 	<li>Italy</li>\r\n 	<li>Jamaica</li>\r\n 	<li>Japan</li>\r\n 	<li>Kenya</li>\r\n 	<li>Kuwait</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Lao people’s Democratic Republic</li>\r\n 	<li>Latvia</li>\r\n 	<li>Liechtenstein</li>\r\n 	<li>Lithuania</li>\r\n 	<li>Luxembourg</li>\r\n 	<li>Malaysia</li>\r\n 	<li>Malta</li>\r\n 	<li>Mongolia</li>\r\n 	<li>Mozambique</li>\r\n 	<li>Namibia</li>\r\n 	<li>Nepal</li>\r\n 	<li>Netherlands</li>\r\n 	<li>Netherlands Antilles</li>\r\n 	<li>New Zealand</li>\r\n 	<li>Norway</li>\r\n 	<li>Paraguay</li>\r\n 	<li>Peru</li>\r\n 	<li>Poland</li>\r\n 	<li>Portugal</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Serbia</li>\r\n 	<li>Singapore</li>\r\n 	<li>Slovakia</li>\r\n 	<li>Slovenia</li>\r\n 	<li>South Africa</li>\r\n 	<li>Spain</li>\r\n 	<li>Sri Lanka</li>\r\n 	<li>Swaziland</li>\r\n 	<li>Sweden</li>\r\n 	<li>Switzerland</li>\r\n 	<li>Taiwan, Province Of China</li>\r\n 	<li>Thailand</li>\r\n 	<li>Turkey</li>\r\n 	<li>United Arab Emirates</li>\r\n 	<li>Venezuela, Bolivarian Republic Of</li>\r\n 	<li>Virgin Islands (British)</li>\r\n 	<li>Virgin Islands (U.S.)</li>\r\n 	<li>Zambia</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5><b>Country not listed?</b></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>We, sadly, can’t ship to everyone. We appreciate your interest in Boardgames.com, and we would like to apologize for any inconvenience this may cause.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><b>SHIPPING TO CANADA</b></h4>\r\nFor shipments to Canada, the following shipping rates can be selected:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Expedited (5-10 business days after *processing) – $19.95</li>\r\n 	<li>Express (1-2 business days after *processing) – $29.95</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<i>*Processing Times: In-stock orders normally ship within 1-2 business days.</i>\r\n\r\nAlso note that International shipments are generally subject to Customs Fees (taxes, duties, processing fees, brokerage fees, etc.)\r\n<h4><b>CUSTOMS FEES</b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Customs fees (taxes, duties, processing fees, brokerages fees, etc.) may be charged upon delivery and required to obtain your order.</li>\r\n 	<li>These fees are NOT included in your shipping charges.</li>\r\n 	<li>We are not able to mark orders as “gifts”.</li>\r\n 	<li>We do not issue any refunds for customs fees, shipping, or the cost of your order should you refuse to pay the customs fees.</li>\r\n 	<li>BoardGames.com has no way of estimating customs fees, taxes, duties, etc. Please contact your local customs office if you need to know more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>','Shipping Info','','publish','closed','closed','','shipping-info','','','2016-08-10 21:32:41','2016-08-10 21:32:41','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=1745',0,'page','',0),(1747,2,'2016-05-28 19:55:40','2016-05-28 19:55:40','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\r\n\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[brgm-weekly]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"three-fourths last\">\r\n<h1><b>Returns &amp; Exchanges</b></h1>\r\n<h4><b>EXCHANGES</b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>We accept exchanges within 30 days for any reason (unless otherwise noted on the product page).</li>\r\n 	<li>Exchanges are simple, just email us using the contact form <a href=\"/contact/\">here</a> with your order number to get started.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><b>RETURN POLICY</b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>We accept returns within 90 days for any reason (unless otherwise noted on the product page).</li>\r\n 	<li>Returned items must be unopened in original condition, including tags, booklets, and labels.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><b>REFUNDS</b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Refund will be issued to original payment method.</li>\r\n 	<li>You will be responsible for return shipping costs of non-defective merchandise if you use one of our pre-printed return shipping labels.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>If you have questions, please contact Customer Service at 1-800-313-PLAY (1-800-313-7529).</b>\r\n\r\n</div>','Returns & Exchanges','','publish','closed','closed','','returns-exchanges','','','2016-08-05 07:17:48','2016-08-05 07:17:48','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=1747',0,'page','',0),(1749,2,'2016-05-28 19:56:56','2016-05-28 19:56:56','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\r\n\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[brgm-weekly]\r\n\