a</li>\r\n 	<li>Thailand</li>\r\n 	<li>Turkey</li>\r\n 	<li>Uganda</li>\r\n 	<li>United Arab Emirates</li>\r\n 	<li>Venezuela, Bolivarian Republic Of</li>\r\n 	<li>Virgin Islands (British)</li>\r\n 	<li>Virgin Islands (U.S.)</li>\r\n 	<li>Zambia</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h5><b>Country not listed?</b></h5>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>We, sadly, can’t ship to everyone. We appreciate your interest in Boardgames.com, and we would like to apologize for any inconvenience this may cause.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4><b>SHIPPING TO CANADA</b></h4>\r\nFor shipments to Canada, the following shipping rates can be selected:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Expedited (5-10 business days after *processing) – $19.95</li>\r\n 	<li>Express (1-2 business days after *processing) – $29.95</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<i>*Processing Times: In-stock orders normally ship within 1-2 business days.</i>Also note that International shipments are generally subject to Customs Fees (taxes, duties, processing fees, brokerage fees, etc.)  Please see below for more details.\r\n<h4><b>CUSTOMS FEES</b></h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Customs fees (taxes, duties, processing fees, brokerages fees, etc.) may be charged upon delivery and required to obtain your order.</li>\r\n 	<li>These fees are NOT included in your shipping charges.</li>\r\n 	<li>We are not able to mark orders as “gifts”.</li>\r\n 	<li>We do not issue any refunds for customs fees, shipping, or the cost of your order should you refuse to pay the customs fees.</li>\r\n 	<li>Boardgame.com has no way of estimating customs fees, taxes, duties, etc. Please contact your local customs office if you need to know more.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><b>APO/FPO SHIPPING</b></h3>\r\nWe are able to ship most of our products to U.S. Military APO/FPO addresses. Unfortunately, we cannot supply tracking numbers for shipments to APO/FPO addresses.\r\n\r\nWhen completing your Shipping Address during checkout, please make note of the following.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>The City must be entered as either “APO” or “FPO”</li>\r\n 	<li>The State must be selected as either “AA” “AE” or “AP”</li>\r\n 	<li>The country must be United States.</li>\r\n 	<li>You must enter your Zip code</li>\r\n 	<li>Always remember to enter your full name, grade, and PSC or unit number</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nPlease note: orders shipped to an APO/FPO address take longer to be delivered. Please allow 2-4 weeks for your package to arrive.\r\n\r\n</div>','International Orders','','publish','closed','closed','','international-orders','','','2016-08-05 06:29:14','2016-08-05 06:29:14','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=1749',0,'page','',0),(1751,2,'2016-05-28 19:58:22','2016-05-28 19:58:22','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\r\n\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[brgm-weekly]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"three-fourths last\">\r\n<h2><b>Sell Your Game On BoardGames.com</b></h2>\r\n<h3><b>Interested in selling your board game, dice game or card game with us?</b></h3>\r\nWe love helping game designers get started or maybe even become the next big thing!\r\n\r\nHave a finished game your looking to sell? Great, send us the details and we will contact you about selling it on BoardGames.com.   If your game is still in the concept phase, we can help make your dream a reality!\r\n<h3><a href=\"/contact/\"><b>CONTACT FORM</b></a></h3>\r\n</div>','Sell Your Board Game','','publish','closed','closed','','sell-board-games','','','2016-08-05 07:24:23','2016-08-05 07:24:23','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=1751',0,'page','',0),(1753,2,'2016-05-28 19:59:18','2016-05-28 19:59:18','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\r\n\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[brgm-weekly]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"three-fourths last\">\r\n<h2>Advertise With Us</h2>\r\nSend us an email for current pricing &amp; availability.\r\n<h3><a href=\"/contact/\"><b>CONTACT FORM</b></a></h3>\r\n</div>','Advertise With Us','','publish','closed','closed','','advertising','','','2016-08-05 05:03:27','2016-08-05 05:03:27','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=1753',0,'page','',0),(1755,2,'2016-05-28 20:00:09','2016-05-28 20:00:09','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\r\n\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[brgm-weekly]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"three-fourths last\">\r\n<h2>Coupons &amp; Promocodes:</h2>\r\nLooking for an exclusive insider discount?  You\'re in luck!  Just enter your email below &amp; we will send you a discount code that you can use right away, plus you’ll automatically get BG Weekly FREE!  The BG Weekly is packed with our weekly specials, new game releases &amp; more!\r\n<h2><b>SIGN UP FOR AN EXCLUSIVE BOARDGAMES.COM E-MAIL NEWSLETTER!</b></h2>\r\n<h3><b>PRODUCTS, CONTENT AND DISCOUNTS – STRAIGHT TO YOUR INBOX FIRST.</b></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Our subscribers see the shiny new games first, including limited-edition &amp; hard-to-keep-in-stock stuff that sells out fast.</li>\r\n 	<li>Get in on top-secret deals and discounts just for our email subscribers.</li>\r\n 	<li>We send our email newsletters about twice a week.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>','Board Game Coupons','','publish','closed','closed','','coupons','','','2016-08-05 05:33:23','2016-08-05 05:33:23','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=1755',0,'page','',0),(1757,2,'2016-05-28 20:01:12','2016-05-28 20:01:12','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\r\n\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[brgm-weekly]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"three-fourths last\">\r\n<h2><b>BOARD GAME GIFT CARDS:</b></h2>\r\nNot sure what to give that special board gamer on your list?  Board game gift cards will please just about anyone in your life. They are available in custom amounts, good for anything on Boardgames.com, are delivered via email and can be used immediately. <b>WOW!</b>\r\n\r\nFill out the form below to get your gift certificate; the fields marked with asterisks are required.\r\n\r\n<em>Form coming soon....</em>\r\n\r\n</div>','Board Game Gift Cards','','publish','closed','closed','','gift-cards','','','2016-08-05 06:11:46','2016-08-05 06:11:46','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=1757',0,'page','',0),(1760,2,'2016-05-28 20:11:17','2016-05-28 20:11:17','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\r\n\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[brgm-weekly]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"three-fourths last\">\r\n<h5 style=\"color: #fa3c1c;\">SHOP BY FORMAT:</h5>\r\nThe format of a game is it decided by it\'s basic structure and primary components.  Maybe you\'re especially lucky (or unlucky) with dice games.  Or maybe you want a fun game you can easily carry with you to a party.  If so, you\'ll want to check out our card games.  <a href=\"/shop-by-format/\">View all game formats</a>.\r\n[brmg_tax column=\"3\" slug=\"board-games,card-games,dice-games\" type=\"data\" showtitle=\"1\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h5 style=\"color: #fa3c1c;\">SHOP BY GENRE:</h5>\r\nShop for fun board games by genre if you have an idea of the general style of game you like to play (or would like to try!)  There\'s a wide variety of basic genre\'s and sometimes a game can fall into more than one game genre.  <a href=\"/genres/\">View all game genres</a>.\r\n\r\n[brmg_tax column=\"4\" slug=\"strategy-games,family-games,kids-games,cooperative-games,party-games,mature-games,abstract-games,educational-games\" type=\"data\" showtitle=\"1\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h5 style=\"color: #fa3c1c;\">SHOP BY THEME:</h5>\r\nObsessed with zombie games? Or perhaps you prefer the resource management and card drafting of a city builder? How about a good murder-mystery? If you have a theme in mind but don’t know of a game that fits it – don’t worry. We’ve categorized all our funnest games by theme, choose your favorite theme and we’ll filter everything else out.  <a href=\"/themes/\">View all game themes</a>.\r\n\r\n[brmg_tax column=\"4\" slug=\"zombie-games,fantasy-games,adult-games,trivia-games,sports-games,war-games,city-building-games,adventure-games\" type=\"data\" showtitle=\"1\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h5 style=\"color: #fa3c1c;\">BG STAMPS OF APPROVAL:</h5>\r\nOur editors have created special categories of special approved games to give you the most enjoyable games for what you want. Discover board games with amazing artwork, unique themes or even games that are nerd approved!  <a href=\"/approved/\">View all approved game lists</a>.\r\n\r\n[brmg_tax parent=\"76\" load=\"carousel2 awards\" type=\"image\"]\r\n<h3 class=\"bord\"><span class=\"a\">Featured Games:</span></h3>\r\n[brgm_slider featured=\"yes\"]\r\n\r\n</div>','Fun Games By Category','','publish','closed','closed','','fun-board-games','','','2016-08-05 08:10:14','2016-08-05 08:10:14','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=1760',0,'page','',0),(1769,2,'2016-05-28 20:46:51','2016-05-28 20:46:51','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\r\n\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[brgm-weekly]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"three-fourths last fun-stuff\">\r\n<h2>FUN STUFF</h2>\r\nHere lies the miscellany that elsewhere has no home. Snoop around to discover good board games and the other misfit wonders that have landed here.\r\n\r\n[cm cl=\"one-third\"]<a href=\"/players-club/\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1773 size-full\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/images-for-menu-playersclub.jpg\" alt=\"images-for-menu-playersclub\" width=\"246\" height=\"265\" /></a>[/cm]\r\n[cm cl=\"one-third\"]<a href=\"/board-game-bucks/\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1772 size-full\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/images-for-menu-bgbucks.jpg\" alt=\"images-for-menu-bgbucks\" width=\"246\" height=\"265\" /></a>[/cm]\r\n[cm cl=\"one-third last\"]<a href=\"/account/\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1770 size-full\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/bgpoints-menu-image.jpg\" alt=\"bgpoints-menu-image\" width=\"246\" height=\"265\" /></a>\r\n[/cm]\r\n[cm cl=\"one-third\"]<a href=\"/board-game-info/\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1771 size-full\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/bgweekly-menuimage.jpg\" alt=\"bgweekly-menuimage\" width=\"246\" height=\"265\" /></a>[/cm]\r\n[cm cl=\"one-third\"]<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1774 size-full\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/images-for-menu-refer.jpg\" alt=\"images-for-menu-refer\" width=\"246\" height=\"265\" />[/cm]\r\n[cm cl=\"one-third last\"]<a href=\"/approved/\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1775 size-full\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/images-for-menu-stamps.jpg\" alt=\"images-for-menu-stamps\" width=\"246\" height=\"265\" /></a>[/cm]\r\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n[cm cl=\"section section-2\"]\r\n<h3 class=\"bord\"><span class=\"a\">New Arrivals</span></h3>\r\n[brgm_slider]\r\n[/cm]\r\n[cm cl=\"section section-3\"]\r\n<h3 class=\"bord\"><span class=\"a\">Featured Games:</span></h3>\r\n[brgm_slider featured=\"yes\"]\r\n[/cm]\r\n\r\n</div>','Fun Stuff','','publish','closed','closed','','good','','','2016-08-10 23:17:28','2016-08-10 23:17:28','',0,'http://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=1769',0,'page','',0),(1780,2,'2016-05-28 21:04:59','2016-05-28 21:04:59','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\r\n\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\r\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\r\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n[brgm-weekly]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"three-fourths last\">\r\n<h2>CONTACT US:</h2>\r\n[cm cl=\"two-thirds\"]\r\n<div style=\"max-width: 90%;\">\r\n\r\nQuestions or concerns? Talk to us! We are here to help you. Use the form below and one of our customer service specialists will get back to you as fast as possible. We aim to respond to all emails within 24 hours.[contact-form-7 id=\"1712\" title=\"Contact Form\"]\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n[/cm]\r\n[cm cl=\"one-third last\"]\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1791 size-full\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/pawns9.png\" alt=\"board game help page\" width=\"285\" height=\"68\" />\r\n\r\n<b style=\"color: #fa3c1c;\">EMAIL:</b>\r\n\r\nHit us up with any questions about your order.  We’re here to help you 24/7!  Just fill out the form to the left.\r\n\r\n<b style=\"color: #fa3c1c;\">PHONE:</b>\r\n\r\nNeed to speak with someone?  Call the Board Game hotline!\r\n\r\nMonday to Friday from 8am to 5pm PST\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\" align=\"center\"><a href=\"tel:18885437529\">1-800-313-PLAY</a>\r\nor\r\n<a href=\"tel:18885437529\">(1-800-313-7529)</a></p>\r\n[/cm]\r\n<div class=\"clear\"></div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h4>OTHER HELPFUL INFORMATION:</h4>\r\n[cm cl=\"one-half\"]\r\n<a href=\"/faq\"><strong>ORDERING</strong></a>\r\n\r\nHow to order payment methods, address verification, taxes and other order-related questions.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/shipping-info/\"><strong>SHIPPING</strong></a>\r\n\r\nLooking for info on our shipping policies and methods?\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/board-game-bucks/\"><strong>BG POINTS &amp; BUCKS (REWARDS PROGRAMS)</strong></a>\r\n\r\nFrequent shoppers can earn