-07-12 01:30:04',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','2265','','','2016-07-12 01:30:04','2016-07-12 01:30:04','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?p=2265',5,'nav_menu_item','',0),(2266,2,'2016-07-12 01:30:04','2016-07-12 01:30:04',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','2266','','','2016-07-12 01:30:04','2016-07-12 01:30:04','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?p=2266',2,'nav_menu_item','',0),(2267,2,'2016-07-12 01:30:04','2016-07-12 01:30:04',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','2267','','','2016-07-12 01:30:04','2016-07-12 01:30:04','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?p=2267',1,'nav_menu_item','',0),(2282,2,'2016-07-19 02:22:40','2016-07-19 02:22:40','','Addresses','','publish','closed','closed','','addresses','','','2016-10-11 18:16:57','2016-10-12 01:16:57','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?p=2282',8,'nav_menu_item','',0),(2283,2,'2016-07-19 02:22:40','2016-07-19 02:22:40','','Payment Methods','','publish','closed','closed','','payment-method','','','2016-10-11 18:16:57','2016-10-12 01:16:57','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?p=2283',9,'nav_menu_item','',0),(2286,2,'2016-07-20 03:55:48','2016-07-20 03:55:48','You\'re almost there!  Just one more step...\r\n\r\n[woocommerce_simple_registration]','Finish Account Creation','','publish','closed','closed','','finish-account','','','2016-08-05 04:44:24','2016-08-05 04:44:24','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=2286',0,'page','',0),(2488,2,'2016-07-21 15:18:16','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Worldpay Log','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2016-07-21 15:18:16','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?p=2488',0,'braintree_log','',0),(2489,2,'2016-07-21 15:24:45','2016-07-21 15:24:45','','Board-Games','','inherit','open','closed','','board-games-2','','','2016-07-21 15:24:45','2016-07-21 15:24:45','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Board-Games.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(2490,2,'2016-07-22 04:32:49','2016-07-22 04:32:49','','FUN STUFF','','publish','closed','closed','','fun-stuff-3','','','2016-10-11 18:17:40','2016-10-12 01:17:40','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?p=2490',41,'nav_menu_item','',0),(2491,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Run, Fight or Die','','publish','open','closed','','run-fight-or-die','','','2016-09-14 17:18:12','2016-09-15 00:18:12','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/run-fight-or-die/',0,'product','',0),(2492,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Love Letter','All of the eligible young men (and many of the not-so-young) seek to woo the princess of Tempest. Unfortunately, she has locked herself in the palace, and you must rely on others to bring your romantic letters to her. Will yours reach her first? Love Letter is a game of risk, deduction, and luck for 2 to 4 players. Your goal is to get your love letter into Princess Annette\'s hands while deflecting the letters from competing suitors. From a deck with only sixteen cards, each player starts with only one card in hand; one card is removed from play. On a turn, you draw one card, and play one card, trying to expose others and knock them from the game. Powerful cards lead to early gains, but make you a target. Rely on weaker cards for too long, however, and your letter may be tossed in the fire.','publish','open','closed','','love-letter','','','2016-09-14 17:18:16','2016-09-15 00:18:16','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/love-letter-2/',0,'product','',1),(2493,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Dice City','Dice City takes you into the Kingdom of Rolldovia. The realm is faced with turmoil after its capital was sacked by hordes of barbarians and bandits. The Queen has decreed that there will be a new capital. It’s up to the country’s leaders to establish a new city and gain the approval of all others.\r\n\r\nTo start the game, players take on the role as one of the Kingdom’s influential noble families. A player must convince the Royal Highness that their provincial city is the best home for Rolldovia\'s new capital.\r\n\r\nWhich city will become the next capital of Rolldovia? Who among the noble families will present a city worthy of the Queen’s approval? If you’re into a fun and unique dice-crafting game, Dice City is for you!','publish','open','closed','','dice-city','','','2016-09-14 17:18:17','2016-09-15 00:18:17','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/dice-city/',0,'product','',0),(2494,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Greedy Greedy Goblins','Greedy Greedy Goblins is an action-packed game that positively encourages its players to push their luck. It creates a simultaneous play wherein players offload monsters and excess dynamite onto other mines, and claim the good mine before anyone else. Will you be able to read into your opponents bluff? Or, will you fall into your opponent’s trap? \n\nEnjoy the goblin madness with friends and read into everyone else\'s body language and speed! Greedy Greedy Goblins has a perfect mixture of game elements. It’s a light-hearted game that promotes rapid decision-making skills! \n\nIf you’re in the mood for some chaotic treasure hunting exploding dynamites, this game is definitely for you!','publish','open','closed','','greedy-greedy-goblins','','','2016-09-14 17:18:13','2016-09-15 00:18:13','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/greedy-greedy-goblins/',0,'product','',0),(2495,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Smash Up','Smash Up starts with a simple premise: Take the twenty card decks of two factions and shuffle them into a forty card deck. Factions include – aliens, dinosaurs, ninjas, pirates, wizards, robots, tricksters, and zombies. Players battle to smash up bases to score points.\r\n\r\nTo win the game, a player should smash more bases than his opponents! Smash Up is about figuring out how to harness the combined powers of your two factions. Every combination of factions brings a different play experience.\r\n\r\nHere’s your chance to mix two of your favorite heroes. Smash Up is very casual and light. Its unique theme keeps both children and adults interested. Find out what happens when you mix aliens and zombies, or wizards and robots!\r\n\r\nWhich factions will you use to smash up your opponents? Grab a copy of Smash Up now!','publish','open','closed','','smash-up','','','2016-09-14 17:18:15','2016-09-15 00:18:15','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/smash-up/',0,'product','',0),(2496,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Sheriff of Nottingham','In Sheriff of Nottingham players take turns assuming the role of the sheriff, while the other players are Merchants bringing their wares into town. Merchant wares include apples, cheeses, breads and chickens all bundled up in a sack ready to be peddled at market. It\'s up to the sheriff to determine which merchants are on the level and which are smuggling contraband into town. Sheriff of Nottingham is a game of bluffs, bribes and bravado.','publish','open','closed','','sheriff-of-nottingham','','','2016-09-12 17:23:07','2016-09-13 00:23:07','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/sheriff-of-nottingham-2/',0,'product','',1),(2497,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','7 Wonders','In 7 Wonders it\'s your ultimate goal to create one of the greatest civilization\'s the human race has ever produced! Players vie for resources in order to build up their civilizations by investing in military infrastructure, trade routes and buildings. The game lasts for three ages, each age has a specific source deck where players gather their resources. This is a fast paced and strategic game.','publish','open','open','','7-wonders','','','2016-09-12 17:23:07','2016-09-13 00:23:07','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/7-wonders-2/',0,'product','',0),(2498,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Dixit','The players have hands of oversized cards with various artistic pictures. The active player secretly selects one of his cards and gives a very brief description. The other players secretly select their own cards which match the description. The chosen cards are shuffled and revealed, then players vote on which was chosen by the active player.Each correct answer gives points to the guesser and the active player. Each incorrect answer gives points to the player who submitted the guessed card. However, if all of the guesses are correct -- or none of them are -- then the active player gets no points and all the other players get points.The game ends when the deck is empty. The greatest total wins the game.','publish','open','closed','','dixit','','','2016-09-12 17:23:07','2016-09-13 00:23:07','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/dixit-2/',0,'product','',0),(2499,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Jaipur','My kingdom for a camel. Work hard, earn more than your opponent and become the official merchant of the Maharaja. At the beginning of the game, three camel cards and two merchandise cards are on the table between the players, who already have five cards in hand. On your turn, you can take some cards or sell some. Each time that you take cards, you can take one or more, however if you decide to take more, then you will have to trade in the same amount of cards from your hand that you take. If you decide to take all camel cards, then they can be used later to trade. You can sell all the merchandise that you want, as long as they are all the same type. For each sale, you will receive tokens with various point values. At the end of the game, the player who has the majority of the camels also wins points.','publish','open','closed','','jaipur','','','2016-09-12 17:23:07','2016-09-13 00:23:07','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/jaipur-2/',0,'product','',0),(2500,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Splendor','In Splendor you are a merchant of the Renaissance and are scrambling to catch the eye of the noble elite. With every transaction you claw your way that much closer to the prestige you know you deserve. Use your gems and coins to purchase mines, ships and commission artisans, all in the name of progress. The gameplay of Splendor is easy enough to pick up, each turn you either collect gems, buy and build a card or reserve a card. Be the first to acquire 15 prestige points to win the game! Fun for the whole family!','publish','open','closed','','splendor','','','2016-09-14 17:18:18','2016-09-15 00:18:18','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/splendor-2/',0,'product','',0),(2501,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Cash \'N Guns','The big heist may have been a success, but it all goes wrong when every crook wants a bigger cut. With this much money on the table, bullets speak louder than words! In Cash \'n Guns, players will point foam pistols at each other and try to intimidate their opponents into letting them have the largest share. The bravest crooks enjoy the most money - but only if they live long enough to spend it!','publish','open','closed','','cash-n-guns','','','2016-09-12 17:23:08','2016-09-13 00:23:08','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/cash-n-guns-2/',0,'product','',0),(2502,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Concept','A large, green animal from long ago? Must be a dinosaur. Water, cube and cold weather? Has to be an ice cube. A man with a job who rides large brown animals in the United States? Is that a cowboy? In Concept, players team up to place tokens on a board covered in icons, depicting everything from ancient samurai and snails to Leonardo DiCaprio. Points go to the player who can guess the correctly by looking at the various symbols, but in this wild party game, the points are less important than just having a great time!','publish','open','closed','','concept','','','2016-09-12 17:23:08','2016-09-13 00:23:08','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/concept-2/',0,'product','',0),(2503,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Werewolves of Miller\'s Hollow','Werewolves of Miller\'s Hollow is a game that takes place in a small village which is haunted by werewolves. Each player is secretly assigned a role - Werewolf, Ordinary Townsfolk, or special character such as The Sheriff, The Hunter, the Witch, the Little Girl, The Fortune Teller and so on... There is also a Moderator player who controls the flow of the game. The game alternates between night and day phases. At night, the Werewolves secretly choose a Villager to kill. During the day, the Villager who was killed is revealed and is out of the game. The remaining Villagers (normal and special villagers alike) then deliberate and vote on a player they suspect is a Werewolf, helped (or hindered) by the clues the special characters add to the general deliberation. The chosen player is \"lynched\", reveals his/her role and is out of the game. Werewolf is a social game that requires no equipment to play, and can accommodate almost any large group of players.','publish','open','closed','','werewolves-of-millers-hollow','','','2016-09-14 17:29:26','2016-09-15 00:29:26','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/werewolves-of-millers-hollow-2/',0,'product','',0),(2504,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Gloom','In the Gloom card game, you assume control of the fate of an eccentric family of misfits and misanthropes. The goal of the game is sad, but simple: you want your characters to suffer the greatest tragedies possible before passing on to the well-deserved respite of death. Play horrible mishaps like Pursued by Poodles or Mocked by Midgets on your own characters, while trying to cheer your opponents\' characters with marriages and other happy occasions.','publish','open','closed','','gloom','','','2016-09-14 17:18:19','2016-09-15 00:18:19','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/gloom-2/',0,'product','',0),(2505,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Betrayal At House on the Hill','Betrayal at House on the Hill is a spook-tacular suspense filled haunted house board game. You and your friends are exploring an abandoned old mansion filled with artifacts and poltergeists! The more rooms explored bring you closer to the haunting and one of your friends becoming a traitor! The remaining players must band together to overcome the traitor and monsters before it\'s too late. There are dozens of haunting scenarios and players build the mansion room by room with tiles so no two games are alike! If you\'re in the mood for a spooky, fun and unique experience this is the game for you.','publish','open','closed','','betrayal-at-house-on-the-hill','','','2016-09-12 17:23:08','2016-09-13 00:23:08','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/betrayal-at-house-on-the-hill-2/',0,'product','',0),(2506,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Diplomacy','The classic game of negotiation, cunning, and deceit is back. Through negotiations, alliances, and intrigue, expand your empire over pre-World War I Europe. Form alliances and unhatch your traitorous plots as you negotiate and outwitâ€” in a delicate balance of cooperation and competitionâ€” to gain dominance of the continent. Your success hinges not on the luck of the dice, but your cunning and cleverness.','publish','open','closed','','diplomacy','','','2016-09-14 17:18:14','2016-09-15 00:18:14','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/diplomacy-2/',0,'product','',0),(2507,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Bananagrams','Bananagrams is an acclaimed word game for kids that puts Scrabble, arguably the most well-known word game of all, on its head.\n\nLike in Scrabble, play Bananagrams by forming words using the letter tiles drawn from the games 144-piece collection. \n\nUnlike Scrabble you won’t win by scoring the highest points gained from playing a complicated or obscure word. In fact there are no points at all! The game is won by making a crossword using all your tiles before the other player or players.\n\nThere is no board. The game comes in a cute, convenient, banana-shaped pouch, which lets you play on any flat surface you like. \n\nIf that doesn’t drive you bananas, you’ll have a lot of fun－and maybe even learn a thing or two.','publish','open','closed','','bananagrams','','','2016-09-12 17:23:13','2016-09-13 00:23:13','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/bananagrams/',0,'product','',0),(2508,2,'2016-07-22 12:39:59','2016-07-22 12:39:59','','Antidote','Antidote is a card game of deduction where each player takes their turn simutaneously! Players assume the role of a laboratory scientist performing research on chemicals. Then disaster strikes when a deadly toxin is released in your lab infecting everyone! Players must race to find the antidote before time runs out. Players discard or trade research cards until everyone has only one card - then everyone must drink the antidote! But if you choose poorly the antidote fails and you die!','publish','open','closed','','antidote','','','2016-09-12 17:23:13','2016-09-13 00:23:13','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/antidote/',0,'product','',0),(2509,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','One Night Ultimate Werewolf','One Night Ultimate Werewolf is a social deduction game for a large group of people in which everyone gets a role. There are twelve unique roles and most have a night action to perform. You can be one of the dastardly werewolves, the robber, the insomniac, or one of a dozen different characters with a special ability!\r\n\r\nThe game begins by deciding what roles you\'re going to play with. As night falls, all players ‘go to sleep’ or close their eyes, except those with special roles. When day breaks, players ‘wake up’ and discuss who they believe the werewolves are. During the discussion, villagers will vote on who to lynch.\r\n\r\nThis is the kind of game that you\'ll want to play again and again. It doesn\'t need a moderator, there\'s no elimination, and each game lasts about 10 minutes! Get your copy of One Night Ultimate Werewolf now!','publish','open','closed','','one-night-ultimate-werewolf','','','2016-09-14 15:09:55','2016-09-14 22:09:55','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/one-night-ultimate-werewolf-2/',0,'product','',0),(2510,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Ultimate Werewolf','Ultimate Werewolf is an interactive game of deduction for two teams: Villagers and Werewolves. The Villagers don\'t know who the Werewolves are, and the Werewolves are trying to remain undiscovered while they slowly eliminate the Villagers one at a time. A Moderator (who isn\'t on a team) runs the game. Ultimate Werewolf takes place over a series of game days and nights. Each day, the players discuss who among them is a Werewolf and vote out a player. Each night, the Werewolves choose a player to eliminate, while the Seer learns whether one player is a Werewolf or not. The game is over when either all the Villagers or all the Werewolves are eliminated.','publish','open','closed','','ultimate-werewolf','','','2016-09-12 17:23:13','2016-09-13 00:23:13','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/ultimate-werewolf-2/',0,'product','',0),(2511,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Castles of Mad King Ludwig','In Castles of Mad King Ludwig, players are commissioned by no other than King Ludwig II himself to construct the biggest, best castle ever! You have to follow his ever-changing whims, of course.\r\n\r\nDuring the game, players take on the role of a building contractor who is tasked to add rooms to the King’s castle. Each room gives you points for building it. The points are based on the size, type, and location of the room. Bonus points are awarded for being the most responsive to the King\'s demands.\r\n\r\nGet ready to build the most majestic castle Bavaria has ever seen! Who will become the best Master Builder for the King? Castles of Mad King Ludwig is a fun tile placement game for 1-4 players.','publish','open','closed','','castles-of-mad-king-ludwig','','','2016-09-12 17:23:13','2016-09-13 00:23:13','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/castles-of-mad-king-ludwig/',0,'product','',0),(2512,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Suburbia','In Suburbia, players will race to have the most people in their suburb. Hex-shaped building tiles are used to add commercial, residential, civic, and industrial areas in order to encourage population growth. As your town grows, you\'ll modify both your income and your reputation. \n\nPlayers start the game with just three hexagonal tiles – one suburb, one park, and one factory. Each turn, you will be buying a tile from the real estate market. As your income increases, you\'ll have more cash on hand to purchase better and more valuable buildings. \n\nAre you ready to rev up your economic engine? Will your town be the most self-sufficient? It’s an absolutely fun game with an accessible and inviting theme. Grab a copy of Suburbia now!','publish','open','closed','','suburbia','','','2016-09-12 17:23:13','2016-09-13 00:23:13','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/suburbia/',0,'product','',0),(2513,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Bucket of Doom','Ever wondered how you would escape if you were swallowed by a whale or buried alive in an airtight coffin...with only an angry beaver and a foot-long hot dog to help you?\n Well, we have. And we\'ve made it into a delightfully dark party game.','publish','open','closed','','bucket-of-doom','','','2016-09-12 17:23:14','2016-09-13 00:23:14','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/bucket-of-doom-2/',0,'product','',0),(2514,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Spot It!','Spot it! is the addictive, feverishly fun matching game for every generation. The first thing to know about Spot it! is that there is always one, and only one, matching symbol between any two cards. Got it? Now all you need is a sharp eye and a quick hand to play all five party games packed into the grab \'n\' go tin. Including up to eight players, Spot it! is a cinch to learn, plays fast, and is irresistibly fun for all ages!','publish','open','closed','','spot-it','','','2016-09-12 17:23:14','2016-09-13 00:23:14','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/spot-it-2/',0,'product','',0),(2515,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Boss Monster','Designed for 2-4 players, Boss Monster is packed with nostalgic references to 8-bit video games, dungeon-crawling RPGs, and geeky pop culture. Players compete to become the ultimate villain: the final boss at the end of a side-scrolling dungeon.','publish','open','closed','','boss-monster','','','2016-09-12 17:23:14','2016-09-13 00:23:14','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/boss-monster-2/',0,'product','',1),(2516,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Boss Monster 2: The Next Level','Take your dungeon to the next level with Boss Monster 2. The mission is to strategically build a dungeon full of rooms, lure in hapless adventurers, kill them off, and collect their souls. Don’t let any adventurer make it through the dungeon alive or it will cause damage to the boss! \n\nBoss Monster 2 features everything there is in the best-selling original but with fresh new mechanisms and exciting new options. Now, there are Dark Heroes and Hybrid Heroes who can raise the stakes. And, epic spells and ‘cycling’ rooms give players more options and flexibility. \n\nGet ready to construct your lair! Tempt adventurers with treasures that will surely lead to their deaths! With more bosses, more unique cards, and more ways to slay adventurers, Boss Monster 2 is a must-have expansion!','publish','open','closed','','boss-monster-2-the-next-level','','','2016-09-12 17:23:14','2016-09-13 00:23:14','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/boss-monster-2-the-next-level/',0,'product','',0),(2517,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Tsuro of the Seas','In Tsuro of the Seas you will sail the treacherous waters of the Mystic Seas in an engaging game of adventure and suspense. As the captain of one of the Emperorâ€™s mighty red seal ships, you will navigate the seas by placing Tsuro wake tiles to direct your vessel. Take great caution to avoid your opponentsâ€™ ships and those mysteries lurking on the horizon and under the sea. Guide your ship with a steady hand and be the last captain sailing to survive the mystic seas and win. Tsuro of the Seas is an enjoyable experience that will entertain 2 to 8 players ages 8 and above and it plays in 20 to 40 minutes. Set sail at once. You have a mighty quest to fulfill for the Emperor.','publish','open','closed','','tsuro-of-the-seas','','','2016-09-12 17:23:14','2016-09-13 00:23:14','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/tsuro-of-the-seas-2/',0,'product','',1),(2518,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Tsuro','Inspired by the mythological myth of the Dragon and the Phoenix guarding the winding paths to divine wisdom, Tsuro is played on a 6x6 board where players put down tiles that will determine their destiny – the path to winning or the path to losing.\n\nThe game starts with each player positioning their token on one of the white markers found along the edge of the board.\n\nThe goal of the game is for you to stay on the board. If an opponent plays a tile adjacent to the tile where your token is, you are forced to follow the path of the tile and if it leads you to go off the board, you are eliminated. Likewise, if the path you should follow collides with another player, both of you are off the quest to find divine wisdom.\n\nThe player who owns the last token on the boards achieves divine victory. May the paths be always in your favor!','publish','open','closed','','tsuro','','','2016-09-12 17:23:14','2016-09-13 00:23:14','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/tsuro/',0,'product','',0),(2519,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Cards Against Humanity','Cards Against Humanity is a party game for horrible people. Unlike most of the party games you\'ve played before, Cards Against Humanity is as despicable and awkward as you and your friends.Â The game is simple. Each round, one player asks a question from a Black Card, and everyone else answers with their funniest White Card.','publish','open','closed','','cards-against-humanity','','','2016-09-12 17:23:14','2016-09-13 00:23:14','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/cards-against-humanity-2/',0,'product','',0),(2520,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','The Duke','It’s going to be bloody! The Duke takes inspiration from the classic game of chess. The only difference is it’s more fiercely fun and ferociously competitive. The goal of course is to hold your opponent’s Duke captive.\r\n\r\nThe battleground is a 6x6 tile board and the battle begins with players playing their Duke on one of the two center squares on their side of the game board.\r\n\r\nSimilar to chess, the movement of each tile varies and is indicated on the tile itself. If your tile lands on a square with your opponent’s tile, you capture the tile and it’s no longer in play.\r\n\r\nThe game can take on new twists and turns by employing special tiles such as the terrain tiles and the dragon tile. Plus, with extended gameplay rules that can be employed, the possibilities for a barbarously fun game are virtually endless.','publish','open','closed','','the-duke','','','2016-09-12 17:23:14','2016-09-13 00:23:14','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/the-duke/',0,'product','',0),(2521,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Lord of the Fries Super Deluxe Card Game','In the Lord of Fries, customers line up inside Friedey\'s – the Restaurant of the Damned! The whole staff is dead, but this won’t stop them from filling out orders. Their colorful menu includes the crowd-favorite Cowabunga, Chickabunga, Patriarch, fries, drinks, desserts, and more! \n\nThe game includes a deck of cards that represent different ingredients. Each order requires a different combination of ingredients to fill. Some orders are easy, like the Cowabunga – composed of one cow meat, one bun. Harder orders are more of a challenge to fill like the Chickabunga Conga!\n\nEven with its simple theme, the Lord of Fries has a comedic vibe that will let out some good laugh. Especially, by the game’s funny and pun-intended menu items. If you’re into some zombie action with a uniquely fun theme, this game is for you!','publish','open','closed','','lord-of-the-fries-super-deluxe-card-game','','','2016-09-12 17:23:15','2016-09-13 00:23:15','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/lord-of-the-fries-super-deluxe-card-game/',0,'product','',0),(2522,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Blood Rage','Blood Rage is a Viking board game. In this fast-paced yet highly strategic game, 2 to 4 players take control of Viking clans, invading, pillaging, and battling in a quest to gain as much glory as possible before Ragnarok finally consumes the land! Blood Rage comes with 46 pre-assembled miniatures, including some huge and impressive legendary monsters.','publish','open','closed','','blood-rage','','','2016-09-12 17:23:15','2016-09-13 00:23:15','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/blood-rage-2/',0,'product','',0),(2523,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','The Grizzled','','publish','open','closed','','the-grizzled','','','2016-09-12 17:23:15','2016-09-13 00:23:15','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/the-grizzled/',0,'product','',0),(2524,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Council of Verona','Have you ever read the eternal, tragic love story Romeo and Juliet? Wish it had ended differently? Council of Verona lets you make such a change.\r\n\r\nCouncil of Verona is a role-playing game. Each play an influential citizen who is also a member of the council. They were chosen by the ruler, Prince Escalus. He has tasked them with bringing peace to the realm by finally resolving the conflict between Juliet’s and Romeo’s families, the Capulets and the Montagues, who are also citizens.\r\n\r\nPlay your cards well and move your tokens carefully to further your agenda and gain victory points. The player with the most victory points wins, enabling himself or herself to change the fate of not only the star-crossed lovers but that of the rest of the citizens as well.','publish','open','closed','','council-of-verona','','','2016-09-12 17:23:15','2016-09-13 00:23:15','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/council-of-verona/',0,'product','',0),(2525,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 19:40:09','','DC Comics Deck-Building Game','The DC Comics Deck Building Game consists of five different types of cards that can be acquired -- villains, heroes, equipment, super powers, and locations. Each player starts with his or her own basic 10-card deck and draws a hand of 5 cards each turn.\r\n\r\nUsing your powers, you gain the strength necessary to take down some of the nastiest crooks in the DC Universe -- the Joker, Darkseid, Lex Luthor, and Deathstroke! Whenever a super villain is defeated you flip the next card in the deck. The next super villain immediately attacks everyone.\r\n\r\nFans of deck-building games and comic enthusiasts will definitely enjoy DC Comics Deck Building Game! If you love superheroes and want to defeat some bad guys, this game is for you!','publish','open','closed','','dc-comics-deck-building-game','','','2016-09-16 09:02:13','2016-09-16 16:02:13','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/dc-comics-deck-building-game/',0,'product','',0),(2526,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Epic Spell Wars of the Battle Wizards: Duel at Mt. Skullzfyre','','publish','open','closed','','epic-spell-wars-of-the-battle-wizards-duel-at-mt-skullzfyre','','','2016-09-12 17:23:15','2016-09-13 00:23:15','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/epic-spell-wars-of-the-battle-wizards-duel-at-mt-skullzfyre/',0,'product','',0),(2527,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Codenames','Enter the world of spymasters with Codenames – the ultimate secret agent party game! It is played between two teams: red and blue. The rivals compete to see who can make contact with all of their agents first.\r\n\r\nThe game consists of 200 cards each with a single word on either side. Twenty-five cards are randomly selected and arranged in a five by five grid. Each team chooses a spymaster to give clues for their team. Other members will work together to answer those clues.\r\n\r\nGet ready to figure out clues! The first team to correctly select all of its codenames wins. Codenames is a fun and fast-paced party game that can be set up in less than a minute. It’s also easy to learn and have tons of replayability.','publish','open','closed','','codenames','','','2016-10-05 19:28:46','2016-10-06 02:28:46','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/codenames/',0,'product','',1),(2528,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:09','2016-07-22 12:40:09','','Small World','There isn\'t enough room for all of you in Small World. Players compete for territory in this light hearted fantasy civilization game, choosing a race and special abilities to help them in their efforts. There are 14 unique races and 20 special abilities to pick and choose from lending the game a diversity that promotes replayability and strategy.','publish','open','closed','','small-world','','','2016-09-12 17:23:20','2016-09-13 00:23:20','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/small-world-2/',0,'product','',0),(2529,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Ticket To Ride','Ticket to Ride is an award winning fun filled train adventure board game with deceptively simple gameplay and rules. The objective is to claim and complete routes in order to travel to as many 20th century North American cities as you can in just seven days. The longer the route the more points you get but also the more difficult to complete. Players also gain points by fulfilling Destination Tickets and by completing the longest route. Ticket to Ride is a delicate balance of drawing cards, claiming routes and securing destination cards. It\'s a game you can learn to play in minutes but will keep you entertained for years to come.','publish','open','closed','','ticket-to-ride','','','2016-09-12 17:23:20','2016-09-13 00:23:20','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/ticket-to-ride-2/',0,'product','',0),(2530,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Drunk, Stoned, or Stupid','<em>Drunk Stoned or Stupid</em> is a party game where in each round a card is drawn and the group decides who in the group should be tagged with the card.\n \n First a player declares themselves the judge and reads a card aloud. Each person then says who in the group should be tagged with this card and why.\n \n Accusations can be based off of personality traits, past stories, or really anything at all. As long as you can argue your point, it\'s fair game. The judge considers all accusations and makes the final ruling on who should be tagged with the card.\n \n This person keeps the card along with the shame. The judge rotates to the next person in the group. First person with 7 cards loses. There are no winners in this game... only losers.','publish','open','closed','','drunk-stoned-or-stupid','','','2016-09-12 17:23:20','2016-09-13 00:23:20','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/drunk-stoned-or-stupid-2/',0,'product','',0),(2531,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Drunko - Drink or Dare','A Drinking Card Game for Daring Adults. The best card game for your next party, regardless of whether you are for or against humanity! Drunko is for adults who love to get together with friends and have fun laughing their asses off at each others\' expenses. Game play follows the familiar rules of matching the number or color of the previous card laid, but adds the additional dimensions of drinking and executing hilarious dares. The five DARE theme categories are Lame, Horny, Dare Devil, Nympho and No Fear with eight progressively more challenging dares on each theme card. You may be dared to lip sync a song, or talk dirty to an opponent, or even run around half-naked. Be forewarned that choosing to not execute the dare means you\'ll have to finish your drink. How far are you willing to go? What are you willing to do for a laugh? Will you take the drink or do the DARE? Buy today so you can be the hero at your next party!','publish','open','closed','','drunko-drink-or-dare','','','2016-09-12 17:23:20','2016-09-13 00:23:20','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/drunko-drink-or-dare/',0,'product','',0),(2532,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Family Feud','In Family Feud, players battle it out four rounds -- Bullseye, Face-Off, The Feud, and Fast Money. Over 750 questions will test your knowledge of pop culture and daily observation. Teams try to match the most popular answers based on survey questions that were posed to 100 people.\r\n\r\nThis exciting and hilarious game even comes with a scoreboard, play money, question cards, a strike indicator and 3 ‘X’ markers. Find out the top answers for -- “How much allowance should a 10-year-old get each week?” or “What ingredient might a recipe call for a ‘pinch\' of?”\r\n\r\nFamily Feud is a pretty accurate recreation of the television show. Get ready for hours of family entertainment! Whose team will make it to the jackpot round? If you’re a fan of the popular TV show, you’ll love this version of the game!','publish','open','closed','','family-feud','','','2016-09-12 17:23:20','2016-09-13 00:23:20','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/family-feud/',0,'product','',0),(2533,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Exploding Kittens: NSFW Edition','Exploding Kittens is a card game for people who are into kittens and explosions and laser beams and sometimes goats.\n \n In this highly-strategic, kitty-powered version of Russian Roulette, players draw cards until someone draws an Exploding Kitten, at which point they explode, they are dead, and they are out of the game -- unless that player has a Defuse card, which can defuse the Kitten using things like laser pointers, belly rubs, and catnip sandwiches. All of the other cards in the deck are used to move, mitigate, or avoid the Exploding Kittens.\n \n This NSFW version of the game contains the full version of Exploding Kittens, but the artwork on each card has been replaced with content too horrible/amazing to be used in the original Exploding Kittens game. The NSFW Edition can be played with 2 to 5 players or combined with any other deck to play with up to 9 players.','publish','open','closed','','exploding-kittens-nsfw-edition','','','2016-09-12 17:23:20','2016-09-13 00:23:20','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/exploding-kittens-nsfw-edition-2/',0,'product','',0),(2534,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Star Wars: X-Wing Miniatures','Star Wars X-Wing Miniatures is a game of tactical space combat that lets you take control of the most advanced starfighters in the galaxy. The powerful Rebel X-wings and Imperial TIE fighters get to face each other in an epic space battle! \n\nX-Wing recreates exciting Star Wars scenarios throughout its gameplay. It features stunningly detailed and painted miniatures. You take the role of squad leader that will lead fighters into space combat. So get your spacesuit ready, select your crew, plan an attack, and complete your mission!  \n\nIf you are a Star Wars fan, this fun and action-packed game is definitely for you!','publish','open','closed','','star-wars-x-wing-miniatures','','','2016-09-12 17:23:20','2016-09-13 00:23:20','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/star-wars-x-wing-miniatures/',0,'product','',0),(2535,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','A Game of Thrones','King Robert Baratheon is dead, and the lands of Westeros brace for battle. In the second edition of A Game of Thrones: The Board Game, three to six players take on the roles of the great Houses of the Seven Kingdoms of Westeros, as they vie for control of the Iron Throne. Based on the best-selling A Song of Ice and Fire series by George R.R. Martin, A Game of Thrones is an epic board game in which it will take more than military might to win. Through strategic planning, masterful diplomacy, and clever card play, spread your influence over Westeros!','publish','open','closed','','a-game-of-thrones','','','2016-09-14 16:50:26','2016-09-14 23:50:26','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/a-game-of-thrones-2/',0,'product','',0),(2536,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Arkham Horror','Arkham Horror features stunning artwork and graphical design. Players can select from 16 unique playable investigator characters, each with unique abilities, and will square off against the diabolical servants of 8 Ancient Ones, including Ithaqua, Hastur, and the terrible Cthulhu! No fan of the Cthulhu Mythos will want to miss the opportunity to acquire this classic Call of Cthulhu board game!','publish','open','closed','','arkham-horror','','','2016-09-14 16:50:24','2016-09-14 23:50:24','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/arkham-horror-2/',0,'product','',0),(2537,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Eldritch Horror','Eldritch Horror is a cooperative game of terror and adventure in which one to eight players take the roles of globetrotting investigators working to solve mysteries, gather clues and protect the world from an Ancient One - an elder being intent on destroying our world. Each Ancient One comes with its own unique decks of Mystery and Research cards, which draw you deeper into the lore surrounding each loathsome creature. Discover the true name of Azathoth or battle Cthulhu on the high seas.','publish','open','closed','','eldritch-horror','','','2016-09-14 16:50:25','2016-09-14 23:50:25','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/eldritch-horror-2/',0,'product','',0),(2538,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Twilight Imperium','An age of twilight shall once more spread across the galaxy. A broken empire shall once more be re-forged. Hidden powers from dark space shall come forth to make an ancient claim. War shall rage across space. Secret treaties, political whispers, and devious plots shall again echo through the halls of the imperial city on Mecatol Rex. This is an epic empire-building game of interstellar conflict, trade, and struggle for power. Players take the roles of ancient galactic civilizations, each seeking to seize the imperial throne via warfare, diplomacy, and technological progression.','publish','open','closed','','twilight-imperium','','','2016-09-12 17:23:21','2016-09-13 00:23:21','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/twilight-imperium-2/',0,'product','',0),(2539,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Castle Panic','In Castle Panic players must work together to defend their castle, in the center of the board, from monsters that attack out of the forest, at the edges of the board. Players trade cards, hit and slay monsters, and plan strategies together to keep their castle towers intact. The players either win or lose together, but only the player with the most victory points is declared the Master Slayer.','publish','open','closed','','castle-panic','','','2016-09-12 17:23:21','2016-09-13 00:23:21','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/castle-panic-2/',0,'product','',0),(2540,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Here Kitty Kitty','Here Kitty Kitty is a strategy game for kids 10 and older who love everything and anything about cats.\n\nYou and 2-5 of your feline-crazy friends take advantage of the cat infestation of the Neighborhood by trying to take all of the 40 oh-so-cute kitties. \n\nDuring your turn, you can move one of the cats from the Neighborhood onto your Property; into the Yard, onto the Porch or into the House. Each location lets you earn a certain number of points or take advantage of the special scoring conditions.\n\nThe game ends after the last card gets drawn. The player with the most points will be crowned king of the cats.','publish','open','closed','','here-kitty-kitty','','','2016-09-12 17:23:21','2016-09-13 00:23:21','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/here-kitty-kitty/',0,'product','',0),(2541,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Last Night on Earth: The Zombie Board Game','Last Night on Earth is a fast-paced game of small-town heroes pitted against a horde of the undead. It’s a living nightmare set in the rural town of Woodinvale. Players can split into teams and take on the role of either Heroes or Zombies. \n\nHeroes, who are given special abilities, need to work together in order to escape to safety. Zombie players are in control of unending waves of attack, spreading over the town like wildfire! The human team can choose to accomplish different goals – simple survival, rescue, or escape.  \n\nWith its movie-like plot, Last Night on Earth draws its players in completely. Will the human team make it out alive? Will the zombies get to enjoy a feast of brains? This tactical game gives out a thrilling experience, added with a dose of unexpected fun and laughter as the challenges unfold!','publish','open','closed','','last-night-on-earth-the-zombie-board-game','','','2016-09-12 17:23:21','2016-09-13 00:23:21','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/last-night-on-earth-the-zombie-board-game/',0,'product','',0),(2542,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Shadows of Brimstone: City of the Ancients','Set in the Wild West, Shadows of Brimstone tells the story of ‘darkstone’ – a strange mineral found during the second half of the 19th century. While it proved very valuable to earth, it’s also very dangerous! The hoards of darkstone created a portal for evil monsters to roam and destroy our land.\r\n\r\nPlayers of the game will take on roles of classic western heroes such as the Law Man, Gunslinger, or Saloon Girl. You will bravely venture into the dark mines where ancient demons and menacing creatures have taken over!\r\n\r\nWill you be able to stop the darkness from taking over the world? Will you be able to seal the portal of horrific monsters? Shadows of Brimstone comes with lots of dice, cards, map tiles, miniatures, and so much more! If you’re in the mood to for some cowboy versus demon spawn battle, this game is for you!','publish','open','closed','','shadows-of-brimstone-city-of-the-ancients','','','2016-09-12 17:23:22','2016-09-13 00:23:22','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/shadows-of-brimstone-city-of-the-ancients/',0,'product','',0),(2543,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Fauna','Think you’re the greatest animal expert of all? Put your knowledge to the test by playing Fauna.\n\nFauna is an award-winning trivia board game that lets players pit their vast knowledge of the animal kingdom against each other.\n\nThe picture and name of an animal are presented in each round. You and your friends say out loud or guess the animal\'s height, length, tail length, weight and the region where it lives. \n\nThose who get it right can occupy the region, which is mapped out on the board, using his or her token to earn points. Keep your cool but stay alert to gain the required points to win.','publish','open','closed','','fauna','','','2016-09-12 17:23:22','2016-09-13 00:23:22','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/fauna/',0,'product','',0),(2544,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Disturbed Friends','Disturbed Friends is a party game designed to find out how disturbed your friends are, but, more importantly, how disturbed they think you are.Â You will be faced with horrible situations, sexual scenarios and unethical debates that may cause you to re-evaluate your friendships.Â The game is simple, even a handicapped goat could play. One unlucky player picks up a multiple choice question card and reads it out loud. The other players vote on what answer they think their friend will choose.Â Predict how disturbed your friend is and receive a cartoon #WINNING card that mocks the wonderful world we live in. The player with the most #WINNING cards wins.Â Play until you hate yourself.','publish','open','closed','','disturbed-friends','','','2016-09-12 17:23:22','2016-09-13 00:23:22','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/disturbed-friends-2/',0,'product','',0),(2545,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Alien Frontiers','Alien Frontiers is a multi award-winning strategy board game where players are deep-space colonists vying for control over a newly uninhabited planet and the absolute right to use the astounding artifact in orbit that the alien race left behind.\n\nBefore the game starts, each player receives some dice that represent your fleet of space ships. Begin playing by rolling your dice. With each roll you can assign your ships to the orbital facilities on the board to gain resources, expand your fleet, claim territory and exert influence.\n\nBut your opponents will be doing the same thing. Stack the odds in your favor with the Alien Tech cards. Playing them lets you manipulate your dice rolls and Territory Bonuses to break the rules－steal your rivals’ resources, invade their territory, pretty much anything it takes to win.','publish','open','closed','','alien-frontiers','','','2016-09-12 17:23:22','2016-09-13 00:23:22','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/alien-frontiers/',0,'product','',0),(2546,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Tiny Epic Galaxies','','publish','open','closed','','tiny-epic-galaxies','','','2016-09-12 17:23:22','2016-09-13 00:23:22','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/tiny-epic-galaxies/',0,'product','',0),(2547,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Forbidden Island','Forbidden Island is a co-operative tile based board game where players are hunting for ancient relics on a sinking island. Players need to collect all four treasures and get back to safety before the island is completely submerged! Every round the island sinks a little bit more. Each player has a role with a specific skill set - The Messenger can trade cards with anyone, The Explorer can move diagonally, The Diver can go into the water, The Navigator can move another player two tiles and The Engineer can shore up two tiles for one action. Fast paced and fun for the whole family!','publish','open','closed','','forbidden-island','','','2016-10-05 19:42:23','2016-10-06 02:42:23','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/forbidden-island-2/',0,'product','',0),(2548,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:18','2016-07-22 12:40:18','','Sushi Go!','Pass the sushi! In this fast-playing card game, the goal is to grab the best combination of sushi dishes as they whiz by. Score points for making the most maki rolls or for collecting a full set of sashimi. Dip your favorite nigiri in wasabi to triple its value. But be sure to leave room for dessert or else you\'ll eat into your score! Gather the most points and consider yourself the sushi master!','publish','open','closed','','sushi-go','','','2016-09-12 17:23:26','2016-09-13 00:23:26','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/sushi-go-2/',0,'product','',1),(2549,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Forbidden Desert','Forbidden Desert is an award-winning, action-packed board game that will surely test your skill for survival. It comes with a fresh, exciting plot and promotes good player interaction! The mission is to find four missing pieces of an airship, bring them to the launch pad and fly away to safety.  \n\nA players gets a character card at random. If you’re lucky, your role can be a water carrier or a climber, which are really helpful abilities in maintaining health throughout the game. For each turn, a player can take up to four actions – move, remove sand, excavate, and pick up an airship part. Be careful of the storm cards though, or you might cause the eye of the storm to shift around! \n\nPrepare for the blistering heat and blustering sand along the way! If you and your friends are in the mood for some great desert adventure, this is the game for you!','publish','open','closed','','forbidden-desert','','','2016-09-12 17:23:26','2016-09-13 00:23:26','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/forbidden-desert/',0,'product','',0),(2550,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Rory\'s Story Cubes','There are infinite ways to play with Rory\'s Story Cubes. You can play solitaire or with others. Here are some suggested uses: Party game or ice-breaker, Literacy development, Speaking &amp; listening skills, Creative inspiration, Mental workout, Problem solving. Rory\'s Story Cubes is a pocket-sized creative story generator, providing hours of imaginative play for all ages. With Rory\'s Story Cubes, anyone can become a great storyteller and there are no wrong answers. Simply roll the cubes and let the pictures spark your imagination!','publish','open','closed','','rorys-story-cubes','','','2016-09-12 17:23:27','2016-09-13 00:23:27','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/rorys-story-cubes-2/',0,'product','',1),(2551,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Hive','Hive is stimulating and highly-addictive at the same time! It has very simple rules and plays quickly. Each player takes on the role of an insect swarm. Your mission to win – capture your opponent\'s Queen!  \n\nThe horde consists of grasshoppers, beetles, soldier ants, spiders, and the queen bee. Each of these creatures has different combat abilities. Grasshoppers can jump directly across a line, beetles can move one space and on top of other pieces, soldier ants can move to any space, and spiders can move three spaces. \n\nWill you be able to surround your opponent\'s Queen and protect your own at the same time? Tension and excitement build as the game goes on! Think very carefully…one wrong move and you’ll lose the round! If you\'re into an exciting tactical pastime, and this masterful game is for you! ','publish','open','closed','','hive','','','2016-09-12 17:23:27','2016-09-13 00:23:27','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/hive/',0,'product','',0),(2552,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Twilight Struggle','Twilight Struggle is a two-player game simulating the forty-five year dance of intrigue, prestige, and occasional flares of warfare between the Soviet Union and the United States. Twilight Struggle recreates the conflict between the most powerful nation states the world has ever known. The scope of the game covers the entire world as it was found in 1945. Players move units and exert influence in attempts to gain allies and control for their superpower.','publish','open','closed','','twilight-struggle','','','2016-09-14 16:50:23','2016-09-14 23:50:23','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/twilight-struggle-2/',0,'product','',0),(2553,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Sentinels of the Multiverse','Sentinels of the Multiverse is a cooperative, fixed-deck card game with a comic book flavor. The game tells the story of a team of heroes called “Sentinels” all with impressive powers and abilities. They stand ready to face any threats of destruction from the forces of evil that want to take over the world. \n\nEach player will take on the role as one of the ten heroes. You and your friends will go into a battle against ruthless villains – a mad scientist with his terrifying inventions, an alien warlord with an army of bizarre minions, a rampaging giant robot, and more! \n\nIf you’re a comic book geek or just into fun action-packed card games, you’ll surely enjoy Sentinels of the Multiverse! The game is challenging, engaging, and just simply awesome!','publish','open','closed','','sentinels-of-the-multiverse','','','2016-09-12 17:23:27','2016-09-13 00:23:27','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/sentinels-of-the-multiverse/',0,'product','',0),(2554,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Zpocalypse','Zpocalypse is set in a post-apocalyptic wasteland. Players take on the role of the lucky few who managed to make it to an old bunker. You have a mission to save a group of survivors under your guidance until the cavalry arrives. They are also very hungry so time is of the essence!  \n\nScavenging and survival are a must. You’ll need food, guns, and ammo. Each player forms and controls his own squad. As the leader of the group, you must go out to the wasteland to look for supplies. Fortify the base, strengthen your walls, and create a strategy to fend off the next zombie attack! \n\nIf you’re in the mood for some zombie hide and seek with an action-packed gameplay, grab your copy of Zpocalypse now!','publish','open','closed','','zpocalypse','','','2016-09-12 17:23:27','2016-09-13 00:23:27','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/zpocalypse/',0,'product','',0),(2555,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Ninja Dice','In Ninja Dice, it\'s not just what you roll, where the dice land is important. A system that is unique to this game. Dice that have a line on their front edge can modify other dice partially or completely in front of them, like an arc of fire. \n\nDuring the game, every time the active player rolls, the other players roll against them. Each re-roll only adds the threat, allowing opponents to steal your treasure! If you beat the challenges, you score points and escape. The player that gets the highest score wins! \n\nAre you ready to loot houses without waking anyone up? Who will become the ultimate Ninja master? If you’re in the mood for a fun Japanese-themed game and ninja fights, grab a copy of Ninja Dice now!','publish','open','closed','','ninja-dice','','','2016-09-12 17:23:27','2016-09-13 00:23:27','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/ninja-dice/',0,'product','',0),(2556,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Worm Up!','Worm your way to the finish line as you try to out-guess and out-smart your opponents! But donâ€™t be surprised if the worms take an unexpected turn. Fast, frolicking family fun!','publish','open','closed','','worm-up','','','2016-09-12 17:23:27','2016-09-13 00:23:27','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/worm-up-2/',0,'product','',0),(2557,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Animal Upon Animal','Stack up the fun with Animal Upon Animal! . Players race each other to be the first to place all of their animals upon the animal pile before any of the other players. A roll of the die tells the players how many animals can be placed or whether they can add to the alligator base. This learning games fosters hand-eye coordination and fine motor skills.','publish','open','closed','','animal-upon-animal','','','2016-09-12 17:23:28','2016-09-13 00:23:28','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/animal-upon-animal-2/',0,'product','',0),(2558,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Rhino Hero','It\'s a bird! It\'s a plane! It\'s Super Rhino! No building too high, no street too dangerous for this caped crusader, as he scales buildings and patrols the city protecting the citizens. On his quest for safety, he must use caution as even the most solid buildings may start to sway and wobble. Can you help Super Rhino accomplish the challenge to build a skyscraper as tall and solid as can be?','publish','open','closed','','rhino-hero','','','2016-09-12 17:23:28','2016-09-13 00:23:28','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/rhino-hero-2/',0,'product','',0),(2559,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Dancing Eggs','Caught the dancing egg? Fine, now run around the table - with the egg under your armpit or between the knees ... As soon as an egg drops, the game is over. And beware of egg thieves! A boisterous bouncing action game for 2-4 players. Packaged in an egg crate makes it a great bring along game. Helps develop fine and large motor skill.','publish','open','closed','','dancing-eggs','','','2016-09-12 17:23:28','2016-09-13 00:23:28','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/dancing-eggs-2/',0,'product','',0),(2560,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Monopoly','In Monopoly players vie for real estate upon which they can place houses and hotels in order to collect rent from any player who happens to land on that real estate. The objective is to make money, haggle for land and avoid jailtime! The classic family game that\'s been enjoyed for generations!','publish','open','closed','','monopoly','','','2016-09-14 16:50:22','2016-09-14 23:50:22','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/monopoly-2/',0,'product','',0),(2561,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Clue','The mystery you love to solve again and again is even more intense! Clue is back with a modern twist, and you have to find out who is responsible for murdering the host at a millionaire\'s mansion or a boardwalk. Get the scoop on the updated rooms, weapons and guests, and start detecting! Was it Plum with the wrench in the bedroom? Or Green with the pistol in the kitchen? Narrow down what you know and make your accusation! If you\'re right about the location, weapon and suspect, you\'re the mystery winner!','publish','open','closed','','clue','','','2016-09-12 17:23:28','2016-09-13 00:23:28','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/clue-2/',0,'product','',0),(2562,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Risk','The grandpoobah of strategy board games Risk is a classic that has endured. The objective of Risk is simple and straight forward - conquer the world. Achieving said goal is another matter. Players must employ strategy, take some risks (ayyyy!) and have a bit of luck to defeat their enemies and gain ground. The more territories conquered the closer to victory but players must be mindful of spreading themselves too thin and becoming vulnerable to attack.','publish','open','closed','','risk','','','2016-09-12 17:23:28','2016-09-13 00:23:28','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/risk-2/',0,'product','',0),(2563,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','The Game of Life','Do you have what it takes to win The Game of Life My Dream Job game? It\'s the family game that\'s easy to set up, quick to play, and exciting along the way. Live the life you want by choosing your path for a life of action, adventure, and unexpected surprises. Will you receive a fortune and lose it as quickly as you got it? Will you need a bank loan to pay a debt? Once everyone reaches the end of the game at retirement, everyone pays their debts and adds up their wealth. The player with the most money wins the game.','publish','open','closed','','the-game-of-life','','','2016-09-12 17:23:28','2016-09-13 00:23:28','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/the-game-of-life-2/',0,'product','',0),(2564,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Scrabble','Scrabble, the classic crossword game, is full-on fun for friends and family. You can feel the excitement begin as soon as you rack up your letters, choose a great word, and hope to land on a triple-word score. Play the popular Scrabble game the classic way as you take on opponents head-to-head, for a challenging and fun time whether you\'re a beginner or an expert.','publish','open','closed','','scrabble','','','2016-09-12 17:23:28','2016-09-13 00:23:28','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/scrabble-2/',0,'product','',1),(2565,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Trivial Pursuit','Trivial Pursuit is the original trivia game that started it all. Each player has a circular playing piece with six pie-shaped holes. The goal of the game is to collect a pie in each color. The colors correspond to different question categories. The board consists of a circular track with spaces in seven different colors. Once the player has one pie in each color, she can move along the spokes to the middle of the board to win the game.','publish','open','closed','','trivial-pursuit','','','2016-09-12 17:23:29','2016-09-13 00:23:29','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/trivial-pursuit-2/',0,'product','',0),(2566,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Operation','In the Operation game, you get to be the doctor and make Cavity Sam better or get the buzzer! Cure him of all his wacky ailments like headphone headache and gamer\'s thumb by picking funny ailment pieces out of the game tray with a pair of tweezers. But watch out! If you touch the sides of the openings, you\'ll get the buzzer and light up Cavity Sam\'s nose! The player who removes the most ailments wins!','publish','open','closed','','operation','','','2016-09-12 17:23:29','2016-09-13 00:23:29','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/operation-2/',0,'product','',1),(2567,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Taboo','Taboo, the laugh out loud, out-of-your-seat game of forbidden words. In the Taboo game, you need to get your team to guess the secret word, but the obvious clues are strictly off-limits. To get your team to say pinball, would you say arcade, game, flippers, tilt or roll? In this game you can\'t because all of those words are strictly forbidden. Get your team to guess as many words as you can while you race against the clock. But watch out; if you say a forbidden word, the other team will \"squeak\" you and you lose the word.Â This unpredictable party game will keep you on your toes as you think fast and build up the points for each card guessed correctly.Â The team with the most points wins.','publish','open','closed','','taboo','','','2016-09-12 17:23:33','2016-09-13 00:23:33','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/taboo-2/',0,'product','',0),(2568,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:26','2016-07-22 12:40:26','','Scattergories','Team up to be creative in this party game where being different counts! In the Scattergories game, teams come up with answers that fit the categories listed on their card. Sounds easy, but the answers need to start with the letter rolled on the die! Come up with as many answers as you can before time runs out, but be creative â€“ your team only gets points if no other team has the same answer.','publish','open','closed','','scattergories','','','2016-09-12 17:23:33','2016-09-13 00:23:33','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/scattergories-2/',0,'product','',0),(2569,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Loopin\' Louie','Watch out, Loopin Louie is out and about and its up to you to protect your chickens from his dizzy diving! Every time he flies by in his airplane, he will be out to knock another chicken into the chute below. But if you can flip him out of the way with your paddle, he will go after someone elses chicken! Be ready, though, because hes got some super-dodgy moves! The player with the last chicken standing wins!','publish','open','closed','','loopin-louie','','','2016-09-12 17:23:33','2016-09-13 00:23:33','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/loopin-louie-2/',0,'product','',0),(2570,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Battleship','Battleship is the classic game of naval combat and strategy. A game for two, each player has a fleet of destroyers, submarines, patrol boats, aircraft carriers and of course battleships to deploy on a grid. Each players\' grid is hidden from their opponent and the objective is to destroy their fleet by calling out the correct coordinates to land hits! A fast paced, easy to pick up classic that has stood the test of time.','publish','open','closed','','battleship','','','2016-09-12 17:23:33','2016-09-13 00:23:33','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/battleship/',0,'product','',1),(2571,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Candy Land','Candy Land is the classic kids board game of magic and sweets! Players choose their sweet character and travel down the rainbow path to Peppermint Forest, the Lagoon of Lord Licorice and the Ice Palace! Candy Land is a game of imagination, candy and fun!','publish','open','closed','','candy-land','','','2016-09-12 17:23:33','2016-09-13 00:23:33','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/candy-land/',0,'product','',1),(2572,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Cranium','Cranium is a party game of brain power. Players are divided into two, three or four teams. Each team need to accomplish feats in four different categories to score points and win the game. The Categories include - Creative Cat: A player must clue in her teammate to the correct word by drawing or sculpting it; Data Head - A mishmash of trivia questions need answering; Word Worm - players must identify words with missing letters, scrambled or by definition; Star Performer - Players whistle a song, perform a celebrity impression or act out a clue. Teams must successfully acquire a card from each category in order to enter Cranium Central for a chance at winning the game.','publish','open','closed','','cranium','','','2016-09-12 17:23:34','2016-09-13 00:23:34','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/cranium/',0,'product','',0),(2573,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Parcheesi','Parcheesi is played with two dice, four pawns per player, and a board. Animal pawns represent four of the most revered animals of India – cow, elephant, camel, and tiger. The goal is to move the pawns around the board in an attempt to get all the pieces “home”.\r\n\r\nTo begin the game, each player picks an animal. The pawns are then placed in the corresponding start space on the board. In order to move a pawn, you must roll a five either on one dice, or from a combination of both dice.\r\n\r\nBe careful! Your opponents can capture your pawns. If this happens, they are returned to the corner and must start their journey over.\r\n\r\nParcheesi is a fun and exciting race for ages 6 and up! If you’re in the mood for a push-your-luck gameplay, grab a copy now!','publish','open','closed','','parcheesi','','','2016-09-12 17:23:34','2016-09-13 00:23:34','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/parcheesi/',0,'product','',0),(2574,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Pie Face','','publish','open','closed','','pie-face','','','2016-09-12 17:23:34','2016-09-13 00:23:34','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/pie-face/',0,'product','',0),(2575,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Sorry!','Sorry! is a mystery-solving guessing fun game where a player needs to slide, collide, and score. It requires little skill and a whole lot of luck! The mission is to bump your opponents’ pawns and hide in your Safety Zone, where pawns of other colors can\'t enter. \n\nTo win the game, a player must advance all four pawns from Start to Home by exact count from the cards. Cards are drawn to see how far you get to move one of your pawns on the board. Power-up tokens can give you special powers!  \n\nWill you be able to send your opponent’s pawns back to the starting line? Can your pawns make it Home first? Find out with this classic game of luck, strategy, and determination! Grab your copy of Sorry! now!','publish','open','closed','','sorry','','','2016-09-12 17:23:34','2016-09-13 00:23:34','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/sorry/',0,'product','',0),(2576,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Chutes and Ladders','Chutes and Ladders is a board game for kids 3-6 that teaches them the value of good deeds in a fun way.\n\nThe goal is to get your pawn to the last square on the board before the other players. \n\nSpin the spinner to see how many squares you can move. If you land on a square with a good deed, you can climb up the ladder and advance even farther－improving your chance of winning.\n\nBut if you land on the wrong square, you slide down a chute away from the finish line－letting the other players pull ahead.\n\nSo relax, keep your game face on and hope for only good deeds ahead for victory and a good, maybe even educational time.','publish','open','closed','','chutes-and-ladders','','','2016-09-12 17:23:34','2016-09-13 00:23:34','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/chutes-and-ladders/',0,'product','',2),(2577,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Machi Koro','Welcome to the city of Machi Koro, the Japanese card game that is sweeping the world. You\'ve just been elected Mayor. Congrats! Unfortunately the citizens have some pretty big demands: jobs, a theme park, a couple of cheese factories and maybe even a radio tower. A tough proposition since the city currently consists of a wheat field, a bakery and a single die. Armed only with your trusty die and a dream, you must grow Machi Koro into the largest city in the region. You will need to collect income from developments, build public works and steal from your neighbor\'s coffers. Just make sure they aren\'t doing the same to you! Machi Koro is a fast-paced light-hearted game for you and up to 3 friends. Once you\'ve had a taste of Machi Koro, this infectiously fun game may have you wondering if the dinner table ever served another purpose. They say you can\'t build Rome in a day, but Machi Koro will be built in less than 30 minutes!','publish','open','closed','','machi-koro','','','2016-09-12 17:23:34','2016-09-13 00:23:34','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/machi-koro-2/',0,'product','',0),(2578,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Awesome Kingdom: Tower of Hateskull','Awesome Kingdom: The Tower of Hateskull is a card game of dungeon crawling fun! Players take charge of one of eight epic characters, each with unique and radical powers, then enter the dungeon. The objective is to be the most awesome adventurer after three days of dungeoning! Each day consists of three turns and each turn players move to battle monsters, find treasure and discover magical items.','publish','open','closed','','awesome-kingdom-tower-of-hateskull','','','2016-09-12 17:23:34','2016-09-13 00:23:34','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/awesome-kingdom-tower-of-hateskull/',0,'product','',0),(2579,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','King of Tokyo','In King of Tokyo you play as ginormous robots, weird aliens and spoooky monsters with a singular objective - to destroy Tokyo. Also to beat up your opponents to be the King. Of Tokyo. So like, twogular objectives? Something like that. The point is you\'re a big baddie doing damage! Each turn you get three rolls of six dice which determine your actions - heal up, destroy a part of Tokyo or whack another monster. If you like Kaiju and rolling lots of dice this is the game for you.','publish','open','closed','','king-of-tokyo','','','2016-09-12 17:23:34','2016-09-13 00:23:34','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/king-of-tokyo-2/',0,'product','',1),(2580,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','King of New York','King of New York is an action-packed board game that transforms ‘the city that never sleeps’ into a breeding ground for monsters. This time, you and your friends are going to conquer the five boroughs of New York City – Manhattan, The Bronx, Queens, Staten Island, and Brooklyn! \n\nGet ready for a monstrous battle royale filled with fun and exciting surprises! King of New York introduces six brand new, combat-ready monsters to help you stomp on buildings, destroy military units, and more! Each roll of the dice determines the fate of each player. Your mission is easy – be the last monster standing or be the first to gain 20 points! \n\nPrepare for new rules and new monsters in an all new city! If you\'re in the mood for an exciting ‘monsteriffic’ experience this is the game for you!','publish','open','closed','','king-of-new-york','','','2016-09-12 17:23:35','2016-09-13 00:23:35','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/king-of-new-york/',0,'product','',0),(2581,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Night of the Grand Octopus','','publish','open','closed','','night-of-the-grand-octopus','','','2016-09-12 17:23:35','2016-09-13 00:23:35','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/night-of-the-grand-octopus/',0,'product','',0),(2582,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','The Resistance','The Resistance pits a small group of resistance fighters against a powerful and corrupt government. The resistance has launched a series of bold and daring missions to bring the government to its knees. Unfortunately spies have infiltrated the resistance ranks, ready to sabotage the carefully crafted plans. Even a single spy can take down a resistance mission team, choose your teams carefully or forever lose your chance for freedom. The Resistance artfully balances pure deduction elements with the social elements into a game that creates the adrenaline filled moments of high stakes pokerin a full interactive and social event.','publish','open','closed','','the-resistance','','','2016-09-12 17:23:35','2016-09-13 00:23:35','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/the-resistance-2/',0,'product','',0),(2583,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Coup','In Coup, players take on the role of a government official. The Resistance brought the government to the brink of collapse. You want to take advantage of the discord to rise to power. It’s up to you to manipulate, bribe, and bluff the weak political court.\r\n\r\nThe game consists of 15 card deck with three copies of five different characters, each with a unique set of powers. The Duke blocks you from taking foreign aid. An Assassin can kill another player\'s character. A Contessa blocks an assassination attempt. The Captain can stop thieves. An Ambassador can help you exchange cards.\r\n\r\nThe goal is to be the last player standing, armed with a great influence. To be successful, destroy the influence of your rivals and force them into exile! Who will be the next leader of the court? Who will gain the most influence?','publish','open','closed','','coup','','','2016-09-12 17:23:35','2016-09-13 00:23:35','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/coup-2/',0,'product','',0),(2584,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Dragon Slayer','Dragon Slayer is a role playing game that gives players the chance to become the ultimate dragon slayer of a magical world.\r\n\r\nIn the world full of ferocious dragons, you and your friends are the bravest fighters－the most fearless dragon slayers of all competing to become the master.\r\n\r\nThe beasts aren’t the only danger. Any player can challenge any opponent during his or her Dragon Hunt.\r\n\r\nAside from losing, how you react to a challenge affects your chance of winning the game. There is also the order in which to best slay the beasts to figure out.\r\n\r\nUse all your skills to make all the right moves and be crowned the master dragon slayer.','publish','open','closed','','dragon-slayer','','','2016-09-12 17:23:35','2016-09-13 00:23:35','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/dragon-slayer/',0,'product','',0),(2585,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Flash Point','Flash Point is a cooperative game of fire rescue. Get ready to save lives and property by rescuing trapped occupants and extinguish fires.\r\n\r\nFlash Point lets players take on the role of a firefighter. The mission is to save 7 of 10 victims from a raging building fire. The challenge is to work together and use each player’s strengths to achieve victory.\r\n\r\nThe firefighters have sprung into action, but the fire spreads and starts to block off pathways. Time is running out! If 4 victims perish in the blaze or the building collapses from taking too much damage, the players lose. When the team rescues a 7th victim, they win instantly.\r\n\r\nAction points can let you move, open or close doors, extinguish fires, or chop through walls. Rolling the dice can help determine coordinates for placing a Smoke marker. Be careful of explosions!','publish','open','closed','','flash-point','','','2016-09-12 17:23:35','2016-09-13 00:23:35','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/flash-point/',0,'product','',0),(2586,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Laser Khet 2.0','Laser Khet 2.0 is an upgraded version of the previously released Khet. The latest version has lasers built-in to special Sphinx pieces that perch in the corner. These can now rotate to change the angle of the beam! The goal is to bounce the beam from mirrored piece to mirrored piece and hit your opponent’s Pharaoh.\r\n\r\nThe game consists of a slim, portable board and four types of Egyptian-themed pieces such as the Pharaoh, Anubis, pyramid, and scarab. The Pharaoh is your King, so protect him at all cost!\r\n\r\nThe first person to strike the Pharaoh wins! Use each piece strategically while shielding them from harm! In Laser Khet 2.0, the laser is your primary weapon. If you love a fun but challenging game, this game is for you!','publish','open','closed','','laser-khet-2-0','','','2016-09-12 17:25:07','2016-09-13 00:25:07','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/laser-khet-2-0/',0,'product','',0),(2587,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Funemployed!','The game of real jobs and unreal qualifications! Players take turns \"interviewing\" for a real job while having to work in 4 qualifications for the job. Can you justify your peg leg to be an astronaut? How about your tentacles to be a child actor? It\'s as much fun as job interview usually isn\'t.','publish','open','closed','','funemployed','','','2016-09-12 17:23:40','2016-09-13 00:23:40','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/funemployed-2/',0,'product','',0),(2588,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:35','2016-07-22 12:40:35','','Tanto Cuore','A deck-building card game fresh from Japan which has a mechanic similar to Dominion. Each player plays as the Lord of a mansion and hires maids to fill out their house to become the King of Maids! The end goal is simple enough, the player who has the most Victory Points at the end of the game wins! Player\'s acquire Victory Points by employing a variety of maids and \'Love\' cards that allow for different strategies. You can even employ Private Maids that stick around to use their special powers each per turn! Some give you a bonus, or affect your opponents in a negative way. But beware, your opponents can make your maids sick or give them bad habits, affecting your maids in negative ways and decreasing your Victory Points!','publish','open','closed','','tanto-cuore','','','2016-09-12 17:23:40','2016-09-13 00:23:40','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/tanto-cuore-2/',0,'product','',0),(2589,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Sequence','Here’s a fun and exciting game of strategy the whole family will love! Sequence is a board and card game in one that’s simple and easy for everyone to play.\r\n\r\nSequence has some touches of rummy and poker that make it a favorite among adults. Any number from 2 to 12 that is divisible by 2 or 3 can play! Playing in teams can heighten the anticipation.\r\n\r\nThe goal of the game is to get a ‘sequence’ – a connected series of five of the same colored chip either up or down, across or diagonally on the playing surface. To win, you must be the first to score a row of five chips on the board!\r\n\r\nAre you ready to take on the Sequence challenge? If you are in the mood for some board and card game that involves strategy and excitement, this is for you!me!','publish','open','closed','','sequence','','','2016-09-12 17:23:40','2016-09-13 00:23:40','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/sequence/',0,'product','',1),(2590,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Argent: The Consortium','Argent: The Consortium is a strategy board game of magic, influence and betrayal! Players are vying for the illustrious position of Chancelor at the Argent University of Magic. Players must gather resources and allies, research to master powerful spells and sabotage the plans of their rivals! Argent is a game not of luck but of player interaction, wits and secrecy!','publish','open','closed','','argent-the-consortium','','','2016-09-12 17:23:40','2016-09-13 00:23:40','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/argent-the-consortium/',0,'product','',0),(2591,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Fluxx','Fluxx is a card game unlike any other you\'ve played. The rules and win conditions are continually being changed throughout the game - by the players! Players start out with three cards each, and every card played alters the very mechanics of the gameplay. Play fast and loose to have a good time. Learning the game is easy because they\'re different every time! Fun for the whole family.','publish','open','closed','','fluxx','','','2016-09-12 17:23:40','2016-09-13 00:23:40','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/fluxx-2/',0,'product','',0),(2592,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Monarch','A light strategy and succession board game, Monarch takes you into the mysterious kingdom of Minerva. It is where your abilities as a future ruler will be tested!   \n\nThe goal in Monarch is simple. A player needs to outperform her siblings and assemble the most impressive court! But the path to becoming the next Queen is not easy. The realm has threats of invasion and famine. The people are relying on you to defend the kingdom! It’s time to prove your intelligence, compassion, and bravery. \n\nHere’s your chance to discover your destiny! If you are looking for an excellent board game for family and friends, that’s perfect for casual game nights, pick up a copy of Monarch!','publish','open','closed','','monarch','','','2016-09-12 17:23:40','2016-09-13 00:23:40','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/monarch/',0,'product','',0),(2593,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Apples to Apples','Apples to Apples is the quintessential party game - grab a grip of friends, deal the cards and go. Gameplay is fast paced and simple - there are red cards and there are green cards. Red cards are nouns and green cards are adjectives. Each player gets five red cards to start and each round the Judge reveals a green card. The remaining players choose a red card from their hand that best matches the green card. The Judge then determines which red card is the perfect match and the player who played that red card is the Judge for the next round.','publish','open','closed','','apples-to-apples','','','2016-09-12 17:23:40','2016-09-13 00:23:40','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/apples-to-apples-2/',0,'product','',2),(2594,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Blink','Blink Card Game-The World\'s Fastest Game.: It\'s faster than you think. Blink is the lightning-fast game where two players race to be the first to play all of their cards. Using sharp eyes and fast hands, players quickly try to match the shape, count, or color on the cards. The first player out of cards wins. Fast and portable, Blink is instant fun for everyone.','publish','open','closed','','blink','','','2016-09-12 17:23:41','2016-09-13 00:23:41','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/blink-2/',0,'product','',0),(2595,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Blokus','Blokus is a fast paced strategy game. Each player starts with 21 game pieces and the objective is to place all of them on the board before your opponents. But each piece placed must touch another piece of the same color, and must only be touching at the corner. Simple to learn but complex to play, good for the whole family.','publish','open','closed','','blokus','','','2016-09-12 17:23:41','2016-09-13 00:23:41','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/blokus/',0,'product','',0),(2596,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Uno','Uno is one (pun intended) of those classic games that never gets old! The perfect game for on the go, it isn\'t a true family gathering until someone breaks out the Uno! So go ahead and be the hero of the party. Don\'t SKIP this super inexpensive game or you\'ll have to REVERSE your tracks and buy it later! You\'re only one click away from UNO!','publish','open','closed','','uno','','','2016-09-12 17:23:41','2016-09-13 00:23:41','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/uno/',0,'product','',1),(2597,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Coconuts Crazy Monkey Dexterity Game','In Coconuts, players launch coconuts toward a field of cups in the middle of the playing area. Land in a cup, and you get to stack it on your player board; land in a cup on someone else board, and you get to move it to yours. By playing special Monkey King Magic cards, you can force opponents to shoot blind, take long shots, or otherwise bollix their efforts to cup a coconut. Whoever first completes a pyramid of six cups on his payer board wins\"','publish','open','closed','','coconuts-crazy-monkey-dexterity-game','','','2016-09-12 17:23:41','2016-09-13 00:23:41','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/coconuts-crazy-monkey-dexterity-game/',0,'product','',0),(2598,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Catan','Award winning strategy board game Catan from Mayfair Games is an instant classic for the whole family. The premise of the game is simple: players compete with one another to build the greatest civilization in Catan. This is achieved by acquiring resources to build settlements, cities and roads. Points are awarded for the longest road, largest army, as well as for each settlement and city. The first player to ten points is the victor. Catan is a game of strategy, bartering and betrayal that experienced players as well as new comers will enjoy.','publish','open','closed','','catan','','','2016-09-12 17:23:41','2016-09-13 00:23:41','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/catan-2/',0,'product','',0),(2599,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Caverna: The Cave of Farmers','In this game, you are the bearded leader of a small dwarf family which lives in a little cave in the mountains. Together, you cultivate the forest in front of your cave and dig deeper into the mountain. You furnish the caves as dwellings for your offspring as well as working spaces for small enterprises.','publish','open','closed','','caverna-the-cave-of-farmers','','','2016-09-14 16:50:21','2016-09-14 23:50:21','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/caverna-the-cave-of-farmers/',0,'product','',0),(2600,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Discworld: Ankh-Morpork','Discworld: Ankh-Morpork is an award-winning, role playing game where players are the leaders of the factions in battle for dominance over the most coveted city in the magical dimension.\n\nThe ruler of Ankh-Morpork, Lord Vetinari, has gone missing. You and your rivals now have the chance to take over the realm.\n\nSkillfully play your cards to successfully deploy your minions, expand your territory and deal with the wizards, assassins, watchmen and thieves you’ll encounter.\n\nA dedicated team of talented artists masterfully crafted the exquisitely detailed map and the over one hundred individually illustrated cards, giving justice to Discworld－the best-selling, comic-fantasy book series by acclaimed, late, English author Sir Terry Pratchett that the game was based on.\n','publish','open','closed','','discworld-ankh-morpork','','','2016-09-12 17:23:41','2016-09-13 00:23:41','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/discworld-ankh-morpork/',0,'product','',0),(2601,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Qwirkle','Qwirkle consists of 108 wooden blocks with six different shapes in six different colors. The rules are simple. Build lines by matching tiles based on either color or shape, and score points for doing so.\r\n\r\nThe game follows the tradition of Sequence, Scrabble, and Othello. But instead of adding letters together to make a word, Qwirkle uses colors and shapes to create a pattern. Points are scored based on how many rows you add your tiles to.\r\n\r\nThe game ends when the draw bag is depleted and one player plays all of his remaining blocks. The player with the highest score is declared the winner.\r\n\r\nQwirkle makes it easy for youngsters to understand and play. You just need a little luck and a little pattern recognition. Meanwhile, older kids and parents can have fun too! If you’re looking for a fun family game, this is for you!','publish','open','closed','','qwirkle','','','2016-09-12 17:23:41','2016-09-13 00:23:41','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/qwirkle/',0,'product','',0),(2602,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Spurs: A Tale in the Old West','In Spurs, players start out with their cowboys at different places on a map. Positioned on the board are three different towns. It also features different types of terrain – plains, forests, badlands, and mountains. During the game, players travel around the board attempting to earn victory points and money.\r\n\r\nChallenge tokens are seeded on the game board. It may include rounding up outlaws, hunting for animals, or fighting desperados! You may also encounter missions such as break wild horses, herd cattle, and search for gold.\r\n\r\nIf you’re looking for a thematic and action-packed cowboy game, grab your copy of Spurs: A Tale in the Old West!','publish','open','closed','','spurs-a-tale-in-the-old-west','','','2016-09-12 17:23:42','2016-09-13 00:23:42','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/spurs-a-tale-in-the-old-west/',0,'product','',0),(2603,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Luchador','Luchador! Mexican Wrestling Dice is a dynamic and colorful game based on the popular world of “Lucha Libre” or professional Mexican wrestling. The goal is to reduce the opponent’s strength points to zero to win by a Knock-Out. Or, hold the opponent down on the mat for a “count of three”. \n\nTo start the game, players take on the role of a masked wrestler. Each character has their own skills, super combos, strengths, and weaknesses. A wrestling ring is constructed from the cardboard components. To add some flare, you’ll be using a stand-up version of your wrestler in the ring. \n\nPrepare to throw yourself off the top rope! Who will win by Knock-out? Who will be the ultimate Luchador? If you love wrestling, you’ll definitely enjoy this game. Luchador! Mexican Wrestling Dice makes an ideal game for family game night!','publish','open','closed','','luchador','','','2016-09-12 17:23:42','2016-09-13 00:23:42','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/luchador/',0,'product','',1),(2604,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','DrunkQuest','DrunkQuest encourages competition – and drinking. You can play it with 3-6 of your closest liquor buddies! It also presents a fantasy narrative. Monsters appear, and players must defeat monsters in a drunk combat! Each player holds on to 1 hero card, 5 treasure cards, and 1 realm card. \n\nHero cards can give you different abilities. Realm cards give you a bonus based on the whole round. And treasure cards can be used to combat monsters, gain permanent items, and increase or decrease the drinking level. \n\nDrunkQuest is a very entertaining way to get drunk! Can you defeat all the monsters and be deemed as the drunken master of the night? If you’re in the mood to get drunk with friends and also want to fight monsters, this game is for you!','publish','open','closed','','drunkquest','','','2016-09-12 17:23:42','2016-09-13 00:23:42','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/drunkquest/',0,'product','',0),(2605,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Wits and Wagers','Wits &amp; Wager is history\'s most award-winning party game. Why does everyone love Wits &amp; Wagers? Because you don\'t need to know the answers to win! The excitement is betting on the best guess. First, everyone writes down a guess to a fun question like \"In inches, how tall is the Oscar statuette?\" Then players bet on which guess is closest to the right answer. Strike it big and you\'ll be cheering like you just hit the jackpot!','publish','open','closed','','wits-and-wagers','','','2016-09-12 17:23:42','2016-09-13 00:23:42','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/wits-and-wagers-2/',0,'product','',2),(2606,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Evolution','Have you seen Jurassic Park? Wish you could create creatures too? Play Evolution for such a chance. Evolution is an acclaimed strategy board game where players are the creators of brand-new dinosaur species. The game is set in an ecosystem that is dynamic yet scarce in food and full of predators. Play your Trait cards well to make sure your species adapt, survive and thrive. There are 4,000 Trait combinations you can make, so you and your friends are sure to have lots of funï¼and maybe even learn a thing or two about the world.','publish','open','closed','','evolution','','','2016-09-12 17:23:42','2016-09-13 00:23:42','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/evolution/',0,'product','',0),(2607,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 19:40:44','','Say Anything','In Say Anything, everyone has an opinion. The fun game will have you and your friends answer questions like “What’s the worst thing to say to a cop after getting pulled over?” or “Which celebrity would be the most fun to hang out with for a day?” The answer that people enjoy the most scores a point!\r\n\r\nThe game is comprised of 80 Question cards. Each card contains 5 questions, for a total of 400 questions. It also includes markers, answer boards, tokens, score board, and the SELECT-O-MATIC 5000!\r\n\r\nSay Anything encourages you to talk about interesting things and make ridiculous statements. Find out what hilarious things your friends will say! For a great social interaction and lots of laughs, grab a copy of this game now!','publish','open','closed','','say-anything','','','2016-09-14 14:38:11','2016-09-14 21:38:11','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/say-anything/',0,'product','',2),(2608,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:44','2016-07-22 12:40:44','','Snake Oil','Snake Oil is a party strategy game that lets players come up with potentially wacky 2-word products to sell to an unwitting customer. \n\nOne of you gets to play the customer. The rest combine two of their word cards into any product they like, no matter how zany it is, and makes a pitch to the customer. \n\nA pitch can only be 30 seconds long. The customer can end any pitch that’s longer. \n\nThe customer gives his Customer card to the product’s inventor, or the snake oil salesman who convinced him or her to buy it.\n\nThe game ends after all of the players have taken their turn as the customer. The player with the most Customer cards earns the bragging rights of the best snake oil salesman of all.','publish','open','closed','','snake-oil','','','2016-09-12 17:23:47','2016-09-13 00:23:47','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/snake-oil/',0,'product','',0),(2609,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Over The LIne','Over The Line is a party game that combines two classic guessing games and adds an entertaining, salty twist.\n\nLike in Charades and Pictionary, Over The Line has an active player who draws a card from the deck. That player then acts or draws out whatever is on the card and the other players must guess the word or words. \n\nNot all the cards are G-rated. Some have words about race, religion, sex, even bodily fluids! There are 350 cards in total.\n\nThe players have to figure it out before the timer counts down to zero. \n\nIf you stay cool and keep everything tongue in cheek, you’re sure to have loads of fun－and maybe even win.','publish','open','closed','','over-the-line','','','2016-09-12 17:23:48','2016-09-13 00:23:48','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/over-the-line/',0,'product','',0),(2610,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Monikers','Monikers is a dumb party game that respects your intelligence. The rules are pretty simple: get your friends to guess the name on your card. Each team has 60 seconds to get through as many weird, inappropriate names as they can. In the first round, you can say anything you want. In the second, you can only use one word. And in the third, you can\'t say anything at all - just charades. The same cards are used in each round, so by the end of the game, you\'ve made up a bunch of hilarious jokes together.','publish','open','closed','','monikers','','','2016-09-12 17:23:48','2016-09-13 00:23:48','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/monikers-2/',0,'product','',0),(2611,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','...And Then We Held Hands','...And Then We Held Hands is a unique, co-operative board game centered on working together non-verbally to find balance. Players alternate taking turns to complete \"emotional\" objectives by discarding emotional cards, thus allowing them to move. The ultimate objective is to meet the other player in the middle of the board and the players must co-ordinate their moves in order to achieve this. The tricky bit is players cannot communicate their strategies to one another - making it that much rewarding when the win condition is met!','publish','open','closed','','and-then-we-held-hands','','','2016-09-12 17:23:48','2016-09-13 00:23:48','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/and-then-we-held-hands/',0,'product','',0),(2612,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Tokaido','In Tokaido players take the trip to the ancient Japanese Tokugawak dynasty, traveling along the East Sea Road that connects Kyoto and Edo (ancient Tokyo). You will make your way through the game just like a normal traveler in the Land of the Rising Sun would – visiting temples, meeting different people, eating exotic foods, collecting souvenirs, visiting hot springs and enjoying panoramic views.\r\n\r\nPlayers set their own pace and this is where the strategy comes in. You can go fast and beat other players to certain stops or you can go slower allowing you to take more turns and possibly earn more points.\r\n\r\nA winner is determined at the end of the day based on the number of points collected. Tokaido is definitely a great addition if you want to bring some Japanese Zen and beautiful artwork to your game night.','publish','open','closed','','tokaido','','','2016-09-12 17:23:48','2016-09-13 00:23:48','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/tokaido/',0,'product','',1),(2613,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Stratego','Strategy - the classic game of Battlefield strategy. On a distant planet, two armies clash. Who will be victorious? You command an army of soldiers, generals and spies. Devise a plan and deploy your troops. Use strategic attack and clever deception to break through your opponentâ€™s line, but beware, of bombs and enemy spies. Capture the flag, and victory is yours.','publish','open','closed','','stratego','','','2016-09-12 17:23:48','2016-09-13 00:23:48','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/stratego-2/',0,'product','',0),(2614,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Hoot Owl Hoot','','publish','open','closed','','hoot-owl-hoot','','','2016-09-12 17:23:48','2016-09-13 00:23:48','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/hoot-owl-hoot/',0,'product','',0),(2615,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Dead of Winter: A Crossroads Game','Dead of Winter: A Crossroads Game puts 2-5 players in a small, weakened colony of survivors in a world where most of humanity is either dead or diseased, flesh-craving monsters. Each player leads a faction of survivors with dozens of different characters in the game. Dead of Winter is a meta-cooperative psychological survival game. This means players are working together toward one common victory condition - but for each individual player to achieve victory, he must also complete his personal secret objective. This secret objective could relate to a psychological tick that\'s fairly harmless to most others in the colony, a dangerous obsession that could put the main objective at risk, a desire for sabotage of the main mission, or (worst of all) vengeance against the colony!','publish','open','closed','','dead-of-winter-a-crossroads-game','','','2016-09-12 17:23:48','2016-09-13 00:23:48','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/dead-of-winter-a-crossroads-game/',0,'product','',1),(2616,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 19:40:53','','Mice and Mystics','','publish','open','closed','','mice-and-mystics','','','2016-09-16 09:00:44','2016-09-16 16:00:44','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/mice-and-mystics/',0,'product','',0),(2617,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Geek Out!','Geek Out! is the perfect party game that will surely keep the crowd awake! Players will enjoy proving their knowledge against their opponents. The game consists of a stack of cards with different categories – comic books, science fiction, fantasy, games, and miscellaneous. Each category is assigned a different colour. \n\nA player needs to roll the dice to determine the category and answer what is shown on the drawn card. To win, you should collect the most number of points! But wait, other players may ‘out-geek’ you and steal your points by bidding to list even more than the card requires! \n\nIf you\'re in the mood for some exciting trivia match, this is the game for you!','publish','open','closed','','geek-out','','','2016-09-12 17:23:49','2016-09-13 00:23:49','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/geek-out/',0,'product','',0),(2618,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Neuroshima Hex','Neuroshima Hex is an exciting, action-packed game of tactics! It’s an RPG about life after the end of the world. Get ready to fight mutants, robots, evil plants, even scavenge for supplies, and blow up monsters with plasma guns!\r\n\r\nYour mission is to destroy your opponent’s headquarters. Strong tactical decisions are a must if you hope to win! If a player’s headquarters is destroyed, they are out of the game. The headquarters with the most life left wins and will conquer the world of Neuroshima!\r\n\r\nNeuroshima Hex is fun, tactical, and unique! If you’re in the mood for some painfully vindictive game with abstract rules, this board game is for you!','publish','open','closed','','neuroshima-hex','','','2016-09-12 17:23:49','2016-09-13 00:23:49','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/neuroshima-hex/',0,'product','',0),(2619,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Imperial Settlers','In Imperial Settlers, players take on the role as one of four factions. The mission is to be successful in expanding your empire. Create new buildings to strengthen your economy. Look for mines and fields to gather resources. Build barracks and training grounds for your soldiers! \n\nEach player controls a deck of cards that are unique to his faction. In addition, there is a large deck of ‘common’ cards which are used by all players. For every completed objective, you gain victory points. The ultimate goal is to earn the most victory points to win the game. \n\nWill you be able to lead your faction to victory? Will you be able to expand your empire? If you’re ready to start an action-packed, civilization-building game, grab a copy of Imperial Settlers now!','publish','open','closed','','imperial-settlers','','','2016-09-12 17:23:49','2016-09-13 00:23:49','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/imperial-settlers/',0,'product','',0),(2620,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Rummikub','Rummikub comes with 106 tiles, in different colors, with numbers from 1 to 13, 2 jokers, and 4 playing racks. The goal is simple – get rid of all of your tiles! Or, if someone does it first, you should have a very low sum of numbers. \n\nThe game is similar to rummy card games. To win, a player can combine the tiles in runs or sets. Runs must contain least 3 tiles of the same color with consecutive numbers. Sets consist of groups of the same number. Jokers can be used as any number of any color. \n\nRummikub is perfect for game night and ideal for people of different ages to play together! It is recommended for players age 8 and above. The best part is, it can reinforce one’s STEM skills including sequencing, pattern recognition, and planning.','publish','open','closed','','rummikub','','','2016-09-12 17:23:49','2016-09-13 00:23:49','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/rummikub/',0,'product','',0),(2621,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Hanabi','In this challenging cooperative card game, players work together to launch a spectacular firework display. Trouble is, it\'s dark out, so you can\'t really see what you are working with. Each player holds their cards so that only the other players can see them. They must give each other vital information and remember all the information received. Then use the information to choose which cards to play. Helping each other play the right cards at the right time is the key to creating an unforgettable show and avoid being booed by the audience.','publish','open','closed','','hanabi','','','2016-09-12 17:23:49','2016-09-13 00:23:49','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/hanabi-2/',0,'product','',0),(2622,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Coal Baron','Can’t get enough of worker placement games? Coal Baron should be part of your collection! Set in 19th century Germany, it depicts the time when coal was abundant and ripe for the taking. Dive in and get your hands dirty!\r\n\r\nPlayers are owners of coal mines. The goal of each player is to become the richest Coal Baron! To accomplish this, you and your friends will work to extract coal, fulfill orders, buy coal carts, and expand tunnels. Each objective you complete will earn you victory points.\r\n\r\nAt the end of three rounds, whoever has the most victory points wins! Who will mine the most coal and fulfill the most orders? Who will become the richest Coal Baron?','publish','open','closed','','coal-baron','','','2016-09-12 17:23:49','2016-09-13 00:23:49','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/coal-baron/',0,'product','',0),(2623,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Qin','In Qin, players take on the role of Chinese warlords, fighting over provinces and conquering villages! The aim is to colonize the Chinese hinterland. You and your friends will seize territories and expand your influence by placing tiles and pagodas.\r\n\r\nThe rules are simple. Players start the game with a hand of three tiles. They take turns laying randomly-selected tiles with a combination of two red, blue, or yellow squares, in an attempt to pair up colors.\r\n\r\nEach player has 20 pagodas. The goal to place them all on the board. If you connect two tile squares of the same color to make a “province”, you mark it with a pagoda. Expand your territories! But be careful – opponents can also take over your territories!\r\n\r\nThe first player to place all of his pagodas on the board wins! Are you ready to test your luck? Who will colonize the Chinese hinterland?','publish','open','closed','','qin','','','2016-09-12 17:23:49','2016-09-13 00:23:49','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/qin/',0,'product','',0),(2624,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Panda Head','Panda Head consists of 63 card deck with pandas drawn in funny poses wearing adorable costumes. You’ll encounter a Panda policeman, Panda fairy, Panda caveman, a Panda scarecrow, and more! The goal is to get rid of your high-numbered cards and lose points.\r\n\r\nTo start the game, shuffle the cards to arrange them at random. Deal seven cards and place the rest in a deck. The first player will put one of his/her cards face-up in the center. The next player must place a card equal to or higher than the previous card.\r\n\r\nBig Panda cards count as one point higher than the highest Panda card played in the pile. The Bamboo card means 2 bonus points on top of the number of a Panda card played. Continue playing until a player topples above the 21 point limit. The one who stays awake the longest and scores the fewest points wins!','publish','open','closed','','panda-head','','','2016-09-12 17:23:49','2016-09-13 00:23:49','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/panda-head/',0,'product','',0),(2625,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','New Haven','In New Haven, players are land developers who must build their respective settlements. They gain resources by strategically placing land tiles and use them to erect buildings on their own village boards. The goal is to grow the biggest and most prosperous town!\r\n\r\nThe center board is the land between the player villages from which resources will be gathered. Utilize the riches of the land by cutting timber, quarrying stone, planting fields of wheat, and filling pastures with fat sheep! Develop a settlement worth as many points as possible.\r\n\r\nPlan your consumption wisely to match your needs and you\'ll be rewarded with tokens. Complete roads and avenues and attract the most colonists. The base game lasts ten turns. Whoever ends up with the biggest population wins the game!','publish','open','closed','','new-haven','','','2016-09-12 17:23:50','2016-09-13 00:23:50','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/new-haven/',0,'product','',0),(2626,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Masters of Venice','','publish','open','closed','','masters-of-venice','','','2016-09-12 17:23:50','2016-09-13 00:23:50','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/masters-of-venice/',0,'product','',0),(2627,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Mombasa','','publish','open','closed','','mombasa','','','2016-09-12 17:23:57','2016-09-13 00:23:57','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/mombasa/',0,'product','',0),(2628,2,'2016-07-22 12:40:53','2016-07-22 12:40:53','','Guess The Mess!','','publish','open','closed','','guess-the-mess','','','2016-09-12 17:23:57','2016-09-13 00:23:57','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/guess-the-mess/',0,'product','',0),(2629,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Smarty Party!','','publish','open','closed','','smarty-party','','','2016-09-12 17:23:57','2016-09-13 00:23:57','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/smarty-party/',0,'product','',0),(2630,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Spectaculum','','publish','open','closed','','spectaculum','','','2016-09-12 17:23:57','2016-09-13 00:23:57','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/spectaculum/',0,'product','',0),(2631,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Spellcaster','Spellcaster is a fun card game wherein players take on the role of rival Mages. They battle it out in a magical duel to get the title of “Grand Master Mage”. The goal is to exhaust your opponent\'s energies and earn the most sorcery sapphires.\r\n\r\nTo begin, players are dealt 3 cards each, given 10 yellow energy crystals, and 2 blue sorcery sapphires. For every turn, actions are -- draw a card, play a card and activate a card. There are 60 different spells from 4 fields of study: Combat, Conjuring, Healing and Sorcery.\r\n\r\nDefeat your rival Mage with magical combat moves, such as ‘Demonspawn’ and ‘Flame Beast’! Or, defend yourself with healing spells like ‘Repel Curse’ and ‘Word of Guarding’. It’s a fast tactical game that takes 10-15 minutes to play.','publish','open','closed','','spellcaster','','','2016-09-12 17:23:57','2016-09-13 00:23:57','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/spellcaster/',0,'product','',0),(2632,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Spike','Spike is a fun strategy game that uses trains as its theme. It lets you recreate one of the railroad’s crowning legacies -- connecting the cities and helping commerce flourish!\r\n\r\nSet in the early 1900’s, you own one of the fastest growing rail companies in the USA. It’s up to you to make a fabulously wealthy profit by expanding your rail network. Doing so will let you do more business between cities.\r\n\r\nThe ultimate goal is to amass a vast fortune. To begin, players pick a city and receive a number of random contracts and one route card. The more cities listed on your route card that you can connect, the more points you’ll earn.\r\n\r\nFor each turn, you must do one of the following: draw track cards, construct rail, set your train in motion, and upgrade one of your cars or use a movement boost. During the final round, the player with the most money wins.','publish','open','closed','','spike','','','2016-09-12 17:23:57','2016-09-13 00:23:57','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/spike/',0,'product','',0),(2633,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Spit It Out','','publish','open','closed','','spit-it-out','','','2016-09-12 17:23:57','2016-09-13 00:23:57','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/spit-it-out/',0,'product','',0),(2634,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Enchanted Forest','Get ready for some fairy tale search-and-find fun! Roll the dice and round the board, sneaking a peek at treasures hidden in the Enchanted Forest along the way. Be the first player to find the treasures the king seeks and the kingdom is yours! A magical twist on classic memory match.Get ready for some fairy tale search-and-find fun! Roll the dice and round the board, sneaking a peek at treasures hidden in the Enchanted Forest along the way. Be the first player to find the treasures the king seeks and the kingdom is yours! A magical twist on classic memory match.','publish','open','closed','','enchanted-forest','','','2016-09-12 17:23:58','2016-09-13 00:23:58','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/enchanted-forest-2/',0,'product','',0),(2635,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','The Castles of Burgundy','In The Castles of Burgundy you and up to three of your friends play as noble aristocrats with control over your own princedoms.\r\n\r\nThe Castles of Burgundy involves a game board and each player gets his own board to represent his princedom. The game is played over five phases, with each player rolling two six-faced dice. With every turn, you can the following actions – (1) get a tile from the game board, (2) build your village by placing a tile on your own board, (3) deliver goods and (4) use worker tokens to adjust the value of your dice. Each die corresponds to one action and the action that you can take depends on what number you rolled.\r\n\r\nWhen you’ve played all five phases, the player – or should we say Lord – that has the most number of victory points will reign supreme over the land.','publish','open','closed','','the-castles-of-burgundy','','','2016-09-12 17:23:58','2016-09-13 00:23:58','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/the-castles-of-burgundy/',0,'product','',0),(2636,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','San Juan','','publish','open','closed','','san-juan','','','2016-09-12 17:23:58','2016-09-13 00:23:58','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/san-juan/',0,'product','',0),(2637,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Kittens In A Blender','Kittens in a Blender is a fun, fast-paced card game that people who love cats and even dog persons will enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe game revolves around a twisted plot. Players must work to save all of their own kittens before they find the blender and turn into a ‘furball smoothie’! Kittens in a Blender features adorable 16 kittens with names from ‘Ham Sandwich’, ‘MC Catnip’, to ‘Chicken Noodle’.\r\n\r\nPlayers receive 2 points for every one of their kittens that were saved and lose a point for each one that got blended. Once all of the blend cards have been played, players total up their points. The one who has the most points wins!','publish','open','closed','','kittens-in-a-blender','','','2016-09-12 17:23:58','2016-09-13 00:23:58','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/kittens-in-a-blender/',0,'product','',1),(2638,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Gravwell: Escape From the 9th Dimension','Gravwell is an award-winning, easy-to-learn board game that will leave you wanting more! Your mission is simple – to reach the warp gate first or at least be the closest at the end of six rounds. How would you do that without fuel? A player needs to collect basic elements from asteroids to provide a little bit of thrust. \n\nThe game includes 26 alphabetized fuel cards which players can use to determine movement order and thrust. Each card shows a number that indicates how many spaces that element will move your ship. You can move in three ways – propulsion, repulsion, and tractor beam. The game board may just be a big spiral path but you’d be surprised! \n\nAre you ready to conquer space? If you’re in the mood for some out of this world adventure, and maybe escape from a black hole, Gravwell is for you! ','publish','open','closed','','gravwell-escape-from-the-9th-dimension','','','2016-09-12 17:23:58','2016-09-13 00:23:58','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/gravwell-escape-from-the-9th-dimension/',0,'product','',0),(2639,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Apotheca','Apotheca a light strategy game where players compete to craft potions in a secret marketplace. Missions include hiding ingredients, deceiving opponents, and using magical powers to mix concoctions. The first player to impress three apothecaries will be allowed to join their ranks!\r\n\r\nThe game is played on a 4x4 grid. For each turn, there are 4 possible actions to choose from – reveal, restock, power, and hire. If a player is able to match 3 Potion cards of the same color in a row or column, this Apothecary is satisfied with the player’s ability to mix potions.\r\n\r\nTo gain points, it’s important to keep revealing potions, collecting gems, and hiring new apothecaries. Trap your opponents with clever spatial moves, bluffing and misdirection. The game continues until 1 player appeases 3 Apothecary cards. The first player to make three matches wins!','publish','open','closed','','apotheca','','','2016-09-12 17:23:58','2016-09-13 00:23:58','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/apotheca/',0,'product','',0),(2640,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Lanterns: The Harvest Festival','Lanterns: The Harvest Festival is a tile placement game set in imperial China.  Players act as artisans decorating the palace lake with floating lanterns.  The artisan who earns the most honor before the festival starts wins the game.\r\n\r\nLantern’s elegant and engaging game-play by designer Christopher Chung features a unique mechanic were players must balance the placement of their tiles or risk helping their opponents on their way to victory.  It’s a give and take that provides hours of depth and strategy.\r\n\r\nOn a turn, a player places a tile depicting various color arrangements, and every player receives lantern cards based on the tile placed. Players dedicate sets of lantern cards to gain honor and favor.','publish','open','closed','','lanterns-the-harvest-festival','','','2016-09-12 17:23:58','2016-09-13 00:23:58','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/lanterns-the-harvest-festival/',0,'product','',0),(2641,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Terror In Meeple City','Terror in Meeple City is a fun and action-packed board game where players take on the role of a hungry, gigantic lizard! The goal is to cause the most damage throughout the city as you compete for territory. The inhabitants of the city are called ‘meeples’ and they are very tasty. \n\nEach player will hold on to a character card, power card, and a secret superpower card unique to his monster. During a turn, a player can choose two from these actions – move, demolish, toss vehicle, and breathe. To gain points, you must devour meeples, destroy buildings, and defeat other monsters. \n\nGet ready to lash out your tail and gobble as much meeples as you can! Who will cause the greatest destruction in the city? The monster with the most points at the end of the game wins! If you are looking for some good monster fun, Terror in Meeple City is for you!','publish','open','closed','','terror-in-meeple-city','','','2016-09-12 17:23:58','2016-09-13 00:23:58','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/terror-in-meeple-city/',0,'product','',0),(2642,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Dominion','Dominion is unlike other card and deck building games as you build your deck as you play. Every player begins the game with the same set of cards and there are source decks where a player may purchase additional cards. Which cards are bought and how they are played determine the outcome of the game. The objective of Dominion is to secure the most victory points, this is achieved by obtaining land, constructing buildings and collecting money. Dominion is a competitive and tactical card game that is fun as well as complex.','publish','open','closed','','dominion','','','2016-09-12 17:23:58','2016-09-13 00:23:58','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/dominion-2/',0,'product','',0),(2643,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Igloo Pop','The young ice giant has a big problem: he wants to buy fish sticks but he cannot remember how many and he has nine shopping lists in his basket. So he goes from igloo to igloo and shakes each. In each he listens to the delicious fish sticks bouncing off the igloo walls. When he thinks that the igloo in his hand has the same number of fish sticks as one of his shopping lists he takes it home. When he gets home there are no fish sticks in the igloo. Instead wild and laughing Eskimo children tumble out of the igloo. Excitedly they shout Shake us again! That was great fun! This is super thinks the young ice giant. Now I have found some new friends to play with! And he promptly forgets all about his shopping lists.','publish','open','closed','','igloo-pop','','','2016-09-12 17:23:59','2016-09-13 00:23:59','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/igloo-pop-2/',0,'product','',0),(2644,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Bohnanza','Bohnanza is a card game where players assume the role of a simple bean farmer. Players have a plethora of beans - red beans, green beans, black-eyed beans and coffee beans. The objective is to gain wealth by strategically planting and trading your beans. The player who earns the most money wins! ','publish','open','closed','','bohnanza','','','2016-09-12 17:23:59','2016-09-13 00:23:59','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/bohnanza/',0,'product','',0),(2645,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Power Grid','Players take on the role of a company owner who is creating a network of cities and providing them with power. Connect to cities, win power plants at auctions, and purchase fuel! Your goal is to supply the most cities with power when someone\'s network gains a predetermined size.\r\n\r\nPower Grid consists of a deck that includes Summary Cards and Power Plant Cards, resources, and money. The game board displays the USA and the map of Germany. Houses are placed on the board to represent cities.\r\n\r\nThe game ends when a player builds a pre-determined number of connections. The player with the most POWERED cities wins the game! Who will become the ultimate power magnate? Who will dominate the electrical industry?','publish','open','closed','','power-grid','','','2016-09-14 15:01:06','2016-09-14 22:01:06','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/power-grid/',0,'product','',0),(2646,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Puerto Rico','In Puerto Rico, players can select the role they wish to implement – mayor, captain, settler, trader, prospector, craftsman, or builder. The game includes a separate small board with spaces for city buildings, plantations, and resources.\r\n\r\nMoney called ‘doubloons’ is important to buy resources. It can be used to buy buildings, grow more crops, or gain abilities. For each round, a player takes his turn selecting a role card from the deck. When a role is chosen, every player gets to take the action appropriate to that role.\r\n\r\nAt the end of the last round, the governor that has ruled most successfully or the one with the highest victory points wins the game! Who will lead Puerto Rico to the greatest glory? If you’re up for the challenge of planning, maneuvering, and intelligent placement, Puerto Rico is for you!','publish','open','closed','','puerto-rico','','','2016-09-12 17:23:59','2016-09-13 00:23:59','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/puerto-rico/',0,'product','',0),(2647,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Race For The Galaxy','In Race for the Galaxy, players choose from seven roles to lead their galactic conquest. Prepare to explore space, develop new technologies, settle and conquer new worlds, consume goods, and produce new goods. You’ll go through these five action phases to build your galactic civilization.\r\n\r\nTo start the game, each player gets a starting world and six cards. Players can only keep 4 of the initial six starting cards they receive. These cards have three uses: play them in front of you, discard, or represent goods.\r\n\r\nFor each round, actions are performed each round are based on which roles the players take. Completed actions will earn you victory points. Once a player has at least twelve cards in front of them, the endgame is triggered. The person with the highest points total is the winner!','publish','open','closed','','race-for-the-galaxy','','','2016-09-12 17:24:02','2016-09-13 00:24:02','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/race-for-the-galaxy/',0,'product','',0),(2648,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:02','2016-07-22 12:41:02','','Tikal','In Tikal players take turns in drawing terrain tiles and placing them on the hexagonal spaces on the board. There are four types of terrain tiles – Jungles, Volcano, Temple and Treasure. You and your fellow explorers also perform actions during your turn and with each action, you spend a corresponding number of action points. You can spend up to 10 action points per turn, but you’re not required to do so.\r\n\r\nAs you go through your Mayan voyage, you will be excavating ancient Mayan temples and unearthing treasures, earning you points along the way. The player with the most points at the end of the game will reign supreme over the Tikal terrain. But it won’t be easy as you will be fighting over the same temples and treasures and they become scarce fast.','publish','open','closed','','tikal','','','2016-09-12 17:24:02','2016-09-13 00:24:02','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/tikal/',0,'product','',0),(2649,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Skulldug!','Skulldug is a beer-and-pretzels exploration game where players race to collect treasures and escape from a treacherous cave system. Players take on the role of explorers. They must venture inside a cave full of traps and horrific creatures! The goal of each round is to find three ancient artifacts.\r\n\r\nThis is a tile-laying game, which means that you build out a new map every time you play, as well as new passages, equipment, and monsters. To win, a player needs to grab the treasure, overcome deadly traps, and make it out alive!\r\n\r\nCan you collect all treasures before you run out of health gems? Will you make it out of the cave alive? Win the game and be known as the best explorer of Skulldug! If you’re in the mood for some fun exploration, this game is for you!','publish','open','closed','','skulldug','','','2016-09-12 17:24:03','2016-09-13 00:24:03','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/skulldug/',0,'product','',0),(2650,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Superfight','Who would win in a fight – Batman or Superman? Terminator or the toxic Avenger? If you’ve become bored of the usual party games, it’s time you add Superfight to your gamenight collection. It’s the ultimate game of fictional battles!  \n\nSuperfight comes with a core deck of 500 cards. The deck is split between 170 white character cards and 330 black powers and weaknesses cards. During the game, a player must always have three white cards and five black cards in their hand. A referee is then selected for each round.\n\nSuperfight is fun, awesome, and will have the whole group laughing. If you are looking for a party game that will entertain you every time you open it, this one is for you!','publish','open','closed','','superfight','','','2016-09-12 17:24:03','2016-09-13 00:24:03','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/superfight/',0,'product','',0),(2651,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Red Dragon Inn','You and your adventuring companions have spent all day slogging through the Dungeon, killing monsters and taking their stuff. Now you’re back in town, healed up, cleaned up, and ready to party at the Red Dragon Inn.\r\n\r\nDrink, gamble, and roughhouse with your friends. But don’t forget to keep an eye on your Gold. If you run out, you’ll have to spend the night in the stables. Oh… and try not to get too beaten up or too drunk. If you black out, your friends will continue the party without you… after they loot your body for Gold of course!\r\n\r\nThe last conscious adventurer with Gold wins the game!\r\n\r\nTake on the role of one of these heroic fantasy adventurers – Deirdre, Fiona, Gerki, or Zot – and enjoy an evening at the Red Dragon Inn!','publish','open','closed','','red-dragon-inn','','','2016-09-12 17:24:03','2016-09-13 00:24:03','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/red-dragon-inn/',0,'product','',0),(2652,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Beat the Parents','Beat the Parents is a family trivia game with a twist! Parents and Kids compete against one another to test their knowledge. Adults answer questions about kid\'s stuff and kids answer questions that adults should know! The objective is to answer questions correctly in order to get both mover pieces across the board. Watch out for Wild Cars though, they could propel you forward or bounce you back! A great game for family night.','publish','open','closed','','beat-the-parents','','','2016-09-12 17:24:03','2016-09-13 00:24:03','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/beat-the-parents/',0,'product','',0),(2653,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Hedbanz','Hedbanz is an award-winning guessing game for kids 8 and older that puts a fun spin on an old formula.\n\nYou and a few of your friends start playing by each drawing a card from the deck. There will be an image of a person, place or thing. But you can’t look at your card. You will have to stick it on your forehead using one of the headbands so the other players can see. \n\nPlayers guess what the image is by asking yes or no questions. You can’t ask any other kind of question. You’ll also have to figure it out before someone else figures out his or hers, or before the timer counts down to zero.\n\nHedbanz is a lightweight, quick and fun party game appropriate for all ages.','publish','open','closed','','hedbanz','','','2016-09-12 17:24:03','2016-09-13 00:24:03','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/hedbanz/',0,'product','',0),(2654,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 19:41:11','','Munchkin','Munchkin is an award winning card game from the brilliant and kooky Steve Jackson. It\'s silly, it\'s fun and it\'s violent. The objective is simple: reach level 10 by any means necessary. Killing monsters, stealing loot and backstabbing your friends! Gain levels and loot by defeating monsters, the more powerful the monster the better the loot! Gather items and equipment to help you defeat monsters and to aid other players losing to monsters. Munchkin is a fast paced card game that pokes fun at dungeon crawlers and RPGs.','publish','open','closed','','munchkin','','','2016-09-14 14:41:48','2016-09-14 21:41:48','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/munchkin-2/',0,'product','',1),(2655,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Zombie Dice','Just like being a zombie in real life, Zombie Dice is fun, short lived, and full of brains (In your zombie belly)! You might think you have to be a glutton for punishment if you willingly play a game that involves rolling mystery dice from a cup, but you\'re dead wrong! The only thing you\'re gluttonous for is sweet, juicy, delicious brains...and bullets! You don\'t know any better, you\'re a zombie.\r\n\r\nBe the first zombie to stuff your jelly belly with 13 organic, cruelty free, free range, fair trade, locally grown, gluten free brains and you win! Be careful though, your own brain power is lacking. If you eat 3 bullets in 1 round you don\'t get to slurp down any tasty medulla oblongatas. Be the best zombie you can be, or don\'t! Just eat brains silly! Zombie Dice is a fast paced 10 - 20 minute game that can be learned in the first round, but can take entire zombie lifetimes to master! You do you boo and roll them Zombie Dice! You are what you eat after all, brainnnssssss...','publish','open','closed','','zombie-dice','','','2016-09-12 17:24:03','2016-09-13 00:24:03','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/zombie-dice/',0,'product','',0),(2656,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Between Two Cities','Between Two Cities is a semi-cooperative tile-drafting game where each tile represents a piece of a city: park, landmarks, shop, factory, etc. Players work with the player to their left to design a city while also working with the player on their right to design another city. Each turn you choose two tiles, show them and then collaborate with your partners to place the tiles into your cities. Between Two Cities is a game of strategy, cooperation and fun!','publish','open','closed','','between-two-cities','','','2016-09-12 17:24:04','2016-09-13 00:24:04','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/between-two-cities/',0,'product','',0),(2657,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Among The Stars','Among the Stars is a science fiction strategy card game of galactical proportions! Newly established peace in the galaxy must be maintained so an Alliance has been created. Massive space stations are needed to facilitate trade, maintain diplomatic relations and promote peace amongst the races. Players assume the role of an alien race tasked to build the best, most efficient space station!','publish','open','closed','','among-the-stars','','','2016-10-12 14:44:36','2016-10-12 21:44:36','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/among-the-stars/',0,'product','',0),(2658,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Panamax','In Panamax, players get to manage shipping companies, which accept contracts from both US coasts, China, and Europe. They have to deliver cargo in order to make money, attract investment, and pay dividends. The goal is to earn the largest personal fortune!\r\n\r\nDuring set up, players get personal stock and money, shipping contracts, and starting boats. The shipping contracts are represented by dice on a small card with one to three numbered boxes. Players select a die, do the action associated with it, and the turn passes.\r\n\r\nIn this game, invest wisely or you could lose. If you’re into managing stocks and a unique brain-burning fun, grab a copy of Panamax now!','publish','open','closed','','panamax','','','2016-09-12 17:24:04','2016-09-13 00:24:04','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/panamax/',0,'product','',0),(2659,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Survive Space Attack!','Survive: Space Attack brings you into a world where height of technology and comfort reign. The game is set in the Atlantis space station, a five-star hotel that offers an out of this world vacation. The station is filled with staff, entertainers, and guests. But all of a sudden, aliens have come to launch an attack!\r\n\r\nIt’s up to you to get the guests to safety and let the crew escape. Escape pods are limited, so others have to board fighter ships and go to battle. Players will face alien warriors, spawns, and Queens patrolling the station. Alien creatures may also evolve to become even more powerful!\r\n\r\nIt will not be an easy trip. Will you be able to reach the jump point safely? Will aliens get to conquer the Atlantis space station completely? If you and your friends love a game with a sci-fi theme, Survive: Space Attack is going to be a hit!','publish','open','closed','','survive-space-attack','','','2016-09-12 17:24:04','2016-09-13 00:24:04','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/survive-space-attack/',0,'product','',0),(2660,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Dungeon Roll','Sometimes, after years of hard adventuring all a hero really wants to do on their weekends is relax without any serious commitments. Oh sure, Grogda might constantly chastise you about commitment, but you know what she\'s really saying. She\'s saying, \"Roll those dice Gruumsh!\" You don\'t need her to tell you twice! Time to bust out some quick adventuring with Dungeon Roll!\r\n\r\nDungeon Roll is a 15 to 20 minute game that can be played with 1 to 4 humans, orcs, halflings, dwarves, and gnomes! No elves. Hmm, what? Oh fine Grogda, the elves can play too. This game lets you get all the fun of dungeon delving without the back breaking chair sitting for 12 hours on a Saturday and then into the early hours of the morning on Sunday. Dungeon Roll is a fun, lighthearted alternative to the more intense RPG\'s available.\r\n\r\nChoose your hero, roll the dice, gather your party, explore the dungeon, get phat lewtz but do so before you wake the dragon or lose your entire adventuring party. This game is fun, exciting, quick, and no elves allowed! Sorry, elves allowed.','publish','open','closed','','dungeon-roll','','','2016-09-12 17:24:04','2016-09-13 00:24:04','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/dungeon-roll/',0,'product','',0),(2661,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Dirty Minds','DIRTY MINDS The Game of Naughty Clues... is also known as \"The world\'s cleanest dirty game.\" The dirtier a mind you have, the worse you will be at playing DIRTY MINDS because all of the answers are clean!\n \n A player draws a card, and reads one of the facts about the word (they may choose). Then the other player gets to make one free guess. If they\'re right, they get three letter cards. If they\'re wrong, the other players get a chance to steal. If they guess the word, they get one letter card. If they have cards, and get it wrong they lose a letter card. If no one guesses the word, another clue is read. If no one gets it the next time around the players will only receive one letter card from that point on.','publish','open','closed','','dirty-minds','','','2016-09-12 17:24:04','2016-09-13 00:24:04','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/dirty-minds-2/',0,'product','',0),(2662,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','The Voting Game','The Voting Game is a party game for folks who want to find out as much of the gut-busting things about their friends as they can.\r\n\r\nYou and your friends start by drawing a card from the deck that asks random questions, like “Who would survive the longest in a zombie apocalypse?” You all vote anonymously for the player you believe was described. Tally all the votes and then reveal the result to everyone.\r\n\r\nThe player who gets voted can make one guess as to who cast each vote. If he or she is correct, the player who cast the vote admits it.\r\n\r\nThe first player to get 10 points wins.','publish','open','closed','','the-voting-game','','','2016-09-12 17:24:04','2016-09-13 00:24:04','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/the-voting-games/',0,'product','',0),(2663,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Robot Turtles','Robot Turtles is a board game for kids inspired by the Logo programming language. It provides crucial brain development and computer programming skills to children as young as 4 years old in the context of family fun. Players dictate the movements of their Robot Turtle tokens on a game board by playing Code Cards: Forward, Left and Right. When a player\'s Robot Turtle reaches a jewel they win! If they make a mistake, they can use a Bug Card to undo a move. The game has many levels so, as the players advance, they will encounter obstacles like Ice Walls and use more complex Code Cards (like lasers to melt the walls). Play continues until all players collect a jewel, so everyone wins.','publish','open','closed','','robot-turtles','','','2016-09-12 17:24:04','2016-09-13 00:24:04','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/robot-turtles-2/',0,'product','',0),(2664,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Two Rooms and a Boom','Two Rooms and a Boom is the perfect party game for six or more players. It’s all about strategy, socialization, and intrigue within a time limit! The group will be divided into two teams. The Blue team is led by the president and their aim is to avoid the Red team’s Bomber.  \n\nTo start, players are randomly handed representative Character Cards. Each card indicates your team color or special role. The group will be equally distributed between two separate ‘rooms’ or playing areas.    \n\nCan you find the Bomber? Will you be able to save the President in time? If you need a fun and exciting party game, Two Rooms and a Boom should be part of your list!','publish','open','closed','','two-rooms-and-a-boom','','','2016-09-12 17:24:05','2016-09-13 00:24:05','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/two-rooms-and-a-boom/',0,'product','',0),(2665,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Legendary: A Marvel Deck Building Game','Legendary is a deck-building game set in the Marvel Comics universe. Players can take on the roles of Heroes, which includes the Avengers and X-men, and team up to defeat a mastermind villain! You and your friends will go on a head-to-head fight with the likes of Magneto, Loki, Dr. Doom, and Red Skull.\r\n\r\nIt’s up to you to assemble a Hero deck and choose a Mastermind to fight. Your goal is to stop an evil Scheme and eventually defeat the villain. The cards in Legendary provide either recruit power or fight power. Recruitment is used as a form of currency in order to add Heroes from the HQ to your play deck.\r\n\r\nLegendary is the ultimate board game for every superhero fan! It\'s a well-designed and action-packed game that will leave you wanting more! If you love Marvel, this game is for you!','publish','open','closed','','legendary-a-marvel-deck-building-game','','','2016-09-12 17:24:05','2016-09-13 00:24:05','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/legendary-a-marvel-deck-building-game/',0,'product','',0),(2666,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 19:41:11','','Telestrations','Telestrations is a party game with a focus on fun and laughter. Each player gets a secret word in which they have sixty seconds to sketch out on a pad of paper. Once the sixty seconds is up, pass your sketch to your neighbor and they have to determine what your word was based on your sketch. They then pass on to their neighbor and so on until your original word gets back around to you.','publish','open','closed','','telestrations','','','2016-09-14 14:39:57','2016-09-14 21:39:57','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/telestrations-2/',0,'product','',1),(2667,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Crabs Adjust Humidity','Love playing Cards Against Humanity?\r\n\r\nThe popular party game becomes even crazier with Crabs Adjust Humidity! This unofficial and unauthorized ‘parody’ expansion card set has an unlimited laughter potential to bring to the table. It blends seamlessly with the original game that every Cards Against Humanity owner should have it.\r\n\r\nCrabs Adjust Humidity adds 108 morally-questionable new cards to play and are intended for ages 17 and up. Included are 78 white answer cards and 30 black question cards. Texts are printed on linen-finish, casino-quality cards with language that is frequently...colorful.\r\n\r\nThe only rule for playing this game is you shouldn’t get easily offended! If playing fun party card games with a casual group of friends are your thing, Crabs Adjust Humidity should be on your must-have list.','publish','open','closed','','crabs-adjust-humidity','','','2016-10-12 12:42:54','2016-10-12 19:42:54','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/crabs-adjust-humidity/',0,'product','',2),(2668,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:11','2016-07-22 12:41:11','','Star Realms','Star Realms is a spaceship combat deckbuilding game designed by Magic: the Gathering Pro Tour Champions and Hall of Famers Darwin Kastle and Rob Dougherty. The game offers all the thrills of traditional trading card game style combat, combined with the fun of a deckbuilding game. Play powerful ships, destroy enemy bases or blast your opponent directly on your way to victory!','publish','open','closed','','star-realms','','','2016-10-12 07:22:03','2016-10-12 14:22:03','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/star-realms-2/',0,'product','',0),(2669,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','Guess Who','In Guess Who, players flip over a collection of faces to deduce who the secret person is that your opponent has chosen. The faces have different color hair, eye color, hair, hats, glasses, etc. You have to guess the mystery face through 20 yes or no questions and narrow the pool of possibilities. \n\nPlayers take turns asking questions about the other’s face card.  “Do they have green eyes?” -- If the answer is yes, the tiles with green eyes stay up, while the ones without get flipped down. “Are they wearing a hat?” – If the answer is no, those with hats get flipped down, the ones not wearing a hat remain facing you.   \n\nGuess Who is fast-paced and is very easy to learn. If you are looking for a game to play with your children, Guess Who is a great choice! ','publish','open','closed','','guess-who','','','2016-09-12 17:24:09','2016-09-13 00:24:09','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/guess-who/',0,'product','',0),(2670,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 19:41:19','','Lords of Waterdeep','Lords of Waterdeep is an award-winning strategy board game for 2 to 5 players. To gain control, a player sends agents to different locations and recruit clerics, fighters, rogues, and wizards. Your main goal is to gather these adventurers to satisfy the conditions of a Quest card.\r\n\r\nQuests come in different categories such as warfare or piety. Completing them can earn you extra money or special powers. Lords can also gain Intrigue cards, which contain mandatory challenges that can be used on other players, wherein they are forced to complete them!\r\n\r\nThis compelling board game will surely test your skills on trickery and negotiation. Who will take control of the hidden treasures and resources of the city? Who will be the most powerful Lord of Waterdeep?','publish','open','closed','','lords-of-waterdeep','','','2016-09-14 17:12:25','2016-09-15 00:12:25','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/lords-of-waterdeep/',0,'product','',0),(2671,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','Mage Knight','Created by the Renowned Game Designer, Vlaada Chvatil, Mage Knight is a game of Epic Exploration and Conquest that mixes character development, intrigue, and the clashing of swords to create a truly unique gaming experience. Enter the mysterious world of the Atlantean Empire as 1 of 4 Heroes (or villians) in this expansive world that allows players to conquer lands, steer the wheels of history and give birth to legends in this exciting all in one board game. Choose to play competitively or cooperatively with other players as you roam the countryside affecting your own reputation by beingeither the benevolent leader or brutal tyrant. Accumulate Fame and experience that translate into more powerful Spells and abilities, then use your power to influence units to join your ranks. Will you play the Hero and gain favor among the people or will you destroy monasteries to steal Legendary artifacts hidden within?','publish','open','closed','','mage-knight','','','2016-09-14 16:50:19','2016-09-14 23:50:19','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/mage-knight-2/',0,'product','',0),(2672,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','Apocalypse Chaos','Your ship has been surrounded by a hostile alien race and the situation looks dire, but you and your crew ain\'t goin\' down without a fight! You must work together to contest the onslaught of enemy forces, recover items of scientific interest, rescue the innocent, escape imprisonment and destroy the alien leader!','publish','open','closed','','apocalypse-chaos','','','2016-09-12 17:24:10','2016-09-13 00:24:10','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/apocalypse-chaos-2/',0,'product','',0),(2673,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 19:41:19','','Camel Up','Camel Up is a game of betting and chance. Players bet on which of five racing camels will finish first, the earlier bets are placed the bigger the pay out. Each round players get to take an action - either place a bet, advance the camels by rolling dice or altering the terrain. It\'s a delicate balance between knowing when to bet, how to alter the track to your advantage and reliance upon a bit of luck. Camel Up is easy to pick up and fun for the whole family to play.','publish','open','closed','','camel-up','','','2016-10-12 15:50:23','2016-10-12 22:50:23','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/camel-up-2/',0,'product','',0),(2674,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','Carcassonne','Carcassonne is a simple tile laying game with a setting in the South of France. The game starts with a single terrain tile face up and a stack of face down tiles. Each turn a player draws a face down tile and positions it adjacent to already played tiles. Players acquire points by placing meeples on tiles, depending on the characteristics of the tile the meeple with have certain attributes. There are road tiles, city tiles, cloister tiles and field tiles. While a simple game there are strategic choices to be made throughout Carcassonne that add to the complexity and competive aspects of the game.','publish','open','closed','','carcassonne','','','2016-09-12 17:24:10','2016-09-13 00:24:10','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/carcassonne-2/',0,'product','',1),(2675,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','Pandemic','Pandemic is a fast paced cooperative thrill ride where players work together to eradicate four diseases plaguing the planet. The objective of the game is containing the diseases before they spread across the globe as well as developing cures. Each player has a particular skillset needed to combat the ever growing and evolving diseased climate. There is the operations specialist who creates research facilities, the scientist is proficient at developing cures, the medic who treats a diseased area once a cure is found, the researcher can give cards to other players and the dispatcher is adept at traveling. Pandemic is an unrelenting, break neck speed board game. If you\'re looking for comradery, tension and an adrenaline rush this is the game for you.','publish','open','closed','','pandemic','','','2016-09-12 17:24:10','2016-09-13 00:24:10','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/pandemic-2/',0,'product','',0),(2676,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 19:41:19','','Terra Mystica','Terra Mystica is a strategy game with a simple game principle and very little luck involved: You govern one of 14 factions trying to transform the landscape on the game board in your favor in order to build your structures. On the one hand, proximity to other players limits your options for further expansion, on the other hand though, it provides some benefits during the game. This conflict is the source of Terra Mystica\'s appeal. The 14 artfully designed factions, each having unique special abilities, as well as the exchangeable bonus cards allow for a large number of possible game plays that constantly keep this game entertaining.','publish','open','closed','','terra-mystica','','','2016-09-14 16:54:20','2016-09-14 23:54:20','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/terra-mystica-2/',0,'product','',0),(2677,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','Agricola','Agricola is a turn-based game. There are 14 game turns plus 6 harvest phases (after turn 4, 7, 9, 11, 13, and 14). Each player starts with two playing tokens (farmer and wife) and thus can take two actions per turn. There are multiple options, and while the game progresses, youâ€™ll have more and more: first thing in a turn, a new action card is flipped over.','publish','open','closed','','agricola','','','2016-09-12 17:24:11','2016-09-13 00:24:11','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/agricola-2/',0,'product','',0),(2678,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','Akrotiri','In Akrotiri â€“ which is the dig site on the island of Thera â€“ players place Land tiles in order to make the board match the maps that they have in their hands. Players earn points by excavating bigger temples and by excavating temples that are further away from Thera. Secret goal cards keep everyone guessing who the victor is until the end!','publish','open','closed','','akrotiri','','','2016-09-12 17:24:11','2016-09-13 00:24:11','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/akrotiri-2/',0,'product','',0),(2679,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','Stone Age','In Stone Age, each player receives a player board, five cavemen, and ten food. They can score points by constructing huts and gaining valuable cards. Tools are used to collect wood, stone, and gold. Complete missions such as gain a new worker, increase tools, or increase food production. \n\nEach roll of the dice gains you essential resources, consisting of wood, brick, stone, gold, and food. These will allow you to attain higher levels of knowledge that you can use to build a sturdier home. So luck plays an important part of the game.\n\nThis game is easy to learn. If you want a fun way to relive history, grab your copy of Stone Age now!','publish','open','closed','','stone-age','','','2016-09-12 17:24:11','2016-09-13 00:24:11','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/stone-age/',0,'product','',0),(2680,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','Tales of Arabian Nights','Tales of the Arabian Nights is a ground-breaking storytelling game that brings you into the world of Aladdin, Sindbad, Ali Baba, and the other legendary heroes. You travel the lands meeting people, monsters, and disaster while seeking their wealth and fame.\r\n\r\nDuring the game, players get to choose a character of legend and face challenges which are randomly generated through cards or die rolls. You might encounter powerful \'efreets, evil viziers, the Magnetic Mountain, and even rescue an imprisoned princesses!\r\n\r\nAre you going to be the hero of the greatest story ever told? Get to experience stories that are filled with suspense, excitement, disaster and laughter! Get ready to set out on an epic adventure with Tales of the Arabian Nights!','publish','open','closed','','tales-of-arabian-nights','','','2016-09-12 17:24:11','2016-09-13 00:24:11','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/tales-of-arabian-nights/',0,'product','',0),(2681,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','Abracada...What?','Abracada...What? is a multi-award winning guessing game that lets players harness the power of logic to gain supremacy over a magical world.\n\nYou do battle against each other as powerful wizards, each with an array of awesome spells. But achieving victory won’t be easy as only your opponents know the spells you can cast. Your spells are displayed on your game pieces which are facing away from you and toward the other players.\n\nYou lose if you make too many wrong guesses, so use all of your wit, cunning and brains to become the supreme wizard.','publish','open','closed','','abracada-what','','','2016-09-12 17:24:11','2016-09-13 00:24:11','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/abracada-what/',0,'product','',0),(2682,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','Dragon Farkle','Dragon Farkle is a role playing game where players play as a hero out to save a once peaceful, magical land from a terrible dragon.\n\nThe peace in Yon has been broken. A savage dragon has suddenly appeared and started terrorizing the gentle farm folk.\n\nYou and your friends rise to the challenge of slaying the beast. But there can only be one hero. Stack the odds in your favor by rolling the dice and playing your cards. Each roll and card lets you hire companions, gather your army of ardent warriors or obtain useful items.\n\nAll is fair in love and war, so you can steal from each other as well.','publish','open','closed','','dragon-farkle','','','2016-09-12 17:24:11','2016-09-13 00:24:11','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/dragon-farkle/',0,'product','',0),(2683,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','Hawaii','','publish','open','closed','','hawaii','','','2016-09-12 17:24:12','2016-09-13 00:24:12','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/hawaii/',0,'product','',0),(2684,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','The Magic Labyrinth','The apprentices to the Master Wizard have accidentally lost some objects in the Magic Labyrinth. Now, they must try to collect them before the Master notices that they are missing. However, this magical maze has invisible walls that the little wizards keep bumping into, forcing them to start all over again. Sharpen your memory and show your skill as you navigate the maze and win the Master Wizard\'s favor.','publish','open','closed','','the-magic-labyrinth','','','2016-09-12 17:24:12','2016-09-13 00:24:12','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/the-magic-labyrinth-2/',0,'product','',0),(2685,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','Ghost Blitz','In Ghost blitz, five wooden items sit on the table waiting to be caught: a white ghost, a green bottle, a cute grey mouse, a blue book and a comfortable red chair. Each card in the deck shows pictures of two objects, with one or both objects colored the wrong way. With all players playing at the same time, someone reveals a card, then players grab for the \"right\" object but which object is right? If one object is colored correctly say, a green bottle and a red mouse then players need to grab that correctly colored object. If both objects are colored incorrectly say, a green ghost and a red mouse then you look for the object and color not represented among the four details shown. In this case you see green, red, ghost and mouse, so players need to grab the blue book. The first player to grab the correct object keeps the card, then reveals the next card from the deck. If a player grabs the wrong object, she must discard one card previously collected. Once the card deck runs out, the game ends and whoever has collected the most cards wins.','publish','open','closed','','ghost-blitz','','','2016-09-12 17:24:12','2016-09-13 00:24:12','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/ghost-blitz-2/',0,'product','',0),(2686,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','Jenga','Jenga... Jenga... Jenga... (in Animal House toga chant voice).  You wouldn\'t think that such a simple game could require so much lazer focus.  While playing Jenga isn\'t brain surgery, you\'d think from the pressure you feel walking up to the teetering stack that it was.  We all think we have a special strategy... that some how we know the perfect brick to pull.  It\'s all fun and games until... CRASH!!! (and the crowd goes wild!)  Grab Jenga and you\'ll be the hit of the party!','publish','open','closed','','jenga','','','2016-09-12 17:24:12','2016-09-13 00:24:12','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/jenga/',0,'product','',0),(2687,2,'2016-07-22 12:41:19','2016-07-22 12:41:19','','5 Second Rule','Think nothing can leave you or your friends tongue-tied? Test yourselves by playing 5 Second Rule.\n\n5 Second Rule is a party trivia game that let friends see how their knowledge and focus stack up. Players start by drawing a card from the deck with a topic. You will have to name three things related to the topic under 5 seconds. \n\nAs if that wasn’t hard enough, you’ll be timed by a timer that makes a funny noise as it counts down. \n\nBut if you succeed, your piece will advance one square on the board. There are a total of 12 squares. The player who keeps his or her cool and makes it to the last square wins.','publish','open','closed','','5-second-rule','','','2016-09-12 17:24:15','2016-09-13 00:24:15','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/5-second-rule/',0,'product','',0),(2698,2,'2016-07-26 19:32:37','2016-07-27 02:32:37','','Agent Hunter','Agent Hunter lets players take on the role of rival agents. You must use your spies to find your opponent’s spies who hide out in safe houses, disguise their identities, and sneak around in the dark. Ever increasing methods of detection lead to even more impressive methods of deception.\r\n\r\nFor each round, a player tries to figure out whether their opponent’s Agent level is matched, or higher or lower than their card. The game ends when one player\'s Agents are all eliminated. The winner is the player who has the most points.\r\n\r\nAgent Hunter will test your stealth and how cunning you can go! The closer you get to your target, the more you risk compromising your position. Who will remain hidden in the shadows? Who will survive the hunt? If you’re in the mood for some spy action, this game is for you!','publish','open','closed','','agent-hunter','','','2016-09-14 14:41:32','2016-09-14 21:41:32','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/agent-hunter/',0,'product','',0),(2699,2,'2016-07-26 19:32:48','2016-07-26 19:32:48','','Cheaty Mages','Cheaty Mages is a fast and fun betting game from famed Japanese designer Seiji Kanai. The game features the arena battles of mythic creatures, only it’s not remotely fair. Players take on the role of one of the titular mages who has come to watch the tournament. As a powerful mage, you can use your spells to help the monsters you\'ve bet on win!\r\n\r\nDuring each round, five fighter cards are chosen to enter the arena. Monsters like demons, ghosts, orcs, elves, the Minotaur, and goblins, can join the face-off! Players place their bets on the fighter or fighters they believe will win using Betting cards.\r\n\r\nCheaty Mages is very easy to learn and opens doors for tactical play. Too much magic might all go to waste. Too little, and you might lose! If you’re in the mood for fun monster battles and wagers, this game is for you!','publish','open','closed','','cheaty-mages','','','2016-09-12 17:24:16','2016-09-13 00:24:16','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/cheaty-mages/',0,'product','',0),(2700,2,'2016-07-26 19:32:55','2016-07-26 19:32:55','','Elfenroads','Elfenroads takes you to the mythical world of elves. Players take on the role of fledgling elves who have to pass a very special test. Their mission is to visit as many towns in Elfland as possible. They can even ride dragons, unicorns, and magic clouds while doing the tour!\r\n\r\nThe game consists of cards for transportation and a supply of money. Each mode of transportation has different characteristics. Some can be used only in specific regions. Giant pigs can only move through fields and forests, unicorns can be used to cross the desert and mountains.\r\n\r\nCan you outbid opponents for travel counters? Who will gain the most points and win the race? If you’re in the mood for an exciting elf race set in beautiful mythical cities, grab a copy of Elfenroads now!','publish','open','closed','','elfenroads','','','2016-09-12 17:24:16','2016-09-13 00:24:16','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/elfenroads/',0,'product','',0),(2701,2,'2016-07-26 19:33:05','2016-07-27 02:33:05','','Love Letter: Adventure TIme','In Love Letter Adventure Time, players compete to gain the affections of Princess Bubblegum. It brings an exciting battle of declaration and endearment. The benevolent ruler has been working too hard in her lab and needs to go out and socialize.\r\n\r\nEach player starts with only one card in hand. Players draw from a deck of cards with values from 1 to 8. Draw another card from the deck and decide which of the two actions you wish to play. When the cards are all gone, players compare their last cards and the one with the highest value wins!\r\n\r\nThe last suitor standing gets to deliver his love letter to the Princess.\r\n\r\nJourney to the Land of Ooo and try to win the candy-coated heart of Princess Bubblegum! Join all your Adventure Time favorites by grabbing a copy of Love Letter Adventure Time now!','publish','open','closed','','love-letter-adventure-time','','','2016-09-14 14:45:18','2016-09-14 21:45:18','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/love-letter-adventure-time/',0,'product','',1),(2702,2,'2016-07-26 19:33:10','2016-07-26 19:33:10','','Pairs: A New Classic Pub Game','In Pairs, there is no winner, just one loser. The game uses a simple triangular deck of cards that’s 1×1, 2×2, 3×3, all the way to 10×10. Players take turns taking cards, trying not to get a pair. If you get a pair, you score points -- which is bad. The first player to reach a target score loses!\r\n\r\nTo avoid catching a pair, fold for the lowest card in play. The number of penalty points increases with the numeric value of the card. For instance, if you\'re holding a 6, 8, and 10, there are 21 cards that can burn you. It includes all the remaining 6s, 8s, and 10s.\r\n\r\nPairs is a fast and easy card game with many versions of art and rules. The core deck is the ‘Fruit’ deck. Who will get the most pairs? Who will lose and pay for the next round of drinks? Avoid points as much as you can!','publish','open','closed','','pairs-a-new-classic-pub-game','','','2016-09-12 17:24:16','2016-09-13 00:24:16','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/pairs-a-new-classic-pub-game/',0,'product','',0),(2703,2,'2016-07-26 19:33:16','2016-07-26 19:33:16','','Scoville','In Scoville players take on the role of an employee working in a pepper farm. The object of the game is to plant and crossbreed peppers to produce the hottest chili breeds. You can try many different strategies! It’s up to you to plant, harvest, and auction peppers and make the event a success.\r\n\r\nDuring the game, you are also tasked to fulfill orders from the residents. The hotter the peppers you plant, the hotter the peppers you can breed. Harvest the right peppers at the right time in order to beat your opponents.\r\n\r\nWho will win this year’s most coveted Scoville trophy? Who will produce the hottest pepper breed in town? If you want to add some spice to your game night, Scoville is the game you’re looking for!','publish','open','closed','','scoville','','','2016-09-12 17:24:17','2016-09-13 00:24:17','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/scoville/',0,'product','',1),(2704,2,'2016-07-26 19:33:16','2016-07-27 02:33:16','','Seventh Hero OOP','In Seventh Hero, players take on the roles of random heroes equipped with impressive powers and abilities. According to the prophecy of Kear, Maedoc the Corruptor\'s will return to spread fear and evil. It’s up to seven brave souls to defeat him and restore peace and unity to the land.\r\n\r\nSeventh Hero consists of 77 cards, with each card representing one of seven different heroes. For each turn, a player can send a card face down to the next player, who can choose to take it or pass it on. If he takes it, he adds it to his group of heroes. The first player to collect the true six heroes wins!\r\n\r\nAre you ready to save the world from evil? Who will become the true seventh hero? If you’re a little trickster, Seventh Hero should be in your game library. It’s a very easy game to play that will surely add fun to your game nights!','publish','open','closed','','seventh-hero-oop','','','2016-09-14 14:44:23','2016-09-14 21:44:23','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/seventh-hero-oop/',0,'product','',0),(2705,2,'2016-07-26 19:33:21','2016-07-26 19:33:21','','Steam Park','In a time of beautiful machinations constructed under the soot filled shadow of industrious coal lies a world of wonder, a land of enchantment, and a circus of value! That\'s right folks, the deals don\'t get any sweeter than those at your friendly neighborhood Steam Park! Two to four players must use their quick wit, dice skills, and ability to shovel dirt down toilets to construct the ultimate steam powered theme park.\r\n\r\nThat sounds great you say? Well great, there\'s more! Roller coasters and Ferris Wheels are all fine and dandy, but why settle for just any old rust bucket to give you tetanus when you can get tetanus in style with these beautifully illustrated and uniquely styled Steam Parks designed by Marie Cardouat. Each piece is designed with the third dimension in mind so you get to see your Steam Park empire grow before you and cast its shadow upon your competitors.\r\n\r\nThis isn\'t the minor leagues of theme park building, this is the world of Steam Park ladies and gentlemen. If you want to succeed here and proclaim your park the finest then you need to earn it! This beautiful game is easy to learn, but difficult to master. It puts forth incredible new game mechanics, deep strategy, but most of all, fun. Step right up!','publish','open','closed','','steam-park','','','2016-09-12 17:24:17','2016-09-13 00:24:17','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/steam-park/',0,'product','',0),(2706,2,'2016-07-26 19:33:26','2016-07-26 19:33:26','','The Walking Dead: Board Game','Imagine waking up in an abandoned hospital as sheriff\'s deputy Rick Grimes… only to find yourself surrounded by a horde of zombies! It’s a familiar scene from a popular TV series that now has its own board game version -- The Walking Dead!\r\n\r\nPlayers can take on the role of humanity’s survivors: Rick, Shane, Daryl, Glenn, etc. In every post-apocalyptic world, supplies run out. Tension rises as each survivor struggles to survive. It’s up to you to collect food and guns, secure transportation, and search for allies.\r\n\r\nIt’s the zombie apocalypse. Only the strong survive and the weak turn into walkers. Can you find enough resources to survive? Can you scout enough locations to find a safe haven to escape to? Fight to live another day with The Walking Dead.','publish','open','closed','','the-walking-dead-board-game','','','2016-09-12 17:24:17','2016-09-13 00:24:17','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/the-walking-dead-board-game/',0,'product','',0),(2707,2,'2016-07-26 19:33:31','2016-07-26 19:33:31','','WWE Super Star Showdown','Listen up brother! Do you think you have what it takes to throw down with the monsters of the ring?! This isn\'t some backyard wrestling match taped on VHS, this is WWE Superstar Showdown brother! If you\'ve made it this far then maybe, just maybe, you\'re ready to throw down with the legendary juggernauts of the WWE and step into the ring with the likes of John Cena, Big Show, Randy Orton, Big E, Daniel Bryan, and Roman Reigns! This is the real deal brother! You better bring your brain muscles along with your muscle muscles if you want to rise above your opponents and crown yourself the WWE World Champion. Incredibly chiseled miniatures showcase the chiseled bodies of the WWE superstars vying for control of the ring through incredibly dynamic and unique decks of combat cards tailored to each wrestler.\r\n\r\nNo game is ever the same and can be finished in as little as 10 minutes or the brawl can reach legendary levels of endurance and complexity with even longer matches or series of matches. Rip your shirt off and flex those pythons brother! It\'s time to dominate the ring, take home the belt, and become the ultimate superstar in this WWE showdown!','publish','open','closed','','wwe-super-star-showdown','','','2016-09-12 17:24:17','2016-09-13 00:24:17','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/wwe-super-star-showdown/',0,'product','',0),(2709,2,'2016-07-26 19:52:53','2016-07-26 19:52:53','','Diplomacy 1','','inherit','open','closed','','diplomacy-1','','','2016-07-26 19:52:53','2016-07-26 19:52:53','',2506,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/diplomacy-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(2710,0,'2016-09-20 20:07:40','2016-09-20 20:07:40','[]','woocommerce_subscriptions_clear_upgrade_log','','publish','open','closed','','woocommerce_subscriptions_clear_upgrade_log','','','2016-09-20 13:08:18','2016-09-20 20:08:18','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?post_type=scheduled-action&#038;p=2710',0,'scheduled-action','',3),(2719,2,'2016-08-05 06:05:26','2016-08-05 06:05:26','It appears that you have been led astray friend. Either it was an error on our end or someone has given you a bad quest map!\r\n\r\nTo get back on track we recommend you <a href=\"/popular-board-games/\">go here to see all of our games!</a>','Oops! Quest Failed...','','publish','closed','closed','','404-2','','','2016-08-10 23:19:47','2016-08-10 23:19:47','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?page_id=2719',0,'page','',0),(2721,6,'2016-08-01 02:39:11','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Worldpay Log','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2016-08-01 02:39:11','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?p=2721',0,'braintree_log','',0),(2722,6,'2016-08-01 02:39:11','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Worldpay Log','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2016-08-01 02:39:11','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?p=2722',0,