 09:24:13','2016-08-05 09:24:13','','allovertheboard_logo_png','','inherit','open','closed','','allovertheboard_logo_png','','','2016-08-05 09:24:13','2016-08-05 09:24:13','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/allovertheboard_logo_png.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(2922,2,'2016-08-05 16:33:17','2016-08-05 16:33:17','','Alan\'s Adventureland','In Alan\'s Adventureland players are part of the creative design team for an awesome amusement park!\r\n\r\nEach player is responsible for building attractions in one of four themed neighborhoods - Animal Kingdom, Tour America, Sky World and Foreign Lands.\r\n\r\nThroughout the game players draw cards of purchcase orders for different types of attractions. Players are then responsible for constructing those attractions to the specifications mandated by the finance office.\r\n\r\nAt the end of the game the amusement park owners award points based on four criteria - excitement level, parking lot view, main entrance view and themed attractions.\r\n\r\nThe player with the most points wins!','publish','open','closed','','alans-adventureland','','','2016-09-12 17:24:17','2016-09-13 00:24:17','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/alans-adventureland/',0,'product','',0),(2923,2,'2016-08-05 16:33:17','2016-08-05 16:33:17','','Angry Birds Chutes & Ladders Editon','In this Angry Birds version of the classic Chutes and Ladders game, players race to King Pig’s Castle with their favorite Angry Birds characters.\r\n\r\nEach player chooses an Angry Birds character pawn and tries to reach King Pig’s Castle at the top of the board. But it’s not easy to get there! Spin the spinner and hope to land on a spot going up the ladder. Land on the wrong spot and…uh-oh…go down the chute!\r\n\r\nThe first player to land on King Pig’s Castle wins.','publish','open','closed','','angry-birds-chutes-ladders-editon','','','2016-09-12 17:24:17','2016-09-13 00:24:17','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/angry-birds-chutes-ladders-editon/',0,'product','',0),(2924,2,'2016-08-05 16:33:20','2016-08-05 16:33:20','','Blue Prints','In Blueprints players are architects tasked with completing three different buildings using dice and referencing a set of blueprints.\r\n\r\nA simple premise with a complex execution! Players must choose dice wisely or risk losing out on precious points. Deviating from the blueprints is a valid tactic but can be dangerous.\r\n\r\nEach round community dice are rolled and each player choses a die from the pool to add to their building and each players building is obscured from the other players.\r\n\r\nAt the end of each round players reveal their buildings and tally points. The game lasts three rounds and the player who scores the most points wins!','publish','open','closed','','blue-prints','','','2016-09-12 17:24:17','2016-09-13 00:24:17','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/blue-prints/',0,'product','',0),(2925,2,'2016-08-05 16:33:28','2016-08-05 16:33:28','','Despicable Me 2: Operation Game','It’s the classic skill game of Operation, now with multitudes of minions! Stuart’s having a bad day and it’s up to you to fix him. Operate on Stuart to remove the unicorn fluff or fix his nutty noggin and his toxic tongue!\r\n\r\nCollect all of Stuart’s Funatomy parts to win and earn extra points with Minion Medics, but don’t set off the buzzer! Are your hands steady enough to win the Despicable Me 2 version of Operation?\r\n\r\nThis Despicable Me 2 version of Operation is mischievous fun!','publish','open','closed','','dispicable-me-2-operation-game','','','2016-09-12 17:24:18','2016-09-13 00:24:18','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/dispicable-me-2-operation-game/',0,'product','',0),(2926,2,'2016-08-05 16:33:33','2016-08-05 16:33:33','','Ghostbusters Monopoly Game','There’s something strange in your neighborhood! Save the world from paranormal activity by subduing the vapors, entities and slimers at famous New York locations from the original Ghostbusters movie.\r\n\r\nImprove your locations with custom sculpted Ghost Traps and Storage Units to hold the spooks at bay. No job is too big, no fee is too big in this custom edition of MONOPOLY!','publish','open','closed','','ghostbusters-monopoly-game','','','2016-09-12 17:24:18','2016-09-13 00:24:18','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/ghostbusters-monopoly-game/',0,'product','',0),(2927,2,'2016-08-05 16:33:37','2016-08-05 16:33:37','','Laser Khet Expansion: Laser Splitter','','publish','open','closed','','laser-khet-expansion-laser-splitter','','','2016-09-12 17:26:15','2016-09-13 00:26:15','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/laser-khet-expansion-laser-splitter/',0,'product','',1),(2928,2,'2016-08-05 16:33:41','2016-08-05 16:33:41','','Mystic Vale','A deadly curse has been laid upon the land and must be cleansed!\r\n\r\nIn Mystic Vale players inhabit the role of druidic clans tasked to eradicate the curse and restore peace and serenity to the land.\r\n\r\nUtilizing a unique card crafting system players build more powerful cards by purchasing advancements with mana. Players can then use their constructed cards to purchase vale cards and earn victory points.\r\n\r\nIf a player is too reckless and power hungry the decay saturating the land may prove too much, resulting in a turn ending prematurely.\r\n\r\nWhen there are no more victory points in the pool the game ends. The player with the most victory points is victorious.','publish','open','closed','','mystic-vale','','','2016-09-12 17:24:18','2016-09-13 00:24:18','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/mystic-vale/',0,'product','',1),(2929,2,'2016-08-05 16:33:42','2016-08-05 16:33:42','','Pandemic Legacy Season 1 Blue','Pandemic Legacy retains the basic premise of award winning and fan favorite Pandemic - players must unite to defeat a wave of diseases plaguing the Earth.\r\n\r\nHowever in Pandemic Legacy the stakes are raised. Players must overcome obstacles and cure disases for an entire year!\r\n\r\nEach month in a calendar year players have two chances to achieve a specific objective - if they succeed the game immediately progresses to the next month. If they fail they get one more shot to get the job done!\r\n\r\nThroughout the campaign new components and rules with far reaching consequences will be introduced to complicate matters.\r\n\r\nDo you and your team have what it takes to eradicate that which plagues the world?','publish','open','closed','','pandemic-legacy-season-1-blue','','','2016-09-12 17:24:18','2016-09-13 00:24:18','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/pandemic-legacy-season-1-blue/',0,'product','',0),(2930,2,'2016-08-05 16:33:45','2016-08-05 16:33:45','','Pandemic Legacy Season 1 Red','Pandemic Legacy retains the basic premise of award winning and fan favorite Pandemic - players must unite to defeat a wave of diseases plaguing the Earth.\r\n\r\nHowever in Pandemic Legacy the stakes are raised. Players must overcome obstacles and cure disases for an entire year!\r\n\r\nEach month in a calendar year players have two chances to achieve a specific objective - if they succeed the game immediately progresses to the next month. If they fail they get one more shot to get the job done!\r\n\r\nThroughout the campaign new components and rules with far reaching consequences will be introduced to complicate matters.\r\n\r\nDo you and your team have what it takes to eradicate that which plagues the world?','publish','open','closed','','pandemic-legacy-season-1-red','','','2016-09-12 17:24:18','2016-09-13 00:24:18','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/pandemic-legacy-season-1-red/',0,'product','',0),(2931,2,'2016-08-05 16:33:55','2016-08-05 16:33:55','','Alchemists','Alchemists is a strategy and deduction game of performing experiments, concocting potions and selling your findings to the highest bidder!\r\n\r\nIt is a delicate balance between research, purchasing artifacts and publishing your findings. If you spend too much time researching you potentially lose out on victory points. Sell potions to gain money and purchase artifacts, but if you sell too early the quality of your potions may suffer and tarnish your reputation!\r\n\r\nThe objective is to publish the most accurate potion theories thus being awarded the most points. Only master alchemists will be so rewarded!','publish','open','closed','','the-alchemists','','','2016-09-14 16:50:18','2016-09-14 23:50:18','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/buy/terror-in-meeple-city/',0,'product','',0),(2932,5,'2016-08-05 16:39:14','2016-08-05 16:39:14','','BOSS MONSTER 2','','inherit','open','closed','','boss-monster-2','','','2016-08-05 16:39:14','2016-08-05 16:39:14','',2516,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/BOSS-MONSTER-2.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(2933,6,'2016-08-05 17:24:02','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Worldpay Log','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2016-08-05 17:24:02','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?p=2933',0,'braintree_log','',0),(2934,6,'2016-08-05 17:24:02','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Worldpay Log','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2016-08-05 17:24:02','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/?p=2934',0,'braintree_log','',0),(2936,6,'2016-08-05 17:29:16','2016-08-05 17:29:16','','boss monster(blog)','','inherit','open','closed','','boss-monsterblog','','','2016-08-05 17:30:23','2016-08-05 17:30:23','',1597,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/boss-monsterblog.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(2937,6,'2016-08-05 17:29:26','2016-08-05 17:29:26','','carcassonne(blog)','','inherit','open','closed','','carcassonneblog','','','2016-08-05 17:30:37','2016-08-05 17:30:37','',1597,'https://boardgamesdev.wpengine.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/carcassonneblog.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(2938,6,'2016-08-05 17:29:33','2016-08-05 17:29:33','','catan(blog)','','inherit','open','closed','','catanblog',