er items and equipment to help you defeat monsters and to aid other players losing to monsters. Munchkin is a fast paced card game that pokes fun at dungeon crawlers and RPGs.','publish','open','closed','','munchkin-bites','','','2016-09-12 17:24:23','2016-09-13 00:24:23','',0,'https://boardgames.com/buy/munchkin-bites/',0,'product','',0),(3277,5,'2016-08-11 19:56:53','2016-08-11 19:56:53','','Star Trek: The Next Generation 1000 Piece Puzzle','','publish','open','closed','','star-trek-next-generation-1000-piece-puzzle','','','2016-09-12 17:24:24','2016-09-13 00:24:24','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=3277',0,'product','',0),(3278,5,'2016-08-11 19:58:27','2016-08-11 19:58:27','','Star Munchkin','Star Munchkin is a science fiction and space variant of the best selling and popular card game Munchkin. Star Munchkin can be played stand alone or be combined with the original Munchkin game and all the sequels.\r\n\r\nStar Munchkin plays just like the original Munchkin game, the rules are the same as is the gameplay. However now the Munchkins are in space!\r\n\r\nBattle mutants, aliens and cyborgs with lasers and vibroswords and nova grenades. Includes Steve Jackson\'s trademark humor and John Kovalic\'s amazing art!','publish','open','closed','','star-munchkin','','','2016-09-12 17:24:24','2016-09-13 00:24:24','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=3278',0,'product','',0),(3279,2,'2016-08-11 21:03:45','2016-08-11 21:03:45','','<i class=\"fa fa-pinterest\"></i>','','publish','closed','closed','','3279','','','2016-09-01 13:02:04','2016-09-01 20:02:04','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?p=3279',4,'nav_menu_item','',0),(3281,5,'2016-08-11 21:34:44','2016-08-11 21:34:44','','tokaido-game','','inherit','open','closed','','tokaido-game','','','2016-08-11 21:34:44','2016-08-11 21:34:44','',2612,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/tokaido-game.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3282,5,'2016-08-11 21:35:35','2016-08-11 21:35:35','',