:11','',2526,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/epicspellwars_box.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3300,5,'2016-08-11 22:43:00','2016-08-11 22:43:00','','Manhattan Project','The Manhattan Project pits player against player, who will rise to the occasion and become the global leader of atomic power?\r\n\r\nIn The Manhattan Project players are the leader of a nation\'s atomic weapons program tasked to build better and bigger bombs than the other nations.\r\n\r\nPlayers have multiple projects to manage throughout the game - building bomb making infrastructure, utilizing the military to project their facilities and deploying spies to commit acts of espionage and sabotage!\r\n\r\nThe Manhattan Project requires meticulous management of resources and advanced strategy to win.','publish','open','closed','','manhattan-project','','','2016-09-12 17:24:24','2016-09-13 00:24:24','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=3300',0,'product','',0),(3301,5,'2016-08-11 22:42:52','2016-08-11 22:42:52','','ManhattanBox-game','','inherit','open','closed','','manhattanbox-game','','','2016-08-11 22:42:52','2016-08-11 22:42:52','',3300,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/ManhattanBox-game.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3302,5,'2016-08-11 22:43:32','2016-08-11 22:43:32','','spurs game box','','inherit','open','closed','','spurs-game-box','','','2016-08-11 22:43:32','2016-08-11 22:43:32','',2602,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/spurs-game-box.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3303,5,'2016-08-11 22:44:24','2016-08-11 22:44:24','','panda-head-game','','inherit','open','closed','','panda-head-game','','','2016-08-11 22:44:24','2016-08-11 22:44:24','',2624,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/panda-head-game.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3304,5,'2016-08-11 22:45:30','2016-08-11 22:45:30','','flash point fire rescue game','','inherit','open','closed','','flash-point-fire-rescue-game','','','2016-08-11 2