07/panamax-game.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3311,5,'2016-08-11 22:52:36','2016-08-11 22:52:36','','Ultimate Werewolf: Artifacts Expansion','Ultimate Werewolf: Artifacts is an expansion for popular party game Ultimate Werewolf.\r\n\r\nArtifacts adds considerable thematic, gameplay and strategy changes to the base game. Artifacts is not a stand alone expansion, the original Ultimate Werewolf base game is required to play.\r\n\r\nIn Ultimate Werewolf: Artifacts players are thrust into the 21st century by utilizing ancient artifacts to progress the game.\r\n\r\nEach player is assigned a secret role and an artifact. Players are either on the werewolf team (who want to stay alive) or the villagers team (who want to find the werewolves).\r\n\r\nThe game is played in a series of days and nights. During the day the villagers decide who among them is a werewolf and vote out that player while at night the werewolves decide which villager to eat.\r\n\r\nThe artifacts add a new dimension to the base game, each with a unique ability or power to help players achieve their objective.','publish','open','closed','','ultimate-werewolf-artifacts-expansion','','','2016-09-14 15:10:55','2016-09-14 22:10:55','',0,'https://boardgames.com/buy/ultimate-werewolf-artifacts-expansion/',0,'product','',0),(3312,5,'2016-08-11 22:55:04','2016-08-11 22:55:04','','ultimate werewolf artifact','','inherit','open','closed','','ultimate-werewolf-artifact','','','2016-08-11 22:55:04','2016-08-11 22:55:04','',3311,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/ultimate-werewolf-artifact.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3313,5,'2016-08-11 22:55:57','2016-08-11 22:55:57','','dragon slayer game','','inherit','open','closed','','dragon-slayer-game','','','2016-08-11 22:55:57','2016-08-11 22:55:57','',2584,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/dragon-slayer-game.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3314,5,'2016-08-11 22:57:41','2016-08-11 22:57:41','','antidote game','','inherit','open','closed','','antidote-game','','','2016-08-11 22:57:41','2016-08-11 22:57:41','',2508,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/antidote-game.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3315,5,'2016-08-11 22:57:54','2016-08-11 22:57:54','','antidote-game-box','','inherit','open','closed','','antidote-game-box','','','2016-08-11 22:57:54','2016-08-11 22:57:54','',2508,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/antidote-game-box.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3316,5,'2016-08-11 22:59:27','2016-08-11 22:59:27','','Among The Stars: Expanding the Alliance','Among the Stars is a science fiction strategy card game of galactical proportions! Newly established peace in the galaxy must be maintained so an Alliance has been created. Massive space stations are needed to facilitate trade, maintain diplomatic relations and promote peace amongst the races. Players assume the role of an alien race tasked to build the best, most efficient space station!','publish','open','closed','','among-stars-expanding-alliance','','','2016-09-12 17:24:24','2016-09-13 00:24:24','',0,'https://boardgames.com/buy/among-stars-expanding-alliance/',0,'product','',0),(3317,5,'2016-08-11 23:01:23','2016-08-11 23:01:23','','among the stars Expanding_The_Alliance_Box','','inherit','open','closed','','among-the-stars-expanding_the_alliance_box','','','2016-08-11 23:01:23','2016-08-11 23:01:23','',3316,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/among-the-stars-Expanding_The_Alliance_Box.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3318,5,'2016-08-11 23:02:07','2016-08-11 23:02:07','','shadows of brimstone game','','inherit','open','closed','','shadows-of-brimstone-game','','','2016-08-11 23:02:07','2016-08-11 23:02:07','',2542,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/shadows-of-brimstone-game.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3319,5,'2016-08-11 23:03:23','2016-08-11 23:03:23','','code names gaem','','inherit','open','closed','','code-names-gaem','','','2016-08-11 23:03:23','2016-08-11 23:03:23','',2527,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/code-names-gaem.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3320,5,'2016-08-11 23:04:24','2016-08-11 23:04:24','','qin-game','','inherit','open','closed','','qin-game','','','2016-08-11 23:04:24','2016-08-11 23:04:24','',2623,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/qin-game.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3321,5,'2016-08-11 23:13:02','2016-08-11 23:13:02','','The Resistance: Avalon','There is tension in Camelot as the battle between good and evil takes a social twist in the highly exciting game The Resistance: Avalon. The game can be played by up to 10 players so it’s perfect for big game nights.\r\n\r\nThis tension-filled adventure starts as players get dealt cards that show which characters they will be playing. There are two factions – the good loyal servants of Arthur and the evil, deceptive minions of Mordred. The minions of Mordred will know each other while the servants of Arthur are left in the dark.\r\n\r\nThe goal of the servants of Arthur is to win the majority of the five quests while the objective of the minions of Mordred is to stop them.\r\n\r\nA thrilling and tense social deduction game, The Resistance: Avalon is a great addition to any board game collection!','publish','open','closed','','the-resistance-avalon','','','2016-09-12 17:24:24','2016-09-13 00:24:24','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=3321',0,'product','',0),(3322,5,'2016-08-11 23:12:33','2016-08-11 23:12:33','','the resistance of avalon game','','inherit','open','closed','','the-resistance-of-avalon-game','','','2016-08-11 23:12:33','2016-08-11 23:12:33','',3321,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/the-resistance-of-avalon-game.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3323,5,'2016-08-11 23:13:20','2016-08-11 23:13:20','','Star Realms: Cosmic Gambit','Star Realms: Cosmic Gambit is an expansion to the popular deck building game Star Realms. Cosmic Gambit is not a standalone game, the original Star Realms game is required to play.\r\n\r\nCosmic Gambit introduces 13 new Gambit cards with different functionality from Gambits in the original Star Realms. These gambits are allocated to players face down at the start of the game. The Gambit cards are only revealed when played and they never go to the players hand, personal deck or the trade deck.','publish','open','closed','','star-realms-cosmic-gambit','','','2016-10-12 07:21:02','2016-10-12 14:21:02','',0,'https://boardgames.com/buy/star-realms-cosmic-gambit/',0,'product','',1),(3324,5,'2016-08-11 23:15:23','2016-08-11 23:15:23','','star realms cosmic gambit expansion game','','inherit','open','closed','','star-realms-cosmic-gambit-expansion-game','','','2016-08-11 23:15:23','2016-08-11 23:15:23','',3323,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/star-realms-cosmic-gambit-expansion-game.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3325,5,'2016-08-11 23:16:46','2016-08-11 23:16:46','','Star Realms: Colony Wars','Star Realms: Colony Wars is a stand-alone expansion for Star Realms. Colony Wars can be played on its own as a two player game or be utilized as an expansion to the original Star Realms game to accommodate up to four players.\r\n\r\nThe game play and win conditions for Colony Wars is the same as in Star Realms - players build a fleet of powerful ships and bases by purchasing them from the Trade deck and attack their opponents. The objective is to reduce your opponent&#039;s Authority to zero.','publish','open','closed','','star-realms-colony-wars','','','2016-10-12 07:20:56','2016-10-12 14:20:56','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=3325',0,'product','',1),(3326,5,'2016-08-11 23:16:39','2016-08-11 23:16:39','','star realms colony wars','','inherit','open','closed','','star-realms-colony-wars','','','2016-08-11 23:16:39','2016-08-11 23:16:39','',3325,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/star-realms-colony-wars.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3327,5