cape the day-to-day drudgery.  And it doesn\'t matter your style.  Some people love the silliness and care-free nature of party games.  Some love the more cerebral escape of an in-depth fantasy or role playing game.  We recommend trying a wide range to find your gaming bliss.\n\n<span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><b>#4 Board Games Save You Money </b></span>\n\nIt’s no coincidence that board game sales boom in times of economic challenge.  Case in point, the best selling board game of all time<span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"> was first published during the great depression.  In fact, many consider the recent recession to be the spark that caused the current explosion of the tabletop gaming industry.  I would have to agree.</span>\n\nSimply put, board games are cheap entertainment.  How else <span class=\"il\">can</span> you spend less than $50 and entertain the entire family night after night?  Buying a party game and inviting your friends over is way less expensive than a night on the town.  When it comes to good times for the buck, it\'s tough to beat board games pound for pound.','4 Ways Board Games Can Improve Your Life','','inherit','closed','closed','','3382-autosave-v1','','','2016-08-23 22:06:10','2016-08-24 05:06:10','',3382,'https://boardgames.com/3382-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3385,2,'2016-08-23 22:30:09','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Worldpay Log','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2016-08-23 22:30:09','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?p=3385',0,'braintree_log','',0),(3386,2,'2016-08-23 22:30:09','0000-00-00 00:00:00','','Worldpay Log','','draft','closed','closed','','','','','2016-08-23 22:30:09','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?p=3386',0,'braintree_log','',0),(3388,2,'2016-08-24 03:57:17','2016-08-24 10:57:17','<div class=\"one-fourth\">\n\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Content Menu\" container_class=\"block\"][brgm-points]\n<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><b>Connect With Us:</b></div>\n[cmk_menu menu=\"Top Social Icon\" menu_class=\"icon-list\"]\n\n&nbsp;\n\n[brgm-weekly]\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"three-fourths last\">\n<h3 class=\"bord\"><span class=\"\">Facebook</span></h3>\n<a href=\"http://www.facebook.com/loveboardgames\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-1799\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/facebook-logo-e1457486810240.jpg\" alt=\"facebook-logo-e1457486810240\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" />www.facebook.com/loveboardgames</a>\n<h3 class=\"bord\"><span class=\"\">Pinterest</span></h3>\n<a target=\"_blank\"><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-3389\" src=\"https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/Pinterest-badge-144px-e1472036176729.png\" alt=\"Pinterest-badge\" width=\"100\" height=\"99\" />www.pinterest.com/loveboardgames</a>\n<h3 class=\"bord\"><span class=\"\">Instagram</span></h3>\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-1797\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/instagram-logo-e1457486879630.jpg\" alt=\"instagram-logo-e1457486879630\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" />@loveboardgames\n\n</div>','Social Media','','inherit','closed','closed','','1796-autosave-v1','','','2016-08-24 03:57:17','2016-08-24 10:57:17','',1796,'https://boardgames.com/1796-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3389,2,'2016-08-24 03:55:39','2016-08-24 10:55:39','','Pinterest-badge','','inherit','open','closed','','pinterest-badge-144px','','','2016-08-24 03:55:58','2016-08-24 10:55:58','',1796,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/05/Pinterest-badge-144px.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3390,1,'2016-08-24 04:37:33','2016-08-24 11:37:33','','Order &ndash; August 24, 2016 @ 04:37 AM','','wc-completed','open','closed','order_57bd867a8ef1b','order-aug-24-2016-1135-am','','','2016-08-24 16:48:29','2016-08-24 23:48:29','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=3390',0,'shop_order','',8),(3396,2,'2016-08-24 13:16:10','2016-08-24 20:16:10','','zimtestmania','Test test lala.  ','trash','closed','closed','','zimtestmania__trashed