'2016-08-30 23:01:56','','star-trek-50th-anniversary-trivial-pursuit_1000','','inherit','open','closed','','star-trek-50th-anniversary-trivial-pursuit_1000','','','2016-08-30 16:01:56','2016-08-30 23:01:56','',3423,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/star-trek-50th-anniversary-trivial-pursuit_1000.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3425,5,'2016-08-30 16:02:20','2016-08-30 23:02:20','','USOTP066201','','inherit','open','closed','','usotp066201','','','2016-08-30 16:02:20','2016-08-30 23:02:20','',3423,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/USOTP066201.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3429,5,'2016-08-30 16:46:02','2016-08-30 23:46:02','','Mini Pong','A mini version of the popular social party game, Mini Pong is quick to set up and lots of fun to play. The ball is tethered to the board so there is no worry about losing it with an errant throw.\r\n\r\nThe objective of the game is to launch the ball and successfully land it in your opponents cup. If you are successful your opponent drinks the contents of the cup. The first player to land the ball in every opponent cup is the winner. BYOB (Bring Your Own Beverage).','publish','open','closed','','mini-pong','','','2016-09-16 09:31:59','2016-09-16 16:31:59','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=3429',0,'product','',0),(3430,1,'2016-08-30 16:35:42','2016-08-30 23:35:42','','derek57c6184e3110c','','trash','closed','closed','','derek57c6184e3110c__trashed','','','2016-10-06 18:39:46','2016-10-07 01:39:46','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?post_type=shop_coupon&#038;p=3430',0,'shop_coupon','',0),(3431,5,'2016-08-30 16:45:10','2016-08-30 23:45:10','','Mini Pong Game','','inherit','open','closed','','box-front','','','2016-08-30 16:45:21','2016-08-30 23:45:21','',3429,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/box-front.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3433,5,'2016-08-30 16:51:58','2016-08-30 23:51:58','','The Urban Dictionary Game','The Urban Dictionary Game is an adult party game based on the popular website of crowd sourced definitions of slang words.\r\n\r\nPlayers vie to impress the judge by playing Urban Dictionary Word cards in response to hashtags, phrases and pictures. Players are encouraged to act out or draw words in addition to playing word cards.\r\n\r\nEach round the judge decides which response is the most (in)appropriate and the chosen player wins the round. The first player to win five rounds wins the game!','publish','open','closed','','urban-dictionary-game','','','2016-10-12 12:40:46','2016-10-12 19:40:46','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=3433',0,'product','',0),(3434,5,'2016-08-30 16:53:21','2016-08-30 23:53:21','','The Voting Game','The Voting Game is a party game for folks who want to find out as much of the gut-busting things about their friends as they can.\n\nYou and your friends start by drawing a card from the deck that asks random questions, like “Who would survive the longest in a zombie apocalypse?” You all vote anonymously for the player you believe was described. Tally all the votes and then reveal the result to everyone. \n\nThe player who gets voted can make one guess as to who cast each vote. If he or she is correct, the player who cast the vote admits it. \n\nThe first player to get 10 points wins.','inherit','closed','closed','','2662-autosave-v1','','','2016-08-30 16:53:21','2016-08-30 23:53:21','',2662,'https://boardgames.com/2662-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3435,5,'2016-08-30 16:54:06','2016-08-30 23:54:06','','The Voting Game','','inherit','open','closed','','box-hero','','','2016-08-30 16:54:17','2016-08-30 23:54:17','',2662,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Box-Hero.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3436,5,'2016-08-30 16:54:20','2016-08-30 23:54:20','','the voting game cards','','inherit','open','closed','','group_9_b760f8e8-f2d2-414e-b64a-cca71e3bbdd8_large','','','2016-08-30 16:54:29','2016-08-30 23:54:29','',2662,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Group_9_b760f8e8-f2d2-414e-b64a-cca71e3bbdd8_large.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3437,5,'2016-08-30 16:56:49','2016-08-30 23:56:49','','The Urban Dictionary Game','','inherit','closed','closed','','3433-autosave-v1','','','2016-08-30 16:56:49','2016-08-30 23:56:49','',3433,'https://boardgames.com/3433-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3438,5,'2016-08-30 16:56:51','2016-08-30 23:56:51','','Urban Dictionary Cards','','inherit','open','closed','','51c3ovhqkkl','','','2016-08-30 16:57:05','2016-08-30 23:57:05','',3433,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/51C3ovHqkKL.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3439,5,'2016-08-30 16:57:30','2016-08-30 23:57:30','','Urban Dictionary Cards','','inherit','open','closed','','71uttozf3bl-_sy450_','','','2016-08-30 16:57:36','2016-08-30 23:57:36','',3433,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/71utTOzF3bL._SY450_.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3440,5,'2016-08-30 16:57:43','2016-08-30 23:57:43','','Urban Dictionary Cards','','inherit','open','closed','','144840_0000','','','2016-08-30 16:57:47','2016-08-30 23:57:47','',3433,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/144840_0000.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3441,5,'2016-08-30 17:01:05','2016-08-31 00:01:05','','Monopoly: Ultimate Banking','Monopoly: Ultimate Banking introduces a modem banking system into the favorite board game classic Monopoly.\r\n\r\nGone is monopoly money replaced with the all in one Ultimate Banking unit that tracks every players funds. Each player has a bank card which is used to make transactions.\r\n\r\nAlso unique to this version of Monopoly are Event Cards and Location Spaces, replacing Chance Cards and Community Chest Cards. Landing on an Event space can result in raising or lowering rent. While landing on a Location space affords the player the option to pay to travel to a specific property space.\r\n\r\nA fun, modern spin on a classic game. Fun for all ages!','publish','open','closed','','monopoly-ultimate-banking','','','2016-10-05 19:47:54','2016-10-06 02:47:54','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=3441',0,'product','',0),(3442,5,'2016-08-30 17:00:27','2016-08-31 00:00:27','','monopoly ultimate banking','','inherit','open','closed','','3335d40a50569047f58c5c0a6a21d6ce','','','2016-08-30 17:00:38','2016-08-31 00:00:38','',3441,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/3335D40A50569047F58C5C0A6A21D6CE.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3443,5,'2016-08-30 17:00:43','2016-08-31 00:00:43','','monopoly ultimate banking','','inherit','open','closed','','gallery-1455731608-monopoly-ultimate-banking','','','2016-08-30 17:00:49','2016-08-31 00:00:49','',3441,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/gallery-1455731608-monopoly-ultimate-banking.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3444,5,'2016-08-30 17:01:20','2016-08-31 00:01:20','','Monikers Game','','inherit','open','closed','','42503_2_1200px','','','2016-08-30 17:01:29','2016-08-31 00:01:29','',2610,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/42503_2_1200px.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3445,5,'2016-08-30 17:02:59','2016-08-31 00:02:59','','42503_1_1200px','','inherit','open','closed','','42503_1_1200px','','','2016-08-30 17:02:59','2016-08-31 00:02:59','',2610,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/42503_1_1200px.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3446,5,'2016-08-30 17:09:28','2016-08-31 00:09:28','The Metagame is a party game perfect for engaging in conversation and social interaction.\r\n\r\nThis is a game of proclaiming opinions to incite good conversation rather than reciting facts and figures. There is a wide gamut of topics ranging from art to entertainment prompting discussion and laughter.\r\n\r\nThe Metagame is actually comprised of six unique games - some focused on chatting, others have an emphasis on thinking on your feet and some are just silly!','The Meta Game','The Metagame is a party game perfect for engaging in conversation and social interaction.\r\n\r\nThis is a game of proclaiming opinions to incite good conversation rather than reciting facts and figures. There is a wide gamut of topics ranging from art to entertainment prompting discussion and laughter.\r\n\r\nThe Metagame is actually comprised of six unique games - some focused on chatting, others have an emphasis on thinking on your feet and some are just silly!','publish','open','closed','','the-meta-game','','','2016-10-12 12:38:11','2016-10-12 19:38:11','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?post_type=product&#038;p=3446',0,'product','',0),(3447,5,'2016-08-30 17:04:22','2016-08-31 00:04:22','','Monopoly: Ultimate Banking','<p><br data-mce-bogus=\"1\"></p>','inherit','closed','closed','','3441-autosave-v1','','','2016-08-30 17:04:22','2016-08-31 00:04:22','',3441,'https://boardgames.com/3441-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3448,5,'2016-08-30 17:06:17','2016-08-31 00:06:17','','the_metagame','','inherit','open','closed','','the_metagame','','','2016-08-30 17:06:17','2016-08-31 00:06:17','',3446,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/the_metagame.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3449,5,'2016-08-30 17:09:14','2016-08-31 00:09:14','','TheMetagame_basicset_box','','inherit','open','closed','','themetagame_basicset_box','','','2016-08-30 17:09:14','2016-08-31 00:09:14','',3446,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/TheMetagame_basicset_box.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3450,5,'2016-08-30 17:14:03','2016-08-31 00:14:03','','trivial pursuit','','inherit','open','closed','','81okxcqgyyl-_sy355_','','','2016-08-30 17:14:14','2016-08-31 00:14:14','',3433,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/81OkxCqGYyL._SY355_.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3451,1,'2016-08-31 07:05:56','2016-08-31 14:05:56','','derek57c6e4446e992','','trash','closed','closed','','derek57c6e4446e992__trashed','','','2016-10-06 18:39:46','2016-10-07 01:39:46','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?post_type=shop_coupon&#038;p