closed','','agenthunter1-700x700','','','2016-09-01 15:37:49','2016-09-01 22:37:49','',2698,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/agenthunter1-700x700.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3461,5,'2016-09-01 15:37:56','2016-09-01 22:37:56','','pic1630764_md','','inherit','open','closed','','pic1630764_md','','','2016-09-01 15:37:56','2016-09-01 22:37:56','',2698,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/pic1630764_md.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3462,5,'2016-09-01 15:40:23','2016-09-01 22:40:23','','love-letter-adventure-time-at_ll_beautyshot_pouch','','inherit','open','closed','','at_ll_beautyshot_pouch','','','2016-09-01 15:40:48','2016-09-01 22:40:48','',2701,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/at_ll_beautyshot_pouch.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3463,5,'2016-09-01 15:40:50','2016-09-01 22:40:50','','Agent Hunter','<p>Agent Hunter lets players take on the role of rival agents. You must use your spies to find your opponent’s spies who hide out in safe houses, disguise their identities, and sneak around in the dark. Ever increasing methods of detection lead to even more impressive methods of deception.</p><p>For each round, a player tries to figure out whether their opponent’s Agent level is matched, or higher or lower than their card. The game ends when one player\'s Agents are all eliminated. The winner is the player who has the most points.</p><p>Agent Hunter will test your stealth and how cunning you can go! The closer you get to your target, the more you risk compromising your position. Who will remain hidden in the shadows? Who will survive the hunt? If you’re in the mood for some spy action, this game is for you!</p>','inherit','closed','closed','','2698-autosave-v1','','','2016-09-01 15:40:50','2016-09-01 22:40:50','',2698,'https://boardgames.com/2698-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3464,5,'2016-09-01 15:52:12','2016-09-01 22:52:12','','Abraca What? Board Game','','inherit','open','closed','','pic2207920_md','','','2016-09-01 15:54:25','2016-09-01 22:54:25','',2922,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/pic2207920_md.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3465,5,'2016-09-01 15:55:18','2016-09-01 22:55:18','','pic2740850_md','','inherit','open','closed','','pic2740850_md','','','2016-09-01 15:55:18','2016-09-01 22:55:18','',2922,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/pic2740850_md.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3466,5,'2016-09-01 16:12:02','2016-09-01 23:12:02','','91r0mD05dsL._SL1500_','','inherit','open','closed','','91r0md05dsl-_sl1500_','','','2016-09-01 16:12:02','2016-09-01 23:12:02','',2931,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/91r0mD05dsL._SL1500_.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3467,5,'2016-09-01 16:12:10','2016-09-01 23:12:10','','91AjP8gvsOL._SL1500_','','inherit','open','closed','','91ajp8gvsol-_sl1500_','','','2016-09-01 16:12:10','2016-09-01 23:12:10','',2931,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/91AjP8gvsOL._SL1500_.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3468,5,'2016-09-01 16:13:59','2016-09-01 23:13:59','','Apples-to-Apples-Box','','inherit','open','closed','','apples-to-apples-box','','','2016-09-01 16:13:59','2016-09-01 23:13:59','',2593,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Apples-to-Apples-Box.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3469,5,'2016-09-01 16:16:08','2016-09-01 23:16:08','','Apples to Apples','<p>Apples to Apples is the quintessential party game - grab a grip of friends, deal the cards and go. Gameplay is fast paced and simple - there are red cards and there are green cards. Red cards are nouns and green cards are adjectives. Each player gets five red cards to start and each round the Judge reveals a green card. The remaining players choose a red card from their hand that best matches the green card. The Judge then determines which red card is the perfect match and the player who played that red card is the Judge for the next round.</p>','inherit','closed','closed','','2593-autosave-v1','','','2016-09-01 16:16:08','2016-09-01 23:16:08','',2593,'https://boardgames.com/2593-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3470,5,'2016-09-01 16:20:28','2016-09-01 23:20:28','','81uN+mIaG8L._SL1500_','','inherit','open','closed','','81unmiag8l-_sl1500_','','','2016-09-01 16:20:28','2016-09-01 23:20:28','',2923,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/81uNmIaG8L._SL1500_.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3471,5,'2016-09-01 16:31:40','2016-09-01 23:31:40','','the resistance : avalon','','inherit','open','closed','','static1-squarespace','','','2016-09-01 16:31:55','2016-09-01 23:31:55','',3321,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/static1.squarespace.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3472,5,'2016-09-01 16:53:46','2016-09-01 23:53:46','','among-the-stars-board_soyxgu','','inherit','open','closed','','among-the-stars-board_soyxgu','','','2016-09-01 16:53:46','2016-09-01 23:53:46','',2657,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/among-the-stars-board_soyxgu.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3473,5,'2016-09-01 16:55:43','2016-09-01 23:55:43','','Apotheca','<p>Apotheca a light strategy game where players compete to craft potions in a secret marketplace. Missions include hiding ingredients, deceiving opponents, and using magical powers to mix concoctions. The first player to impress three apothecaries will be allowed to join their ranks!</p><p>The game is played on a 4x4 grid. For each turn, there are 4 possible actions to choose from – reveal, restock, power, and hire. If a player is able to match 3 Potion cards of the same color in a row or column, this Apothecary is satisfied with the player’s ability to mix potions.</p><p>To gain points, it’s important to keep revealing potions, collecting gems, and hiring new apothecaries. Trap your opponents with clever spatial moves, bluffing and misdirection. The game continues until 1 player appeases 3 Apothecary cards. The first player to make three matches wins!</p>','inherit','closed','closed','','2639-autosave-v1','','','2016-09-01 16:55:43','2016-09-01 23:55:43','',2639,'https://boardgames.com/2639-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3474,5,'2016-09-01 16:57:17','2016-09-01 23:57:17','','l9gar003-sb','','inherit','open','closed','','l9gar003-sb','','','2016-09-01 16:57:17','2016-09-01 23:57:17','',2590,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/l9gar003-sb.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3475,5,'2016-09-01 17:48:42','2016-09-02 00:48:42','','alpha-contents','','inherit','open','closed','','alpha-contents','','','2016-09-01 17:48:42','2016-09-02 00:48:42','',2515,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/alpha-contents.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3476,5,'2016-09-01 17:50:30','2016-09-02 00:50:30','','Boss Monster','<p>Designed for 2-4 players, Boss Monster is packed with nostalgic references to 8-bit video games, dungeon-crawling RPGs, and geeky pop culture. Players compete to become the ultimate villain: the final boss at the end of a side-scrolling dungeon.</p>','inherit','closed','closed','','2515-autosave-v1','','','2016-09-01 17:50:30','2016-09-02 00:50:30','',2515,'https://boardgames.com/2515-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3477,5,'2016-09-02 11:34:40','2016-09-02 18:34:40','','Boss Monster 2: The Next Level','<p>Take your dungeon to the next level with Boss Monster 2. The mission is to strategically build a dungeon full of rooms, lure in hapless adventurers, kill them off, and collect their souls. Don’t let any adventurer make it through the dungeon alive or it will cause damage to the boss!</p><p>Boss Monster 2 features everything there is in the best-selling original but with fresh new mechanisms and exciting new options. Now, there are Dark Heroes and Hybrid Heroes who can raise the stakes. And, epic spells and ‘cycling’ rooms give players more options and flexibility.</p><p>Get ready to construct your lair! Tempt adventurers with treasures that will surely lead to their deaths! With more bosses, more unique cards, and more ways to slay adventurers, Boss Monster 2 is a must-have expansion!</p>','inherit','closed','closed','','2516-autosave-v1','','','2016-09-02 11:34:40','2016-09-02 18:34:40','',2516,'https://boardgames.com/2516-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3481,1,'2016-09-04 21:54:46','2016-09-05 04:54:46','','Order &ndash; September 4, 2016 @ 09:54 PM','','wc-cancelled','open','closed','order_57ccf8d138b2e','order-sep-05-2016-0447-am','','','2016-09-04 21:54:46','2016-09-05 04:54:46','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?post_type=shop_order&#038;p=3481',0,'shop_order','',1),(3482,5,'2016-09-05 10:18:31','2016-09-05 17:18:31','','miniongames','','inherit','open','closed','','miniongames','','','2016-09-05 10:18:31','2016-09-05 17:18:31','',0,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/miniongames.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3483,5,'2016-09-05 10:19:23','2016-09-05 17:19:23','','localno12_logo','','inherit','open','closed','','localno12_logo','','','2016-09-05 10:19:23','2016-09-05 17:19:23','',0,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/localno12_logo.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3484,5,'2016-09-05 10:20:07','2016-09-05 17:20:07','','czechgameseditionlogo','','inherit','open','closed','','czechgameseditionlogo','','','2016-09-05 10:20:07','2016-09-05 17:20:07','',0,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/czechgameseditionlogo.png',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(3485,5,'2016-09-05 10:25:34','2016-09-05 17:25:34','','BUFFALO_logo_primary','','inherit','open','closed','','buffalo_logo_primary','','','2016-09-05 10:25:34','2016-09-05 17:25:34','',0,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/BuffaloGamesLogo2014.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3486,5,'2016-09-05 12:03:29','2016-09-05 19:03:29','','Refund &ndash; Sep 05, 2016 @ 07:03 PM','','wc-completed','closed','closed','refund_57cdc181558f5','refund-sep-05-2016-0703-pm','','','2016-09-05 12:03:29','2016-09-05 19:03:29','',3413,'https://boardgames.com/shop_order_refund/refund-sep-05-2016-0703-pm/',0,'shop_order_refund','',0),(3488,5,'2016-09-05 12:11:20','2016-09-05 19:11:20','','Dragon Slayer','<p>Dragon Slayer is a role playing game that gives players the chance to become the ultimate dragon slayer of a magical world.</p><p>In the world full of ferocious dragons, you and your friends are the bravest fighters－the most fearless dragon slayers of all competing to become the master.</p><p>The beasts aren’t the only danger. Any player can challenge any opponent during his or her Dragon Hunt.</p><p>Aside from losing, how you react to a challenge affects your chance of winning the game. There is also the order in which to best slay the beasts to figure out.</p><p>Use all your skills to make all the right moves and be crowned the master dragon slayer.</p>','inherit','closed','closed','','2584-autosave-v1','','','2016-09-05 12:11:20','2016-09-05 19:11:20','',2584,'https://boardgames.com/2584-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3490,5,'2016-09-05 13:39:05','2016-09-05 20:39:05','','nastolnaya_igra_dominion_p12_2','','inherit','open','closed','','nastolnaya_igra_dominion_p12_2','','','2016-09-05 13:39:05','2016-09-05 20:39:05','',2642,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/nastolnaya_igra_dominion_p12_2.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3491,5,'2016-09-05 13:51:50','2016-09-05 20:51:50','','Fluxx-Content','','inherit','open','closed','','fluxx-content','','','2016-09-05 13:51:50','2016-09-05 20:51:50','',2591,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Fluxx-Content.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3492,5,'2016-09-05 13:56:34','2016-09-05 20:56:34','','Epic-Spell-Wars-Content','','inherit','open','closed','','epic-spell-wars-content','','','2016-09-05 13:56:34','2016-09-05 20:56:34','',2526,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Epic-Spell-Wars-Content.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3493,5,'2016-09-05 13:56:56','2016-09-05 20:56:56','','Dancing-Eggs-Content','','inherit','open','closed','','dancing-eggs-content','','','2016-09-05 13:56:56','2016-09-05 20:56:56','',2559,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Dancing-Eggs-Content.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3494,5,'2016-09-05 13:57:13','2016-09-05 20:57:13','','Despicable-Me-2-Operation-Game-Content','','inherit','open','closed','','despicable-me-2-operation-game-content','','','2016-09-05 13:57:13','2016-09-05 20:57:13','',2925,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/Despicable-Me-2-Operation-Game-Content.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3495,5,'2016-09-05 14:00:12','2016-09-05 21:00:12','','Dungeon-Roll-Content','','inherit','open','closed','','dungeon-roll-content','','','2016-09-05 14:00:12','2016-09-05 21:00:12','',2660,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Dungeon-Roll-Content.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3496,5,'2016-09-05 14:00:35','2016-09-05 21:00:35','','Dungeon Roll','Sometimes, after years of hard adventuring all a hero really wants to do on their weekends is relax without any serious commitments. Oh sure, Grogda might constantly chastise you about commitment, but you know what she&#039;s really saying. She&#039;s saying, \"Roll those dice Gruumsh!\" You don&#039;t need her to tell you twice! Time to bust out some quick adventuring with Dungeon Roll!\n\nDungeon Roll is a 15 to 20 minute game that can be played with 1 to 4 humans, orcs, halflings, dwarves, and gnomes! No elves. Hmm, what? Oh fine Grogda, the elves can play too. This game lets you get all the fun of dungeon delving without the back breaking chair sitting for 12 hours on a Saturday and then into the early hours of the morning on Sunday. Dungeon Roll is a fun, lighthearted alternative to the more intense RPG&#039;s available.\n\nChoose your hero, roll the dice, gather your party, explore the dungeon, get phat lewtz but do so before you wake the dragon or lose your entire adventuring party. This game is fun, exciting, quick, and no elves allowed! Sorry, elves allowed.','inherit','closed','closed','','2660-autosave-v1','','','2016-09-05 14:00:35','2016-09-05 21:00:35','',2660,'https://boardgames.com/2660-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3497,5,'2016-09-05 14:04:55','2016-09-05 21:04:55','','Dead-of-Winter-Content','','inherit','open','closed','','dead-of-winter-content','','','2016-09-05 14:04:55','2016-09-05 21:04:55','',2615,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Dead-of-Winter-Content.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3498,5,'2016-09-05 14:06:04','2016-09-05 21:06:04','','Dice-City-Content','','inherit','open','closed','','dice-city-content','','','2016-09-05 14:06:04','2016-09-05 21:06:04','',2493,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Dice-City-Content.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3499,5,'2016-09-05 14:08:40','2016-09-05 21:08:40','','Castle-Panic-Content','','inherit','open','closed','','castle-panic-content','','','2016-09-05 14:08:40','2016-09-05 21:08:40','',2539,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Castle-Panic-Content.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3500,5,'2016-09-05 14:12:54','2016-09-05 21:12:54','','Candy-Land-Content','','inherit','open','closed','','candy-land-content','','','2016-09-05 14:12:54','2016-09-05 21:12:54','',2571,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Candy-Land-Content.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3501,5,'2016-09-05 14:13:56','2016-09-05 21:13:56','','Cheaty-Mages-Content','','inherit','open','closed','','cheaty-mages-content','','','2016-09-05 14:13:56','2016-09-05 21:13:56','',2699,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Cheaty-Mages-Content.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3502,5,'2016-09-05 14:16:07','2016-09-05 21:16:07','','Coup-Content-1','','inherit','open','closed','','coup-content-1','','','2016-09-05 14:16:07','2016-09-05 21:16:07','',2583,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/Coup-Content-1.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3503,5,'2016-09-05 14:17:19','2016-09-05 21:17:19','','C