77732e6d74762e636f6d2f2f77702d636f6e74656e742f75706c6f6164732f6765656b2f323031322f30362f5761746572646565702d66756c6c5f73657475702e6a7067.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3619,5,'2016-09-14 17:13:50','2016-09-15 00:13:50','','Lords of Waterdeep','<p>Lords of Waterdeep is an award-winning strategy board game for 2 to 5 players. To gain control, a player sends agents to different locations and recruit clerics, fighters, rogues, and wizards. Your main goal is to gather these adventurers to satisfy the conditions of a Quest card.</p><p>Quests come in different categories such as warfare or piety. Completing them can earn you extra money or special powers. Lords can also gain Intrigue cards, which contain mandatory challenges that can be used on other players, wherein they are forced to complete them!</p><p>This compelling board game will surely test your skills on trickery and negotiation. Who will take control of the hidden treasures and resources of the city? Who will be the most powerful Lord of Waterdeep?</p>','inherit','closed','closed','','2670-autosave-v1','','','2016-09-14 17:13:50','2016-09-15 00:13:50','',2670,'https://boardgames.com/2670-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3620,5,'2016-09-14 17:15:09','2016-09-15 00:15:09','','mice-mystics-big','','inherit','open','closed','','mice-mystics-big','','','2016-09-14 17:15:09','2016-09-15 00:15:09','',2616,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/mice-mystics-big.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3621,2,'2016-09-14 17:16:38','2016-09-15 00:16:38','','Greedy Greedy Goblins','Greedy Greedy Goblins is an action-packed game that positively encourages its players to push their luck. It creates a simultaneous play wherein players offload monsters and excess dynamite onto other mines, and claim the good mine before anyone else. Will you be able to read into your opponents bluff? Or, will you fall into your opponent’s trap? \n\nEnjoy the goblin madness with friends and read into everyone else&#039;s body language and speed! Greedy Greedy Goblins has a perfect mixture of game elements. It’s a light-hearted game that promotes rapid decision-making skills! \n\nIf you’re in the mood for some chaotic treasure hunting exploding dynamites, this game is definitely for you!','inherit','closed','closed','','2494-autosave-v1','','','2016-09-14 17:16:38','2016-09-15 00:16:38','',2494,'https://boardgames.com/2494-autosave-v1/',0,'revision','',0),(3624,1,'2016-09-14 21:58:40','2016-09-15 04:58:40','','2-CARTINSTANTBUCKS-09.15.16','','trash','closed','closed','','2-cartinstantbucks-09-15-16__trashed','','','2016-10-12 13:13:20','2016-10-12 20:13:20','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?post_type=shop_coupon&#038;p=3624',0,'shop_coupon','',0),(3626,1,'2016-09-14 22:37:46','2016-09-15 05:37:46','','2-CARTINSTANTBUCKS-09.15.16','','trash','closed','closed','','2-cartinstantbucks-09-15-16-2__trashed','','','2016-10-12 13:13:20','2016-10-12 20:13:20','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?post_type=shop_coupon&#038;p=3626',0,'shop_coupon','',0),(3628,7,'2016-09-15 11:56:35','2016-09-15 18:56:35',' ','','','publish','closed','closed','','3628','','','2016-10-11 18:17:39','2016-10-12 01:17:39','',0,'https://boardgames.com/?p=3628',5,'nav_menu_item','',0),(3630,5,'2016-09-16 09:00:34','2016-09-16 16:00:34','','mice-mystics-game','','inherit','open','closed','','mice-mystics-game','','','2016-09-16 09:00:34','2016-09-16 16:00:34','',2616,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/mice-mystics-game.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3631,5,'2016-09-16 09:01:56','2016-09-16 16:01:56','','dc-comics-deck-building-game','','inherit','open','closed','','dc-comics-deck-building-game-2','','','2016-09-16 09:01:56','2016-09-16 16:01:56','',2525,'https://boardgames.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/DC-comics-deck-building-game.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(3632,1,'2016-09-16 15:25:21','2016-09-16 22:25:21','','Order &ndash; September 16, 2016 @ 03:25 PM','','wc-cancelled','open','closed','order_57dc6f715