INSERT INTO `quqql19koe_term_taxonomy` VALUES (1,1,'category','',0,0),(2,2,'product_type','',0,239),(3,3,'product_type','',0,0),(4,4,'product_type','',0,0),(5,5,'product_type','',0,0),(6,6,'nav_menu','',0,18),(17,17,'nav_menu','',0,4),(35,35,'product_cat','I am the product Category Archive',0,0),(36,36,'product_cat','These games are for adults only - they contain mature themes, rude humor and taboo subjects.',35,15),(37,37,'product_cat','',0,0),(286,286,'nav_menu','',0,9),(39,39,'product_cat','',0,0),(40,40,'product_cat','Who says games are for kids!  Intended for a more \"mature\" crowd, these cheeky games often utilize crude humor and taboo subjects that push boundaries in the name of fun.  Grab an adult board game and your wildest friends and family, because it\'s time to get weird.  Let\'s face it, you\'re not grown up yet!',39,12),(41,41,'product_cat','',0,0),(42,42,'product_cat','',41,11),(288,288,'nav_menu','',0,48),(240,240,'product_cat','',71,0),(45,45,'product_cat','',0,0),(46,46,'product_cat','',45,10),(47,47,'product_cat','',0,0),(48,48,'product_cat','A board game is a game that involves placement and movement of game pieces, according to specific rules or stipulations, on a predefined board. The board itself generally represents the world or setting of the game established by the mythos in the rulebook.',47,117),(49,49,'product_cat','',45,10),(239,239,'product_cat','On a budget? Look no further! Great games at a great value.',71,13),(52,52,'product_cat','',45,15),(53,53,'product_cat','A collection of the best party board games out there... guaranteed to get the party started!  Highly interactive, easy to learn, fast paced... these party games are all about the laughs and good times.  Whether it be with family or with friends, an old classic or a hot new title, you\'ll be the life of the party when you grab one today!',39,54),(54,54,'product_cat','',45,7),(55,55,'product_cat','',45,6),(56,56,'product_cat','',45,3),(57,57,'product_cat','',45,19),(58,58,'product_cat','',45,12),(59,59,'product_cat','',45,9),(60,60,'product_cat','',45,13),(61,61,'product_cat','',45,5),(62,62,'product_cat','',41,16),(63,63,'product_cat','',45,14),(64,64,'product_cat','These games are appropriate for most everybody, though they are more complex and involved than may be enjoyable to those 12 and under.',35,101),(277,277,'product_cat','Games where players must work together to overcome an enemy. Unite for victory or perish! Games of comradery, teamwork and bonding.',76,3),(66,66,'product_cat','These are the hottest, most sought after and coolest games on the market. These games are so popular it can be tricky keeping them in stock, so buy \'em while we got \'em!',76,9),(67,67,'product_cat','',45,6),(68,68,'product_cat','',0,0),(219,219,'product_cat','As d\'Or (Golden Ace) is an award from the Cannes Festival International des Jeux, first awarded in 1988. In its early years, one of the awards was for the best video game.',68,2),(70,70,'product_cat','Games, classic and new, that are perfect for family game night. Generally these games are light on strategy instead focusing on player interaction, quick gameplay and having some lighthearted fun!',39,59),(71,71,'product_cat','',0,13),(72,72,'product_cat','',45,1),(74,74,'product_cat','These are games that introduce some advanced mechanics, strategy and gameplay for those kids who are ready to delve into more involved games.',35,66),(75,75,'product_cat','',37,83),(76,76,'product_cat','',0,1),(77,77,'product_cat','Big on epaulets and accolades? Look no further! Here\'s a big ol\' list of esteemed games that have won some of the most prestigious awards in the gaming world.',76,54),(78,78,'product_cat','',45,35),(79,79,'product_cat','Card games usually utilize cards as the main component of the game. There are many varieties of card games ranging from intuitive to strategic to social. Some of the more attractive aspects of a card game are its portability, ease of setup and minimal clean up time.',47,94),(80,80,'product_cat','',41,20),(81,81,'product_cat','',41,13),(82,82,'product_cat','Games that require some advanced strategy, have involved gameplay and are thematically interesting. These games are complex enough to satisfy the advanced gamer while being accessible enough for a casual gamer to enjoy.',76,104),(83,83,'product_cat','The Spiel des Jahres (Game of the Year), the most prestigious award for board and card games, is awarded annually by a jury of German game critics. Since 1989 the Kinderspiel des Jahres (Children&#039;s game of the Year) has also been annually awarded.',68,11),(84,84,'product_cat','Strategy Games (often referred to as \"Euro\" games) are generally more advanced than <a href=\"https://boardgames.com/discover/approved/classic-board-game/\">classic board games</a> or <a href=\"https://boardgames.com/discover/best/party-board-games/\">party games</a>. Strategy board games utilize sophisticated mechanics and rules, challenging your wit and requiring you to out-smart your opponents.  So why do hardcore gamers prefer strategy board games?  While many are simple enough for a new gamer to learn, the best ones take years to master and provide endless chances to flex your mental muscles.',39,132),(85,85,'product_cat','These games have cool themes that add great value to the gaming experience. While mechanics and gameplay are crucial to a good game, a unique setting can elevate a game to greatness.',76,77),(287,287,'nav_menu','',0,9),(87,87,'product_cat','',45,10),(88,88,'product_cat','',45,16),(89,89,'product_cat','',45,7),(90,90,'product_cat','Spanning a wide range of themes, fantasy board games usually involve some sort of mythical back story.  Fantasy games are highly engaging, allowing players to fully immerse themselves into the objective.  Whether you\'re a sage gamer or a novice ready to dive in, it is time for your journey to begin!',41,47),(91,91,'product_cat','',45,23),(92,92,'product_cat','',41,10),(93,93,'product_cat','',37,67),(94,94,'product_cat','',45,2),(95,95,'product_cat','',45,20),(96,96,'product_cat','In cooperative board games the enemy isn\'t the person sitting next to you.  Instead, you\'ll work together to overcome an omnipotent opposing entity or a challenging collective objective.  Co-op games are one of the newest, hottest trends in tabletop gaming.  They challenge the intelligence of your group and create a sense of comradery rarely found in traditional \"winner take all\" games.  So grab your friends and family to band together to thwart the menace of doom!',39,9),(97,97,'product_cat','',45,58),(98,98,'product_cat','',41,24),(100,100,'product_cat','',41,17),(101,101,'product_cat','',41,3),(102,102,'product_cat','',45,45),(103,103,'product_cat','',41,13),(104,104,'product_cat','',45,11),(105,105,'product_cat','',45,13),(106,106,'product_cat','Get in on the ground floor, make a contribution to the next big game! Here you can find all the latest and greatest board games being developed. Not to mention you can help make them a reality by donating to the Kickstarter campaigns.',76,28),(107,107,'product_cat','These games don\'t take a lot of time to set up. A bare minimum of components, no complex elements and straight forward rules. Just dive in and play!',76,50),(108,108,'product_cat','These games are perfect for kids. They are light weight, easy to learn and fast to play while containing many elements and mechanics of more advanced games.',35,53),(109,109,'product_cat','',41,4),(110,110,'product_cat','If you are itching to get your feet wet with board games but are overwhelmed by the sheer volume of games out there, don\'t sweat it! We\'ve made a handy list of entry level games that will ease you into board gaming (while satisfying your hardcore gamer friends at the same time!)  Generally speaking, <a href=\"https://boardgames.com/discover/best/party-board-games/\">board games for parties</a> and <a href=\"https://boardgames.com/discover/best/family-board-games/\">families</a> are the most easy to learn.',76,111),(111,111,'product_cat','Games that have a low barrier to entry, perfect for the novice board gamers wanting to get their feet wet. While being new player friendly these games are well designed making them enjoyable even to the most advanced gamers.',76,90),(112,112,'product_cat','',41,6),(113,113,'product_cat','Games that only get better and better the more you play them. Fun, interactive and fresh these are games you\'ll look forward to playing time and time again.',76,4),(114,114,'product_cat','',45,28),(115,115,'product_cat','Enjoy an intense session of gaming with these games that encourage players to employ their best strategies, have high stakes and are taut with tension.',76,11),(116,116,'product_cat','',37,40),(117,117,'product_cat','',45,6),(118,118,'product_cat','The Origins Awards are presented annually at the Origins event in Columbus, Ohio. Captured here are the boardgame and cardgame specific awards for the year shown. Origins Awards are also given for role-playing games, miniatures, and gaming publications.',68,7),(119,119,'product_cat','',45,8),(285,285,'category','',0,7),(121,121,'product_cat','',37,10),(122,122,'product_cat','',41,5),(123,123,'product_cat','',45,11),(124,124,'product_cat','Games that require a high level of player interaction to be successful. Without actively engaging with the other players of the game you are unlikely to win the game!',76,13),(125,125,'product_cat','',41,6),(126,126,'product_cat','',45,13),(127,127,'product_cat','Since 1990, each year, American Mensa selects several (usually 5) games to recommend through its Mind Games competition. These games are named Mensa Select.',68,16),(128,128,'product_cat','',45,7),(129,129,'product_cat','',41,30),(130,130,'product_cat','',45,9),(131,131,'product_cat','',45,10),(132,132,'product_cat','A dynamic set-up keeps game play and strategy fresh by adding an element of random board generation. This improves replay value without sacrificing quality of game play.',76,11),(133,133,'product_cat','',37,35),(134,134,'product_cat','',41,5),(135,135,'product_cat','',41,2),(136,136,'product_cat','These games were specifically designed to be played in large groups. Perfect for a party or family get together these games are generally easy to learn and quick to play.',76,18),(137,137,'product_cat','These games are intended for and thrive in a party environment. Generally quick to learn, easy to set up and highly social they are ideal for any gathering of friends and family.',76,41),(138,138,'product_cat','The classics from your childhood that have stood the test of time. Great for family game night or a palate cleanser between more intense gaming sessions.  No board game closet is complete without them.  Grab a classic board game today and take a trip down memory lane, remembering why you fell in love with games in the first place!',76,21),(139,139,'product_cat','',41,2),(140,140,'product_cat','Kids board games by and large have simple mechanics, mild themes and intuitive rules. They will often include elements intended to promote educational development. But more importantly... they\'re also silly and fun!  Get your child away from the screen and sitting around the table for some good old-fashioned board gaming.  While intended for children, many kids games are fun for folks of all ages.',39,28),(141,141,'product_cat','',45,12),(218,218,'product_cat','Running strong since 2007, the Dice Tower Awards are an annual award ceremony hosted by the Dice Tower Network. The Games are selected by a committee of renowned board game podcasters and bloggers.',68,13),(143,143,'product_cat','These are the go to games, the games everyone knows and loves. No slouches in this lot, they\'re all winners and worth checking out.',76,1),(144,144,'product_cat','Compact and light weight these games are perfect for bringing over to a friends house or while you\'re on the road and need some entertainment. Small games that pack a punch.',76,12),(145,145,'product_cat','Dice Games have dice as the main component and rely upon dice rolls for the main mechanic. Usually luck (or unluck) is a big factor in dice games, although sometimes strategy can be employed with positive effect.',47,7),(146,146,'product_cat','',41,2),(147,147,'product_cat','Games that incorporate interesting mechanics, a cool setting and advocate a new perspective on strategy to facilitate a unique gaming experience.',76,23),(148,148,'product_cat','Games that have players getting up and moving around, getting the blood pumping and adrenaline rushing. These games are particularly good after a long session of gaming.',76,2),(149,149,'product_cat','Educational games have been specifically designed to teach people about a certain subject, expand concepts, reinforce development, understand an historical event or culture, or assist them in learning a skill as they play.',39,1),(150,150,'product_cat','Games with components meticulously designed and crafted with quality materials, adding value and beauty to the gaming experience. Great for hobbyists and craft enthusiasts.',76,12),(151,151,'product_cat','',45,4),(152,152,'product_cat','Have you played the heck out of your favorite board game and are fiending for more content? This is the place to find every side quest, add-on, modification and new campaign available.',76,10),(153,153,'product_cat','Print-n-Play games are versions of games that are usually free to download, print out and then start playing! Often times they are truncated, out dated or \'in development\' versions of games, but don\'t let that scare you off! These games are fun and will provide you with hours of entertainment.',47,1),(154,154,'product_cat','',45,11),(155,155,'product_cat','Games with elegant design and beautiful artwork that enhance and enrich the player experience. Great additions to any collection.',76,10),(156,156,'product_cat','Games that are light on theme and generally do not rely upon hidden information or luck as mechanics. Players will need to employ logic, problem solving and strategy to defeat opponents. Sounds heavy right? Don\'t worry - these games are fun!',39,13),(157,157,'product_cat','',41,3),(276,276,'product_cat','These games are a great introduction to gaming and learning for toddlers and the like!',35,3),(160,160,'nav_menu','',0,19),(161,161,'category','',0,8),(284,284,'category','',0,0),(283,283,'category','',0,0),(282,282,'category','',0,1),(281,281,'category','',0,0),(280,280,'category','',0,4),(279,279,'category','',0,1),(278,278,'category','',0,7),(174,174,'pa_complexity-level','',0,0),(175,175,'pa_complexity-level','',0,54),(176,176,'pa_complexity-level','',0,75),(177,177,'pa_complexity-level','',0,62),(178,178,'pa_complexity-level','',0,31),(179,179,'pa_complexity-level','',0,9),(180,180,'pa_complexity-level','',0,2),(181,181,'pa_skill-level','',0,0),(182,182,'pa_skill-level','',0,34),(183,183,'pa_skill-level','',0,48),(184,184,'pa_skill-level','',0,83),(185,185,'pa_skill-level','',0,44),(186,186,'pa_skill-level','',0,20),(187,187,'pa_skill-level','',0,4),(188,188,'pa_intensity-level','',0,0),(189,189,'pa_intensity-level','',0,53),(190,190,'pa_intensity-level','',0,74),(191,191,'pa_intensity-level','',0,62),(192,192,'pa_intensity-level','',0,30),(193,193,'pa_intensity-level','',0,12),(194,194,'pa_intensity-level','',0,2),(195,195,'pa_min-players','',0,31),(196,196,'pa_min-players','',0,150),(197,197,'pa_min-players','',0,31),(198,198,'pa_min-players','',0,14),(199,199,'pa_min-players','',0,5),(200,200,'pa_min-players','',0,1),(201,201,'pa_max-players','',0,0),(202,202,'pa_max-players','',0,14),(203,203,'pa_max-players','',0,0),(204,204,'pa_max-players','',0,78),(205,205,'pa_max-players','',0,36),(206,206,'pa_max-players','',0,46),(207,207,'pa_max-players','',0,6),(208,208,'pa_max-players','',0,20),(209,209,'pa_max-players','',0,13),(210,210,'pa_max-players','',0,3),(211,211,'pa_artist','',0,0),(212,212,'pa_designer','',0,2),(213,213,'pa_publisher','As 