mes.com/wp-content/uploads/2016/08/tuesday-knight-games.jpg'),(3879,1132,'order_pa_artist','0'),(3880,1133,'order_pa_artist','0'),(3881,1134,'order_pa_designer','0'),(3882,1135,'order_pa_designer','0'),(3885,1138,'order_pa_artist','0'),(3884,1137,'order_pa_artist','0'),(3899,212,'headline',''),(3900,212,'intro_text',''),(3901,212,'display_title','0'),(3902,212,'display_description','0'),(3903,212,'doctitle',''),(3904,212,'description',''),(3905,212,'keywords',''),(3906,212,'layout',''),(3907,212,'noindex','0'),(3908,212,'nofollow','0'),(3909,212,'noarchive','0'),(3919,53,'_brgm_bottom_txt_cat','<p style=\"text-align: left\">There are a wide variety of board game for parties, ranging from the whimsical to the serious.  <strong>The best party board games keep people involved and interacting from start to finish.</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">Things to consider when choosing a party game:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li style=\"text-align: left\">the number of people in attendance</li>\r\n 	<li style=\"text-align: left\">the maturity level of the attendees</li>\r\n 	<li style=\"text-align: left\">whether or not all attendees are playing</li>\r\n 	<li style=\"text-align: left\">if you want a short game or a long one</li>\r\n 	<li style=\"text-align: left\">if attendees will be drinking or not</li>\r\n 	<li style=\"text-align: left\">do you prefer card games or party games</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">If you like party games you may also like: <a href=\"https://boardgames.com/discover/approved/easy-to-learn/\" target=\"_blank\">mature games</a>, <a href=\"https://boardgames.com/discover/approved/easy-to-learn/\" target=\"_blank\">easy to learn games</a>, <a href=\"https://boardgames.com/discover/approved/highly-interactive/\" target=\"_blank\">highly interactive games</a>, <a href=\"https://boardgames.com/discover/approved/quick-setup/\" target=\"_blank\">games with quick setup,</a> <a href=\"https://boardgames.com/discover/approved/travel-friendly/\" target=\"_blank\">games that travel well</a>, <a href=\"https://boardgames.com/discover/approved/exciting/\" target=\"_blank\">exciting board games</a>, <a href=\"https://boardgames.com/discover/approved/physical-interaction/\" target=\"_blank\">interactive board games</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left\">Additional party game resources: <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Category:Party_board_games\" target=\"_blank\">party game info on wikipedia</a>, <a href=\"https://www.buzzfeed.com/jadayounghatchett/game-on?utm_term=.jc6pKEOWoY#.eoXmgZzqY6\" target=\"_blank\">article on buzzfeed</a>, <a href=\"http://www.wsj.com/articles/the-wicked-humor-of-party-games-1463153007\" target=\"_blank\">article on Wall St Journal</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left\"><em>Have a recommendation for a great party board game or card game? </em> <strong>We strive to provide the best board game selection online. </strong> We\'d love to hear from you!</p>\r\n&nbsp;'),(3921,1149,'order_pa_publisher','0'),(3914,70,'_brgm_cat_headline','Family games'),(3915,70,'_woocommerce_gpf_data','a:5:{s:12:\"availability\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"condition\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"brand\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:0:\"\";s:23:\"google_product_category\";s:0:\"\";}'),(3916,98,'_brgm_bottom_txt_cat','<div>where oh where have you gone toto</div>'),(3917,98,'_woocommerce_gpf_data','a:5:{s:12:\"availability\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"condition\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"brand\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:0:\"\";s:23:\"google_product_category\";s:0:\"\";}'),(3918,98,'_brgm_cat_headline','Science Fiction Board Games And Card Games'),(3922,1150,'order_pa_designer','0'),(3923,1151,'order_pa_designer','0'),(3924,1152,'order_pa_designer','0'),(3925,1153,'order_pa_publisher','0'),(3920,110,'_woocommerce_gpf_data','a:5:{s:12:\"availability\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"condition\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"brand\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"product_type\";s:0:\"\";s:23:\"google_product_category\";s:0:\"\";}'),(3926,1154,'order_pa_max-players','0